ck→真后端模板继续接通救援屏(AccidentEmergencyRescue)内两个不依赖 per-incident mock 的独立面板：\\n\\n1. RescueDutyPanel（值班值守）：onMounted fetchDutyRoster(/emergency/duty)，按真实 DutyMember.shift(白班/夜班) 过滤显示（替代原 rescueDutyPersons 的 slice 假数量）；persons 优先真实、异常回落 rescueDutyPersons mock。模板 v-for person in persons。\\n\\n2. EmergencyAddressBookDialog（应急通讯录）：onMounted fetchEmergencyPhones(/emergency/phones，真实应急号码簿 119/120/110…)。原 mock 为「部门人员通讯录」(orgId/role)，真实为「应急号码簿」(category/number)；语义上号码簿更真实，故把真实 entries 按 category 聚合成组织树（单根+各 category 为分组节点），卡片 role 取 category、phone 取 number。保留原组件变量名(emergencyAddressBookTree/selectedOrgId/contacts/selectedOrgLabel)，模板零改动，搜索与短信/电话/对讲动作按钮保留。\\n\\nvue-tsc 0 错误；HTTP 层 Python 打真后端确认 /emergency/phones(5 条真实)、/emergency/duty(members=2 真实非 dev 回落) 均 code=0。","tree":{"sha":"b6d5418d2bc6958209c3bff8e85f05517943f257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/trees/b6d5418d2bc6958209c3bff8e85f05517943f257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/commits/ff480be09aa91d61246bb74181e03e8fcb06a763","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/ff480be09aa91d61246bb74181e03e8fcb06a763","node_id":"C_kwDOUG1J2doAKGZmNDgwYmUwOWFhOTFkNjEyNDZiYjc0MTgxZTAzZThmY2IwNmE3NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/3ee5c1008a6bdb34dbf863a1082f7bfb98fb1cf5","sha":"3ee5c1008a6bdb34dbf863a1082f7bfb98fb1cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/3ee5c1008a6bdb34dbf863a1082f7bfb98fb1cf5"}],"sha":"ff480be09aa91d61246bb74181e03e8fcb06a763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/ff480be09aa91d61246bb74181e03e8fcb06a763"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/3ee5c1008a6