ents","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:26:35Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:26:35Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"message":"fix(screen): 生产通信共享地图恢复 + 应急创建参数清理\n\nImportant #1 — fm-communication 共享地图回归\n- cesiumMapModes.ROUTE_CESIUM_META 补 productionCommunication 正式 key\n  （沿用 production 模式的 PRODUCTION_MAP_FOCUS）。原 ROUTE_NAME_ALIAS\n  中的 fm-communication 别名仅服务于直接拿 fm-* 名的查表路径，\n  resolveRouteCesiumMeta 收到 useShellRoute 解析后的源名 productionCommunication\n  时无命中，回退 {cesium:false} → SharedCesiumMap 不挂、Cesium 大图消失。\n  验证: /production/communication 直开，iframe 内 canvas=1，\n  卫星影像 + 厂区 / 装置 shape 正常渲染，通讯设备面板显示。\n\nMinor #1 — EmergencyEventListPanel create-param cleanup no-op\n- 改造 onMounted 不再立即 strip ?create=event（直接 strip 经主壳\n  RouterView :key=fullPath 会重 boot wujie 实例，刚打开的弹窗被销毁）。\n- closeCreateModal（用户点取消/关闭）调 clearCreateParamIntent 经\n  route-navigate replace 委托主壳清掉参数，URL 变为 /emergency。\n- handleCreateSubmit 改为「带参进入时单跳 replace 直达处置页」：\n  goToEventDispose 接受新 mode 参数，将 /emergency?create=event 这条\n  历史 entry 整体替换为 fireAccidentRescue / drillEmergencyDetail /\n  typhoonEmergencyDetail，避免双导航竞争，浏览器后退不会重放参数。\n- 弹窗在 submit 之后会再 emit close（EmergencyEventCreateModal\n  104-105 行 emit(''submit'', payload); close();），新增\n  createSubmitInFlight 哨兵抑制 close 路径的二次清理 replace。\n- useAccidentRescueNavigation 增加可选 mode: ''push'' | ''replace''\n  参数（默认 push，向后兼容），goToAccidentRescue /\n  goToDrillEmergencyDetail / goToTyphoonEmergencyDetail /\n  goToEventDispose 均支持。\n\n验证:\n- /emergency?create=event 直开 → 弹窗自动打开可交互，URL 暂留参数；\n- 取消 → 弹窗消失，URL 干净 /emergency，iframe 1；\n- 提交 → 跳到 /fire/rescue?eventId=N，history back 落到清洁 /emergency\n  而非 ?create=event，iframe 1；\n- 列表手工「查看 / 去处置」（无参）仍走原 push 路径不受影响。\n\n门禁: type-check 0 error；lint 0 error / 22 warn（pre-existing）；\nvitest src/shell+router 45 passed。","tree":{"sha":"d9f19c0bddf44ef3dd7866f2d9663c47baabd0f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/trees/d9f19c0bddf44ef3dd7866f2d9663c47baabd0f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/commits/7cd5a2049b93e2f8c3bba44f822fd8a77395c865","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/7cd5a2049b93e2f8c3bba44f822fd8a77395c865","node_id":"C_kwDOUG1J2doAKDdjZDVhMjA0OWI5M2UyZjhjM2JiYTQ0ZjgyMmZkOGE3NzM5NWM4NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/02e45f412908ca0a6d7c282520f3d3d2bec655dd","sha":"02e45f412908ca0a6d7c282520f3d3d2bec655dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/02e45f412908ca0a6d7c282520f3d3d2bec655dd"}],"sha":"7cd5a2049b93e2f8c3bba44f822fd8a77395c865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/7cd5a2049b93e2f8c3bba44f822fd8a77395c865"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/02e45f412908ca0a6d7c282520f3d3d2bec655dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:26:19Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:26:19Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"message":"fix(shared): wujie replace 委托链路 + path 编码 + 清理 :live\n\n- subappRouter: 抽共享 delegate(to, viaReplace) 覆写 router.push / router.replace\n  两路（resolveDelegatedLocation 命中则 emit route-navigate，否则回退 raw*），\n  WujieEventMap[''route-navigate''] 增加 replace?: boolean。\n- main.ts: 监听器按 data.replace 选择 router.replace / router.push。\n- wujieBridge: route-navigate 负载允许 replace，主壳据此决定是否留历史。\n- fmRouteNameMap.serializeParamPath: 替换值改用 encodeURIComponent，\n  保证 facilityId / hazardId 含 ''/'' ''#'' '' '' 等保留字符时 path 仍合法。\n- WujieHost: 移除无效的 :live=\"true\"（wujie-vue3 接受的是 alive），\n  补一句模板注释说明刻意不设 alive（依赖 onBeforeUnmount destroyApp 即用即毁），\n  并在 mountName 上方加 start 竞态 caveat 段（destroyApp 对未启动实例幂等）。\n- 测试: subappRouter.spec 新增 3 例 replace 委托（字符串 / {name,params,query} /\n  pathless {query} 回退本地）；wujieBridge.spec 扩 route-navigate 负载\n  replace 透传 type-check 覆盖；fmRouteNameMap.spec 在既有\n  serializeParamPath it 内补 \"A/B C#D\" → \"A%2FB%20C%23D\" 断言（it 数仍 12）。\n\n门禁: type-check 0 error；lint 0 error / 22 warn（pre-existing）；\nvitest src/shell+router 45 passed。","tree":{"sha":"7e6badc28444acc0a357e75f5e9cb55788f5afc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/trees/7e6badc28444acc0a357e75f5e9cb55788f5afc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/commits/02e45f412908ca0a6d7c282520f3d3d2bec655dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/02e45f412908ca0a6d7c282520f3d3d2bec655dd","node_id":"C_kwDOUG1J2doAKDAyZTQ1ZjQxMjkwOGNhMGE2ZDdjMjgyNTIwZjNkM2QyYmVjNjU1ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/388c42eac08e4f0d52eae615f1b682ffa2583dd5","sha":"388c42eac08e4f0d52eae615f1b682ffa2583dd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/388c42eac08e4f0d52eae615f1b682ffa2583dd5"}],"sha":"02e45f412908ca0a6d7c282520f3d3d2bec655dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/02e45f412908ca0a6d7c282520f3d3d2bec655dd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/388c42eac08e4f0d52eae615f1b682ffa2583dd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:18:32Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:18:32Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"message":"fix(shared): wujie 实例清理改挂 onBeforeUnmount 避免同 URL 重复 Cesium 沙箱","