36 + 玻璃拟态）、目录结构与 S1 对齐\n- 20 位设备编码/ RBAC / WebSocket 三套 OpenSpec 规格与 change 方案就位\n- 5 个占位视图使路由可解析；lint 0 error、type-check 0 error\n\nOpenSpec change: rebuild-scaffold-foundation (T1 of 6)","tree":{"sha":"383fbe7c7366ccbbac1fcae0de694c26d1f500aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/trees/383fbe7c7366ccbbac1fcae0de694c26d1f500aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/commits/6798f8834023fc788d12f925a03e83b551d2dfa3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/6798f8834023fc788d12f925a03e83b551d2dfa3","node_id":"C_kwDOUG1J2doAKDY3OThmODgzNDAyM2ZjNzg4ZDEyZjkyNWEwM2U4M2I1NTFkMmRmYTM","parents":[],"sha":"6798f8834023fc788d12f925a03e83b551d2dfa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/6798f8834023fc788d12f925a03e83b551d2dfa3"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits?per_page=100&page=9&sha=2cffa52e1c04c13579d4e36e74d992d80b456e7a&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A02%3A07.135Z"}');
