ervedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:28.189Z","repositoryId":1349424167,"sha":"94bae277d12fd5179f456874614eb5d8eafcb171"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"tthanhthien-savills","providerType":"User"},"email":"tthanhthien@savills.com.vn","name":"tthanhthien"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-28T09:26:57Z","committedDate":"2026-08-28T09:26:57Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"tthanhthien-savills","providerType":"User"},"email":"tthanhthien@savills.com.vn","name":"tthanhthien"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:28.189Z","repositoryId":1349424167,"sha":"724bc2cf9015e044bdf27ef536b6e96c0c32438f"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:28.189Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/commits/59ca0f444c4ca5b6f0ad81ff56039f917a394b79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:10:42Z","email":"thanhle0526@gmail.com","name":"learn-with-will"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:10:42Z","email":"thanhle0526@gmail.com","name":"learn-with-will"},"message":"Add 8 advanced lessons, quizzes, and the course manifest\n\nProduction performance: the real cost of JavaScript, reducing main-thread\nwork, resource hints and priorities, HTTP/2/3 and CDNs, rendering\nstrategies, service workers and the Cache API, monitoring with field RUM,\nand an end-to-end audit capstone. Generate course-manifest.json (24 entries,\nordered 8/8/8) from the lesson front-matter.\n\nValidated: 24 lessons ↔ 24 quizzes ↔ 24 manifest entries; all required H1\nsections present and in order; exactly 5 tags each; ≥6 flash cards; code\nfences limited to html/css/javascript/bash/text; quiz schema per type with\nall five types used. tsc -b clean; production build and preview smoke test\n(index, manifest, lesson, quiz, favicon, deep-link) all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvwvFGptD5Lri2RyYFDPhQ","tree":{"sha":"a49f8f54e46ce1ee25cd38e2ebae18ec04d99c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/git/trees/a49f8f54e46ce1ee25cd38e2ebae18ec04d99c06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/git/commits/59ca0f444c4ca5b6f0ad81ff56039f917a394b79","verification":{"payload":"tree a49f8f54e46ce1ee25cd38e2ebae18ec04d99c06\nparent 6d0252e7d2d6b049605ce69872e40866a7ac0bf2\nauthor learn-with-will <thanhle0526@gmail.com> 1789193442 +0000\ncommitter learn-with-will <thanhle0526@gmail.com> 1789193442 +0000\n\nAdd 8 advanced lessons, quizzes, and the course manifest\n\nProduction performance: the real cost of JavaScript, reducing main-thread\nwork, resource hints and priorities, HTTP/2/3 and CDNs, rendering\nstrategies, service workers and the Cache API, monitoring with field RUM,\nand an end-to-end audit capstone. Generate course-manifest.json (24 entries,\nordered 8/8/8) from the lesson front-matter.\n\nValidated: 24 lessons ↔ 24 quizzes ↔ 24 manifest entries; all required H1\nsections present and in order; exactly 5 tags each; ≥6 flash cards; code\nfences limited to html/css/javascript/bash/text; quiz schema per type with\nall five types used. tsc -b clean; production build and preview smoke test\n(index, manifest, lesson, quiz, favicon, deep-link) all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvwvFGptD5Lri2RyYFDPhQ\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKmYtP/p\ngRl5Kbz47PEcvJ1YM7r15aTrEGogXjeGk1cgiExfAkAT4q/QesPMHpM3rd24ScjzS+dOM010yBTh\nxAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/learn-with-will/web-performance/commit/59ca0f444c4ca5b6f0ad81ff56039f917a394b79","node_id":"C_kwDOUG6UJ9oAKDU5Y2EwZjQ0NGM0Y2E1YjZmMGFkODFmZjU2MDM5ZjkxN2EzOTRiNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/learn-