nresponsive srcset, lazy loading); font-loading strategy; HTTP caching;\ncompression and minification; and eliminating render-blocking resources.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvwvFGptD5Lri2RyYFDPhQ\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP6KlBCC\npbsbU6UwqQPqfrRfWdZrqcZNra1TtYwgl2hA/FGoy7xLhCUsDkHmxpjKLcjOGb3c+9xQU3L/asA+\ngw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/learn-with-will/web-performance/commit/6d0252e7d2d6b049605ce69872e40866a7ac0bf2","node_id":"C_kwDOUG6UJ9oAKDZkMDI1MmU3ZDJkNmIwNDk2MDVjZTY5ODcyZTQwODY2YTdhYzBiZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/learn-with-will/web-performance/commit/cfc17c3091f844fc84102848cf169c477f15e5f4","sha":"cfc17c3091f844fc84102848cf169c477f15e5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/commits/cfc17c3091f844fc84102848cf169c477f15e5f4"}],"sha":"6d0252e7d2d6b049605ce69872e40866a7ac0bf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/commits/6d0252e7d2d6b049605ce69872e40866a7ac0bf2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/commits/cfc17c3091f844fc84102848cf169c477f15e5f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:26:15Z","email":"thanhle0526@gmail.com","name":"learn-with-will"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:26:15Z","email":"thanhle0526@gmail.com","name":"learn-with-will"},"message":"Add 8 beginner lessons and quizzes\n\nFundamentals and measurement literacy: why performance matters, how the\nbrowser loads a page, the critical rendering path, the Core Web Vitals and\ntheir thresholds, lab vs field data, Lighthouse, the network waterfall, and\nperformance budgets. Each lesson follows the fixed section structure with a\n5-6 question quiz across all five question types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvwvFGptD5Lri2RyYFDPhQ","tree":{"sha":"4db18031cde277c43c2e196d0027d89d12d12669","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/git/trees/4db18031cde277c43c2e196d0027d89d12d12669"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/git/commits/cfc17c3091f844fc84102848cf169c477f15e5f4","verification":{"payload":"tree 4db18031cde277c43c2e196d0027d89d12d12669\nparent caa02e781c341bf77d06cfafb15c8a9573415fb4\nauthor learn-with-will <thanhle0526@gmail.com> 1789129575 +0000\ncommitter learn-with-will <thanhle0526@gmail.com> 1789129575 +0000\n\nAdd 8 beginner lessons and quizzes\n\nFundamentals and measurement literacy: why performance matters, how the\nbrowser loads a page, the critical rendering path, the Core Web Vitals and\ntheir thresholds, lab vs field data, Lighthouse, the network waterfall, and\nperformance budgets. Each lesson follows the fixed section structure with a\n5-6 question quiz across all five question types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvwvFGptD5Lri2RyYFDPhQ\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLlBbzBr\nfQpPOCdBeNwk7vr2P1DMMqS58c/s9QS7BCoHPQsd3VdP6xzyAMyWIFr39MYxFa62x9LnCq3sXa/X\nzQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/learn-with-will/web-performance/commit/cfc17c3091f844fc84102848cf169c477f15e5f4","node_id":"C_kwDOUG6UJ9oAKGNmYzE3YzMwOTFmODQ0ZmM4NDEwMjg0OGNmMTY5YzQ3N2YxNWU1ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/learn-with-will/web-performance/commit/caa02e781c341bf77d06cfafb15c8a9573415fb4","sha":"caa02e781c341bf77d06cfafb15c8a9573415fb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/commits/caa02e781c341bf77d06cfafb15c8a9573415fb4"}],"sha":"cfc17c3091f844fc84102848cf169c477f15e5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/commits/cfc17c3091f844fc84102848cf169c477f15e5f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/commits/caa02e781c341bf77d06cfafb15c8a9573415fb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:11:14Z","email":"thanhle0526@gmail.com","name":"learn-with-will"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:11:14Z","email":"thanhle0526@gmail.com","name":"learn-with-will"},"message":"Scaffold Web Performance course from Learning-Portal shell\n\nReuse the shared React 19 + Vite + TS course shell and reskin it for the\nWeb Performance topic:\n\n- Palette anchored on the Core Web Vitals \"good\" green (#0CCE6B) resolving\n  into a cyan/teal accent; new speed-gauge brand mark + favicon.\n- Unique localStorage keys (web-performance-learning-progress / -theme) and\n  package name to avoid cross-course collisions on the shared origin.\n- PrismJS limited to html/css/javascript/bash; level blurbs, titles, hero,\n  and search hints rewritten for the topic.\n- Authoring contract with source list and a topic-specific\n  anti-hallucination checklist (CWV thresholds, INP-not-FID, lab vs field,\n  caching directives, render-blocking rules).\n\nLessons, quizzes, and the manifest are added in follow-up commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvwvFGptD5Lri2RyYFDPhQ","tree":{"sha":"311271ded2c122c18c5514e92295e76de2aecc7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/git/trees/311271ded2c122c18c5514e92295e76de2aecc7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/learn-with-will/web-performance/git/commits/caa02e781c341bf77d06cfafb15c8a9573415fb4","verification":{"payload":"tree 311271ded2c122c18c5514e92295e76de2aecc7a\nparent 94bae277d12fd5179f456874614eb5d8eafcb171\nauthor learn-with-will <thanhle0526@gmail.com> 1789128674 +0000\ncommitter learn-with-will <thanhle0526@gmail.com> 1789128674 +0000\n\nScaffold Web Performance course from Learning-Portal shell\n\nReuse the shared React 19 + Vite + TS course shell and reskin it for the\nWeb Performance topic:\n\n- Palette anchored on the Core Web Vitals \"good\" green (#0CCE6B) resolving\n  into a cyan/teal accent; new speed-gauge brand mark + favicon.\n- Unique localStorage keys (web-performance-learning-progress / -theme) and\n  package name to avoid cross-course collisions on the shared origin.\n- PrismJS limited to html/css/javascript/bash; level blurbs, titles, hero,\n  and search hints rewritten for the topic.\n- Authoring contract with source list and a topic-specific\n  anti-hallucination checklist (CWV thresholds, INP-not-FID, lab vs field,\n  caching directives, render-blocking rules).\n\nLessons, quizzes, and the manifest are added in follow-up commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvwvFGptD5Lri2RyYFDPhQ\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQG8gbEJe\nUAiPPWtVavGPTUHB7k7bL57BERC82SuVewm3QfnLQKyAK89/ASxqqvoH+ffIyp0g4y+So3lQJpv4\nOgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/learn-with-will/web-performance/commit/caa02e781c341bf77d06cfafb15c8a9573415fb4","node_id":"C_kwDOUG6UJ9oAKGNhYTAyZTc4MWMzNDFiZjc3ZDA2Y2ZhZmIxNWM4YTk1NzM0MTVmYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/learn-with-will/web-performance/commit/94bae277d12fd5179f456874614eb5d8eafcb171","sha":"94bae277d12fd5179f456874614eb5d8eafcb171","url":"https://