name":"Kevin Dinkel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:21:30Z","email":"1225857+dinkelk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kevin Dinkel"},"message":"Add the smallest-scope rule to the style skill\n\nDeclare every helper, variable, and use clause in the smallest region\nthat needs it, so the compiler enforces the structure. Single-caller\nhelpers nest inside their caller, shared helpers sit above their first\nuse, and use clauses stay local unless several subprograms need them.","tree":{"sha":"a43f3732661bc90aedd728ddc63830d585902dff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/a43f3732661bc90aedd728ddc63830d585902dff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/bc037d95b31b2fb2ec53680d946dd876aa656078","verification":{"payload":"tree a43f3732661bc90aedd728ddc63830d585902dff\nparent 58c39703d9994a803ab68d7aaa9b57e59c35c0de\nauthor Kevin Dinkel <1225857+dinkelk@users.noreply.github.com> 1789053690 -0600\ncommitter Kevin Dinkel <1225857+dinkelk@users.noreply.github.com> 1789053690 -0600\n\nAdd the smallest-scope rule to the style skill\n\nDeclare every helper, variable, and use clause in the smallest region\nthat needs it, so the compiler enforces the structure. Single-caller\nhelpers nest inside their caller, shared helpers sit above their first\nuse, and use clauses stay local unless several subprograms need them.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEECKpbHEBcQzNBwSNuGBFH/ftYwk4FAmqiyvoACgkQGBFH/ftY\nwk5uzA//R3Hb7F1OVtwNvGeLSx2CNxRJKTDeDuALjPMCHM5RDpz9HHyqzHCJa0ME\nv9c1fzMM9uFfZjkm1v5FleFN+GHXin/GEHGncEkCQ6QqdI8owiG6xenNiLgw1BZg\nYEL9W04Bxf01V0mCN8eJg+5gqmjfmtkXInYXdfd0MsS+ATrND0dyGyBMcT/eEMMT\nZ5+WZ+qWUFp6U0ITfnaOdCABq8HcOAQ8JczQDZkRiV4otp0GiP5acCeInRHwrBWt\nq+7OZD3BtvCknvWFAXSnhNFPB4k3VfqeWWyP2fR0/JJpvi3VN5VeyP+pmuJsgpvd\nZb047txSukX7dzH2KgUWOez3N/2ZFuiq0pgFq/HRQJCFgVT0vyg7Rtdv8DFhK7WG\nBQiqzZgKvQacvktc2+F1Oj2NEENloUtU9sGYIqWaZqueaLvoBioWzbC2BJ65+bnJ\nDiqjC