5:43:10Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"docs: document admt project selection for agents (tracks Jbsco/admt#37)\n\nadmt Jbsco/admt#37 gives tty-less callers a per-session active-project\npin keyed on the harness session id, refuses key-less tty-less callers\ninstead of silently following the shared global, and stops a headless\n`env use` from moving that global. The skills reference `admt env use`\nonly as a command -- they never tell an agent how to select its project.\n\nAdd a \"Selecting your project\" subsection to CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md\n(resolution ladder, harness-id auto-detection, the key-less refusal, the\nno-global-move guarantee) and a project-selection note to the headless\nSUBAGENT_CONTRACT.\n\nDRAFT: gated on Jbsco/admt#37 shipping -- the content describes behavior not\nyet in released admt. Hold until Jbsco/admt#37 merges; update in lockstep if its\ndesign changes.","tree":{"sha":"815d58206f39f722e4bb974d69a714d7377cd158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/815d58206f39f722e4bb974d69a714d7377cd158"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/7e423d0e609a434451998e3cea3dc7562812e998","verification":{"payload":"tree 815d58206f39f722e4bb974d69a714d7377cd158\nparent 03e56b7bc21c6259dd337ac95921d2095574b81d\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785217390 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785217390 -0600\n\ndocs: document admt project selection for agents (tracks Jbsco/admt#37)\n\nadmt Jbsco/admt#37 gives tty-less callers a per-session active-project\npin keyed on the harness session id, refuses key-less tty-less callers\ninstead of silently following the shared global, and stops a headless\n`env use` from moving that global. The skills reference `admt env use`\nonly as a command -- they never tell an agent how to select its project.\n\nAdd a \"Selecting your project\" subsection to CLAUD