_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/be82124fa9c1cb9c0509fe3eb4313d45aaea77b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T21:40:15Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:19:13Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Schematize telemetry example and correct selector regeneration note\n\nTwo repo-wide hygiene findings from the external review, both validated\nbefore fixing. A COSMOS telemetry item name used as the ''project naming\nlayers may rename'' example matched a real project''s generated telemetry\ndictionary verbatim (confirmed against the generating repo) -- both\noccurrences now state the rule without a concrete renamed form, since\nthe actionable instruction was always ''take the exact name from\ncmd.txt/tlm.txt''. The selector''s regeneration section claimed the\nrouting table can be regenerated: the script (verified by reading it)\nemits only a flat frontmatter index and cannot produce the hand-curated\nrouting sections; the section now says exactly that, with the correct\nscript path and without the pinned generation date.","tree":{"sha":"34b3ffce290f3e9255e2d6522f2d34ecd32859e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/34b3ffce290f3e9255e2d6522f2d34ecd32859e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/be82124fa9c1cb9c0509fe3eb4313d45aaea77b8","verification":{"payload":"tree 34b3ffce290f3e9255e2d6522f2d34ecd32859e5\nparent d6212d798b8a1db65a1e4e0528dc2b890d62f60f\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783806015 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071953 -0600\n\nSchematize telemetry example and correct selector regeneration note\n\nTwo repo-wide hygiene findings from the external review, both validated\nbefore fixing. A COSMOS telemetry item name used as the ''project naming\nlayers may rename'' example matched a real project''s generated telemetry\ndictionary verbatim (confirmed against the generating repo) -- both\noccurrences now state the rule without a concrete renamed form, since\nthe actionable instruction was always ''take the exact name from\ncmd.txt/tlm.txt''. The selector''s regeneration section claimed the\nrouting table can be regenerated: the script (verified by reading it)\nemits only a flat frontmatter index and cannot produce the hand-curated\nrouting sections; the section now says exactly that, with the correct\nscript path and without the pinned generation date.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLZMACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNco6dA/9FdWBYPcgJ1uRXfp16KEH3iMOOs6T5+TB6p3ocbgDKEz56AyKoGxgiT6C\n55PergYZMuiigDyeK7kSEAi5ppOB6XJp+EPhlhsC+mqi1mjfdr33MxK2I1rbfQdz\nRdGa6ecKqZPoKtmpN/mZAyrpBKDJkxEGwQrip0a0GMclkWpCpuamuSHpy61k2xIu\njJ9eHBWg3wUkRFsXeuUCECCQWuE20gKD0taRNcBZQOEv1gPsy3l/CvVGPrK+oH89\n3F6qnnzIF9u5YZVCNp34wbS71rpzsXCrO85WYSxpGDY2nAN8Ji4iYBmEoF6NS2wb\nbOoZd0vHdeIRq+TSGQgco8CIOQzLaucZZOKQ7rcvzELGJEqoCAyttDLcIgvFz9lG\nbg0/Us9CAgoH9sfKjfMLxMWKu4e