06?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/e5714290e587191736cf6bac214a0022a6508309/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T20:10:15Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:19:12Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Add raw-address and headless-Renode watchpoint runbooks\n\nE3 campaign gap (mentioned across iterations 2, 3, 5): agents that tried\na data watchpoint had to improvise the whole harness. The Watchpoints\nsection only showed Ada-symbol-scoped examples (watch self.the_count),\nwith no way to watch a bare absolute address and no Renode-stub\noperational flow. Added: (1) watching a raw absolute address via\nset language c + a C cast, framed as the localizer for a wrong value\nwith no source-visible writer; (2) the headless-Renode stub flow -- start\npaused (StartGdbServer <port> false), attach, watch, continue without a\nracing monitor start; the gdb -batch async-stop trap; and a\nrenode-native watchpoint-hook alternative with the enum-argument caveat.","tree":{"sha"