github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/5486c2a7fe8e0a8908ec15b7387c7c43777a4aac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T17:41:01Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:19:12Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Harden bench launch form and LCH-global print fallback\n\nTwo E2 fix-confirm outcomes. First, the runbook''s launch form died in\ncontainer-exec contexts (emulator attached to the exec''s stdin dies or\nhangs at shell teardown) -- the working form needs setsid and\n</dev/null, observed live when a confirm agent''s first launch hit the\nharness timeout and its recovery form matched this exactly; the pkill\nself-match rule was also read-but-violated twice under cleanup\npressure, so the kill is now a copy-paste one-liner marked\nuse-verbatim-separately. Second, printing the handler''s occurrence\nglobal by its Ada-qualified name fails in gdb (third independent\nmention, threshold reached): documented the nm mangled/exported-symbol\nfallback, type-overlay print, and raw x/ decode.","tree":{"sha":"283c57f1184a5682e666ec2935781c12ff95037e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/283c57f1184a5682e666ec2935781c12ff95037e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/5486c2a7fe8e0a8908ec15b7387c7c43777a4aac","verification":{"payload":"tree 283c57f1184a5682e666ec2935781c12ff95037e\nparent da4bbf8c737889fe25aa82507ffb26764e7a7589\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783791661 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071952 -0600\n\nHarden bench launch form and LCH-global print fallback\n\nTwo E2 fix-confirm outcomes. First, the runbook''s launch form died in\ncontainer-exec contexts (emulator attached to the exec''s stdin dies or\nhangs at shell teardown) -- the working form needs setsid and\n</dev/null, observed live when a confirm agent''s first launch hit the\nharness timeout and its recovery form matched this exactly; the pkill\nself-match rule was also read-but-violated twice under cleanup\npressure, so the kill is now a copy-paste one-liner marked\nuse-verbatim-separately. Second, printing the handler''s occurrence\nglobal by its Ada-qualified name fails in gdb (third independent\nmention, threshold reached): documented the nm mangled/exported-symbol\nfallback, type-overlay print, and raw x/ decode.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLZEACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcr3kRAA2G10ahendLnKARim4Fm7sHhjUYDMMBMVQA7fC8v58FV/VKjIKbbW1AyG\ngk/0k5vShmUKRLDxGK4Gmc5XDlXAxWRGlBGZYOk2jZ4MdR0ulJ/Vt61TZpQIg2K6\nVlkcoucdw4+u3sOLqivtqM+oWGZ5ngr7DUu3DctpANsdEffbxhKQ8iKQWKJFkkOu\n/l1H5Uf3qnhSdtnDH7VGEDTLK/jWXvafuZ6jHtavC4yUaKkB4IPR5SRebpbnC8Px\nPNY/YVW27GHMUm5oLGPW6M1MT4IUbPbQiarmQpG/sA60Y7rFzR1KvuAFJ1WWMUdQ\ndM/+eUVATHdIY25HZgcSWXdAa3+ci7uSVR86yTHQr6NiAplCDIX9M9yI7uzyDTtR\nTWkPhn1WzhGz4AN9YPnUrp3vibJLjRUR34PIiEGPhIV2RoPaJaH8TmLWonjTZrwD\nD0QgYuwhGNEErMUtZRz5QFlchtulGEZyqrb0w9ZMKE8AVnTXlgRcg9FwNJrRSBtq\nmKqrNbShCO2+n2gko52r/Dloigz8yT29fA3DOpSB/FNtMSg2zMJUvp+N8/Kqcg5Y\n0hg+cgR+XUzztkDMDtBI9PS3rny7+BNm9fhNGatjvVhhIW978hIgYnJUh3TdzqR4\ndF15t+9