/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/afc0c1da3f2269e50ead9525eebebbd64b976643/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T17:22:02Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:19:11Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Add raw-capture trace extraction to the post-mortem reference\n\nE2 campaign catch, three mentions: the symbolizer and its docs assume\npasted address text, but a broadcast LCH occurrence arrives as binary\npackets in a UART capture -- three agents independently improvised\noffset arithmetic and byte-swapping to get the addresses out, one\ninitially misreading a byte-swapped depth word as corruption. New\nsubsection: derive field offsets from the open packed-record YAML,\nexpect big-endian words (with the byte-order tell spelled out), locate\nthe exception-name ASCII and read consecutive in-code-range words, then\nsymbolize per the existing flow.","tree":{"sha":"5d993cc828d80ed9617b8fec70f9cdec04ea9f57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/5d993cc828d80ed9617b8fec70f9cdec04ea9f57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/afc0c1da3f2269e50ead9525eebebbd64b976643","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d993cc828d80ed9617b8fec70f9cdec04ea9f57\nparent 2be5156213f0652b06af831b4905ef16315c6b28\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783790522 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071951 -0600\n\nAdd raw-capture trace extraction to the post-mortem reference\n\nE2 campaign catch, three mentions: the symbolizer and its docs assume\npasted address text, but a broadcast LCH occurrence arrives as binary\npackets in a UART capture -- three agents independently improvised\noffset arithmetic and byte-swapping to get the addresses out, one\ninitially misreading a byte-swapped depth word as corruption. New\nsubsection: derive field offsets from the open packed-record YAML,\nexpect big-endian words (with the byte-order tell spelled out), locate\nthe exception-name ASCII and read consecutive in-code-range words, then\nsymbolize per the existing flow.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLZAACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcq/ig/+Iw8bnNpFvGXrLrObDBzKCNW4go7kkd4LXV7eXRHRd/wwSHGLXm86f44+\n065+iFP5zbC/3O8o4h9LAPhVob88KnV5U2drCmHKRgN8HiK3O8TihyWoVk/1L77K\nu4981GwSKKvoKvrA+LU9p/9WyPWSTEzrkMisq4JD5BCqfvZcK7dbnwXXYUZfFNSl\nH6QtU2r+Xx7rjb9kh8CnsdcCHAxL3u8FoGEM1YdkUcnYMLMsoFRNgDWEWFjupDTO\nXQRvvjb+uoyhbOWcHedA3dlWBx3+CekNrTIk4NMnk94GxXwOZUsQe8xOQC37VJox\n2eOIgLqeHfgBaTJrnzK4vFofDLb7nEIJ5O6xW4CTo1DRX2g9bgYNdPVqRE8a1Z+D\n0x+baxNoJkAuGcRXCQP4XYxaQOyx01+M75FLWTANk+eMAG/UTAzsMZ+E4IVuZUhK\n+dzj5gSbNSOq8CSPwRuwi2bVUXJDb3wEomTwdNrVrKbtWBlDvnBt1UDJOEIzHHpM\nJUiW4ATHd/2L5+R9vonJlCGkyGeEUnyuLK6i9cp7mJ/A+gZ0XQaWUlHalWm/NPmY\nAvVgTheqweR/MkGgDUI+Ss21yhXFgOXRC+yU+uYKuNBQlyH7NPkSSGE7cVhIvghY\nAYBzhbWt18bsODCC4JU7l4+Yvrwd+ZJGIl9of32COY56MJVU4Lw=\n=qRVc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T19:09:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_ur