1cb1e973b80e9262478a9b72887b25c0141","sha":"1bd3f1cb1e973b80e9262478a9b72887b25c0141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/1bd3f1cb1e973b80e9262478a9b72887b25c0141"}],"sha":"e0cbb1114a4fd5039ac5ee4ad6ce38ab3f84fbe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/e0cbb1114a4fd5039ac5ee4ad6ce38ab3f84fbe7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/1bd3f1cb1e973b80e9262478a9b72887b25c0141/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T23:31:55Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:19:10Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Fix selector routing shadow for running-assembly debugging\n\nCampaign catch (D1A-S2, 2/3 iterations): the combinations row ''Debug\nrunning assembly (events, queues) -> assembly-dev (runtime ref)''\ntextually captures ''telemetry stalls in a running assembly'' tasks and\nrouted cold-start agents AWAY from adamant-debugging -- they never saw\nthe diagnosis standard or task-triage guidance and diagnosed by git\narchaeology + restart-and-stare. The one agent that routed to\nadamant-debugging attached to the live process and passed clean. Row\nsplit: runtime MISBEHAVIOR (hangs/stalls/crashes/watchdog) -> debugging\nprimary; telemetry INTERPRETATION (events/queues) -> assembly-dev\nprimary. Each lists the other as secondary.","tree":{"sha":"730120ea9eccf80f1eb5fd02f8b8cf621020f3b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/730120ea9eccf80f1eb5fd02f8b8cf621020f3b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/1bd3f1cb1e973b80e9262478a9b72887b25c0141","verification":{"payload":"tree 730120ea9eccf80f1eb5fd02f8b8cf621020f3b6\nparent feb2b1ea9678fa161ea66f3bfc99df30a821e0e6\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783726315 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071950 -0600\n\nFix selector routing shadow for running-assembly debugging\n\nCampaign catch (D1A-S2, 2/3 iterations): the combinations row ''Debug\nrunning assembly (events, queues) -> assembly-dev (runtime ref)''\ntextually captures ''telemetry stalls in a running assembly'' tasks and\nrouted cold-start agents AWAY from adamant-debugging -- they never saw\nthe diagnosis standard or task-triage guidance and diagnosed by git\narchaeology + restart-and-stare. The one agent that routed to\nadamant-debugging attached to the live process and passed clean. Row\nsplit: runtime MISBEHAVIOR (hangs/stalls/crashes/watchdog) -> debugging\nprimary; telemetry INTERPRETATION (events/queues) -> assembly-dev\nprimary. Each lists the other as secondary.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLY8ACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcpbuhAAv0z8NU/v3TMd/CVtfPpkfR1kiqNHHsgc8yARov1+xW+4H2fMpyrz7oUz\nMVfws3kX2HpiN2yTD7+SbMvsUZwWv2zpJBb4MkH08gZ3a8xfTmw2n70LYOn9rpJd\nXgQ87uVahqz4lQK9cRRzUIwXHaj1araCk74RyXthtnrTukLTi+K92jVLjuIqaZ4