/api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/bd4d8c5c87e33394021c4578b0896099c13d59a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T21:03:29Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:19:09Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Add diagnosis standard: demonstrated, not inferred\n\nCampaign catch (D1A-S1, stable 3/3 under sparse prompts): agents read\nthe skill yet reported source-inferred root causes with zero runtime\ndemonstration -- the skill''s triggers were stuck-conditioned (\"when\nassertions/prints are not enough\"), so source-reading counted as done\nand the escalation ladder never fired. New standard at the top of Quick\nStart: root cause complete only when the mechanism is shown at runtime\n(values at the defect), with the reason (falsifies convincing theories).","tree":{"sha":"19a90e939346c911df8a07d5772429086fc6b774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/19a90e939346c911df8a07d5772429086fc6b774"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/bd4d8c5c87e33394021c4578b0896099c13d59a5","verification":{"payload":"tree 19a90e939346c911df8a07d5772429086fc6b774\nparent 8592fe477828ef468f5af078b6871beb318fee71\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783717409 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071949 -0600\n\nAdd diagnosis standard: demonstrated, not inferred\n\nCampaign catch (D1A-S1, stable 3/3 under sparse prompts): agents read\nthe skill yet reported source-inferred root causes with zero runtime\ndemonstration -- the skill''s triggers were stuck-conditioned (\"when\nassertions/prints 