riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lasp/adamant-skills/commit/6bfa342a8874377bcbd7be8027fe276dd7ce6d1a","node_id":"C_kwDOUHIrOdoAKDZiZmEzNDJhODg3NDM3N2JjYmQ3YmU4MDI3ZmUyNzZkZDdjZTZkMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lasp/adamant-skills/commit/f46e2ae7efb544b7785eee856c0c1d3cc6e08d8d","sha":"f46e2ae7efb544b7785eee856c0c1d3cc6e08d8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/f46e2ae7efb544b7785eee856c0c1d3cc6e08d8d"}],"sha":"6bfa342a8874377bcbd7be8027fe276dd7ce6d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/6bfa342a8874377bcbd7be8027fe276dd7ce6d1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/f46e2ae7efb544b7785eee856c0c1d3cc6e08d8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:44:12Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:16:03Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Harden archetype D asset guidance and add capture patterns\n\nTwo lessons confirmed on a live deployment of an archetype-D tool:\n\n- Asset bundling: vite `?inline` on a dynamic import builds clean but\n  silently emits a hashed asset file plus a URL missing the tool''s base\n  path (query string leaked too) -- a 404 that only appears deployed.\n  Guidance extended: binary assets ship as base64 text + `?raw` +\n  `data:` URI, same pattern as text assets; new Common Error 11 with\n  the inspect-the-built-output check.\n- In-scene annotations and video capture: canvas-drawn labels as\n  sprites (constant screen size, depthTest off) instead of DOM/CSS2D\n  overlays, because `canvas.captureStream()` records only the canvas;\n  dependency-free WebM recording via MediaRecorder with per-second\n  chunk flush and the hidden-tab throttling caveat.\n\nLine counts refreshed (617 -> 641).","tree":{"sha":"b51bb66772d465d98207ed44a94a22d215ce6603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/b51bb66772d465d98207ed44a94a22d215ce6603"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/f46e2ae7efb544b7785eee856c0c1d3cc6e08d8d","verification":{"payload":"tree b51bb66772d465d98207ed44a94a22d215ce6603\nparent 9898c1409f6f5ba4cba79df55272eb3437cb9185\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783615452 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071763 -0600\n\nHarden archetype D asset guidance and add capture patterns\n\nTwo lessons confirmed on a live deployment of an archetype-D tool:\n\n- Asset bundling: vite `?inline` on a dynamic import builds clean but\n  silently emits a hashed asset file plus a URL missing the tool''s base\n  path (query string leaked too) -- a 404 that only appears deployed.\n  Guidance extended: binary assets ship as base64 text + `?raw` +\n  `data:` URI, same pattern as text assets; new Common Error 11 with\n  the inspect-the-built-output check.\n- In-scene annotations and video capture: canvas-drawn labels as\n  sprites (constant screen size, depthTest off) instead of DOM/CSS2D\n  overlays, because `canvas.captureStream()` records only the canvas;\n  dependency-free WebM recording via MediaRecorder with per-second\n  chunk flush and the hidden-tab throttling caveat.\n\nLine counts refreshed (617 -> 641).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLY4ACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcoD/g//a6RmCclkb5zOQ7OuFe4VkylQTGrcY/sWiGGMFsah+i6GLlkXo4Fq0W04\ns2fE/9qEfUMqgLYpUPxlDgcS/AgG9iO0wRoJ1eb/cAcDgoRc04kwKULKOZl0XosW\nGENS5zUDyhs/yEFLSzMbt3TTdOJeEUYFNGESqYqUTMgRLc+rAhFFvxkxor7KM/3A\ny0Dck0tXgCwLmzQVsWYO5dfnTDwpI1c+hDEjCJ43fw4tfu6mxFRox5opYdUTptZ+\n/xjsD6b2fOeJkhckdXX23m8s8OxHLATPDuEkcdSRewwpKN9DWsP0tSuXe1yWr6pZ\nVPB4LylIwEpAdwJ0aaa1RjpgXueXbHF/jITyC7oxsY97r5/rLzbvhwVPdPZKnbnQ\nxp59rDsZzBi2RVqZQ2q4Vh2leNIWEwf/Qpf0Ldn9mteTQ2QQWnwd2WZC8NBoedSs\n4zGqZRdbZNYcU2lOfQsyHyk0XyCKiu3nLsnt7/qOuM9Wm2v/wVR9O9p5+URldOzA\nmApaXQlMqWbTLcgm4oXuFyeDAe/FqKWnIW1FGZuH5DwDggXhlVMQ5pkLv+VoGnNF\nKkRe8ey923T6UQcONk7ZnRpNRw70jeZuPTA9F8XycNbeEHSI/gR+TfQTrcnswKPr\n9TejLfcXmSCeP9OTJ+V73+O9cafA2ygh+v3wThkr1H3LuufKdIM=\n=shJx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T19:09:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lasp/adamant-skills/commit/f46e2ae7efb544b7785eee856c0c1d3cc6e08d8d","node_id":"C_kwDOUHIrOdoAKGY0NmUyYWU3ZWZiNTQ0Yjc3ODVlZWU4NTZjMGMxZDNjYzZlMDhkOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lasp/adamant-skills/commit/9898c1409f6f5ba4cba79df55272eb3437cb9185","sha":"9898c1409f6f5ba4cba79df55272eb3437cb9185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/9898c1409f6f5ba4cba79df55272eb3437cb9185"}],"sha":"f46e2ae7efb544b7785eee856c0c1d3cc6e08d8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/f46e2ae7efb544b7785eee856c0c1d3cc6e08d8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/9898c1409f6f5ba4cba79df55272eb3437cb9185/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T15:21:23Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:16:03Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Add archetype D: live 3D view of an external binary feed\n\nLessons from a proven rung-4 implementation (binary ZMQ->WS bridge +\nthree.js tool decoding protobuf in-browser), each validated end-to-end\non a live deployment:\n\n- New archetype D in tool-archetypes-and-widgets.md: binary websocket\n  frames (opcode 0x2) with latest-frame replay on attach; in-network\n  upstream addressing; protobufjs runtime parse of a vendored .proto\n  via raw-text import; bundled mesh assets via raw import + parse (no\n  tools-bucket asset-URL resolution); dynamic import() code-splitting\n  for heavy assets with a primitive fallback; mesh decimation before\n  committing; single parent-group basis rotation instead of\n  per-component axis swaps (a y/z swap is a det(-1) reflection);\n  unmount hygiene (rAF cancel, AbortController listeners, scene\n  disposal, forceContextLoss); distinct no-feed vs decode-failure\n  states; native-extension dependency caveat for python bridges;\n  verify-the-feed-not-the-render diagnosis; browser-WebGL portability\n  rationale.\n- SKILL.md: Common Errors 9 (WebGL/animation leak on remount -- browser\n  context cap ~16) and 10 (frozen render = verify the upstream feed);\n  checklist item for unmount teardown + code-split assets; reference\n  pointer updated.\n- streaming-and-data-access.md: ground-truth section extended to\n  external (non-COSMOS) feeds -- capture the upstream in-network and\n  diagnose feed vs render separately.\n- Line counts refreshed in CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md (537 -> 617).","tree":{"sha":"8785f576cebb1344571c38e7906564df1625ef55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/8785f576cebb1344571c38e7906564df1625ef55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/9898c1409f6f5ba4cba79df55272eb3437cb9185","verification":{"payload":"tree 8785f576cebb1344571c38e7906564df1625ef55\nparent 3106e2e7665d4dc7bfd4ee4fd2fad92b72e6b5b1\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783524083 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071763 -0600\n\nAdd archetype D: live 3D view of an external binary feed\n\nLessons from a proven rung-4 implementation (binary ZMQ->WS bridge +\nthree.js tool decoding protobuf in-browser), each validated end-to-end\non a live deployment:\n\n- New archetype D in tool-archetypes-and-widgets.md: binary websocket\n  frames (opcode 0x2) with latest-frame replay on attach; in-network\n  upstream addressing; protobufjs runtime parse of a vendored .proto\n  via raw-text import; bundled mesh assets via raw import + parse (no\n  tools-bucket asset-URL resolution); dynamic import() code-splitting\n  for heavy assets with a primitive fallback; mesh decimation before\n  committing; single parent-group basis rotation instead of\n  per-component axis swaps (a y/z swap is a det(-1) reflection);\n  unmount hygiene (rAF cancel, AbortController listeners, scene\n  disposal, forceContextLoss); distinct no-feed vs decode-failure\n  states; native-extension dependency caveat for python bridges;\n  verify-the-feed-not-the-render diagnosis; browser-WebGL portability\n  rationale.\n- SKILL.md: Common Errors 9 (WebGL/animation leak on remount -- browser\n  context cap ~16) and 10 (frozen render = verify the upstream feed);\n  checklist item for unmount teardown + code-split assets; reference\n  pointer updated.\n- streaming-and-data-access.md: ground-truth section extended to\n  external (non-COSMOS) feeds -- capture the upstream in-network and\n  diagnose feed vs render separately.\n- Line counts refreshed in CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md (537 -> 617).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLY0ACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcqN5g//XDMuzo+4pIGPgtiZJzTPAwMEOriUKSeqVXxRk1qKpSloCUrfEUeBPSJa\nnA7B+8rS1KMW+SIxBmDxsEYfkFlWsH