per-event identity, account for tool dedup and display\ncap). Runtime-derived while verifying the event-log tool against a live 7.2\nstack.","tree":{"sha":"5ae0a3ed795958871b199dfd3ae593e32d02bbf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/5ae0a3ed795958871b199dfd3ae593e32d02bbf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/3106e2e7665d4dc7bfd4ee4fd2fad92b72e6b5b1","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ae0a3ed795958871b199dfd3ae593e32d02bbf0\nparent b1f5b7c718c9e51f30f32098c147ada5f29120a0\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783456341 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071763 -0600\n\nDocument ground-truth verification for streaming tool feeds\n\nAdds a \"Verifying a tool''s feed against ground truth\" section to the\nstreaming/data-access reference: query QuestDB directly (/exp or /exec, the\nITEM__C columns, keyword-name quoting, JSON-text list values) as the definitive\nrecord of what decom wrote; the StreamingWebSocketApi convenience path with its\nbounded-query hang caveat; and a second-consumer option. Plus a reconciliation\ntip (match on stable per-event identity, account for tool dedup and display\ncap). Runtime-derived while verifying the event-log tool against a live 7.2\nstack.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLY0ACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcoKBhAAz3MbU2KyHTNS11ZREB4Pq+OOI1yDs7r5mL0M8Zn4X80b0qOwRZPCLd5K\nQzPT/XwQaZPJk69bmboungLimt2mJOyfWA6H0GS6pZ32rscTFHHuLuj6LdBiEwnp\nGLwy6H8zEEzEHnGkG4n5meW30cN2eRT9B/1tbYks4Cif+aV9nACdKQBqtU79ENBQ\nOgIQjURohdKbq0Eppxb7eylL2jWJBSxb4UpdlPtHA3MXtc+bsZN5J+2HL05AGMtF\nYc+iKKNZQGO0YO0ibsfZnLesb+Hil5qM2x9KH64wT7g+/a6qCEB8U7tRqXyQgIoM\nv40VAvbQjjs1RxDRizg6j7YqNPgaDtjXpWZ4tB0EeLPIVn0DILie1BoF5un+hkt5\nQ0LUYvoFnlmsQJsZf8pXv34p8QczQjPCRFEjU3sMWVWx0weOD5lkkXe1VXn/0Dtl\nUuaQT8EueKzFRuIrRFIyPzSp4ZKGNRSNGafQgaFAOFqNmFN38nOYHiSzjmUr+d4b\n2x5uZSY0sq1YH0GO5bEyI