ttps://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/b1f5b7c718c9e51f30f32098c147ada5f29120a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T15:38:08Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:16:03Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Add adamant-cosmos-tool-creation skill for COSMOS web UI tools\n\nFills the gap where no skill covered extending the COSMOS web UI. Structured\naround a decision ladder so the lightest option is chosen first: reuse a\nbuilt-in tool, a Telemetry Viewer screen, a custom screen WIDGET, a full\nsingle-spa TOOL, or a TOOL plus a backing MICROSERVICE.\n\nSKILL.md covers the ladder, tool anatomy (TOOL modifiers, WINDOW modes,\ntools-bucket serving), the vite/single-spa build contract (externals, systemjs\noutput, single-spa lifecycle), the data-feed decision (JSON-RPC CVT polling vs\nwebsocket streaming vs a custom microservice endpoint), auth/scope, and\npersistent client state with a clear watermark.\n\nreferences/streaming-and-data-access.md holds the server-side data mechanics\n(streaming message shape, decom topic retention, TSDB storage of converted\nvalues, logged->realtime handoff). references/tool-archetypes-and-widgets.md\nholds the three tool archetypes (append-only log stream, single-packet detail\nview, external-I/O terminal via a backing microservice), the custom WIDGET\nbuild + built-in widget catalog, and the MICROSERVICE keyword reference --\nincluding the security caveat that raw-websocket microservices are\nunauthenticated.\n\nGrounded in the framework source (tool/widget/microservice model parsers,\nbuilt-in catalogs, first-party vite configs), the OpenC3 custom-tool docs, and\nthe real EMA/renode tool corpus. Content genericized per the repo''s\nzero-project-names rule. Registered in the selector, README, and the\nCLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md inventory tables. Cold-start validation still pending.","tree":{"sha":"c6978793fc1e9829def72f002678df79b7828f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/c6978793fc1e9829def72f002678df79b7828f6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/b1f5b7c718c9e51f30f32098c147ada5f29120a0","verification":{"payload":"tree c6978793fc1e9829def72f002678df79b7828f6e\nparent e12d074fc688380b4761363b6abecb136ed2a8e9\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1783438688 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1785071763 -0600\n\nAdd adamant-cosmos-tool-creation skill for COSMOS web UI tools\n\nFills the gap where no skill covered extending the COSMOS web UI. Structured\naround a decision ladder so the lightest option is chosen first: reuse a\nbuilt-in tool, a Telemetry Viewer screen, a custom screen WIDGET, a full\nsingle-spa TOOL, or a TOOL plus a backing MICROSERVICE.\n\nSKILL.md covers the ladder, tool anatomy (TOOL modifiers, WINDOW modes,\ntools-bucket serving), the vite/single-spa build contract (externals, systemjs\noutput, single-spa lifecycle), the data-feed decision (JSON-RPC CVT polling vs\nwebsocket streaming vs a custom microservice endpoint), auth/scope, and\npersistent client state with a clear watermark.\n\nreferences/streaming-and-data-access.md holds the server-side data mechanics\n(streaming message shape, decom topic retention, TSDB storage of converted\nvalues, logged->realtime handoff). references/tool-archetypes-and-widgets.md\nholds the three tool archetypes (append-only log stream, single-packet detail\nview, external-I/O terminal via a backing microservice), the custom WIDGET\nbuild + built-in widget catalog, and the MICROSERVICE keyword reference --\nincluding the security caveat that raw-websocket microservices are\nunauthenticated.\n\nGrounded in the framework source (tool/widget/microservice model parsers,\nbuilt-in catalogs, first-party vite configs), the OpenC3 custom-tool docs, and\nthe real EMA/renode tool corpus. Content genericized per the repo''s\nzero-project-names rule. Registered in the selector, README, and the\nCLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md inventory tables. Cold-start validation still pending.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLY0ACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcogexAAm8C1I4XeBjGYK3UWr3TafUu67l6wAGb67cp/mS5dSvLDVFVWsRISVqRb\nIDUIGbeQflHSIWERcT4fks9HRIlFE5r6iaNDNrtQCvQB2EOcX4CpAzIVWX4euqvI\nEUPW+9N7V8w14cUp/Kc5NgLqkn+6EQ7Dr1WfVfazUL/eZvd6kTEUG0VqxOllMMck\n8i07EkFW1Tov76Z8wwvdPVzCUyOVw4AROgJCHWBRaAPz8BMgsrF9rWqO+hb05KUo\nU0sNMmeQ8evcHLj2rPZ0vVy+Y2gtPSPdCiNETbMInj7S8p3IXpMPOWPvNc9Z60kk\n7bZuGEzZHLh4vR9774wqM9wyNNoaM65mlUtRrpsAdnFN8RWXr/eCTopgt0dVZSBj\nwfrBbNWcYsxKByZFSjHzIBzwU+hz5iZlYMLyTniZC9wmyhdZJT/UfJq/f4cE56IO\n+j8Lwtk7QpPPTyvSmPov+iyDAmlbgsj2B1W4wxL2sjN3qXN4KC1I2HE7eFpnL/Dc\ncWHn09Jd6BvRIIkiOGJcgc0/Mxq7VoMatn7lD4Tur99xoMMX9DlkHMnbqJJIZpWG\nrFu/serCRrU/K0SNjEGQDk4sRUD/Cxm1EBywAV69TdlqxG90MAJTDZ52caA5ym79\noIX73BTo8fZx/z/5c9pzG23uqKipcsMmHnw2tiKf1oaWzHLO53U=\n=REbn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T19:09:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: