https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/5a436a7bcda1365d78b2459f8768ca654e8f6433/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T19:35:38Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T19:57:40Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"adamant-regression-suite: add black-box Python regression-suite skill\n\nNew generic skill for authoring Python regression suites against a running Adamant assembly through its COSMOS command/telemetry interface, treating the flight software as a black box: do not read .ads/.adb/.cpp/.c/.h source; derive the entire test surface from the YAML models, the generated COSMOS cmd/tlm dictionary, and the generated ground-side Python.\n\nShips SKILL.md plus references/ (contract-derivation, enforcement, suite-patterns) and scripts/block_source.py -- a PreToolUse hook that enforces the source-blind rule, closing the shell-cat bypass a Read-deny rule alone leaves open. Composes with adamant-cosmos-testing and adamant-cosmos-minio rather than duplicating them.","tree":{"sha":"29fe07a43b2296f5faa845843e20568f8809d73f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/29fe07a43b2296f5faa845843e20568f8809d73f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/5a436