line counts + current model\n\nThe cache-economics appendix carried stale per-skill line counts (they\ndrifted as skills grew) and named Opus 4.6 in the pricing examples.\n\n- Skill-size table + Three-Tier table: refreshed to current counts, matching\n  the inventory in CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md (testing 2647, component-dev 2302,\n  ...); CLAUDE.md ~300 -> ~170, selector SKILL.md ~285 -> ~357.\n- Pricing example: Opus 4.6 -> Opus 4.8 (current flagship; same $5.00 / $0.50\n  per-1M rates, so the per-hit savings math is unchanged). Sonnet 4.6 and\n  Haiku 4.5 rows were already current.\n\nToken estimates and cache mechanics (TTL, read/write ratios) left as-is --\nstill accurate.","tree":{"sha":"5945de4ec6d8cbf8563ce9f4c76b847432620cda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/5945de4ec6d8cbf8563ce9f4c76b847432620cda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/809d5f194f6b5f140ca8798bd5c5ee7bad911415","verification":{"payload":"tree 5945de4ec6d8cbf8563ce9f4c76b847432620cda\nparent 0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1782842975 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1782842975 -0600\n\nModernize README cache appendix: refresh line counts + current model\n\nThe cache-economics appendix carried stale per-skill line counts (they\ndrifted as skills grew) and named Opus 4.6 in the pricing examples.\n\n- Skill-size table + Three-Tier table: refreshed to current counts, matching\n  the inventory in CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md (testing 2647, component-dev 2302,\n  ...); CLAUDE.md ~300 -> ~170, selector SKILL.md ~285 -> ~357.\n- Pricing example: Opus 4.6 -> Opus 4.8 (current flagship; same $5.00 / $0.50\n  per-1M rates, so the per-hit savings math is unchanged). Sonnet 4.6 and\n  Haiku 4.5 rows were already current.\n\nToken estimates and cache mechanics (TTL, read/write ratios) left as-is --\nstill accurate.\n","reason":"valid","signature":