rents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lasp/adamant-skills/commit/0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01","sha":"0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01"}],"sha":"809d5f194f6b5f140ca8798bd5c5ee7bad911415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/809d5f194f6b5f140ca8798bd5c5ee7bad911415"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:48:17Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:49:02Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Split AGENTS.md into vendor-neutral AGENTS.md + SUBAGENT_CONTRACT.md\n\nAGENTS.md had been the subagent handoff contract -- a misuse of the\nfilename. Per the agents.md convention (https://agents.md/) AGENTS.md is the\nvendor-neutral counterpart to CLAUDE.md, readable by any coding agent or\ntool. Reviewer flagged this on PR Jbsco/adamant-agent-skills#10.\n\n- AGENTS.md: rewritten as the vendor-neutral instructions -- the same build\n  rules, admt usage, and skill inventory as CLAUDE.md, with Claude-specific\n  framing neutralized (load-order/cache claims made tool-conditional). An\n  agent reading only AGENTS.md is fully equipped.\n- SUBAGENT_CONTRACT.md (new): the handoff contract (old AGENTS.md content\n  verbatim) -- the scoped posture for an orchestrated/headless build subagent\n  (no questions, no git, output filtering, quality gates). Cross-references\n  repointed to AGENTS.md.\n- CLAUDE.md: \"Agent Configuration Files\" section now describes the three files.\n- README.md: Top-Level Files table updated to match the three-file layout.\n- Refresh skill-inventory line counts (all-files-per-skill-dir) across\n  AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, and the README headline; total ~22500 -> ~25000.","tree":{"sha":"dc735a7e6e858e2aeb239bd002108c96fa7a4058","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/dc735a7e6e858e2aeb239bd002108c96fa7a4058"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01","verification":{"payload":"tree dc735a7e6e858e2aeb239bd002108c96fa7a4058\nparent 63caca864bf5b58b6fea7b7b195087b33b609b33\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1782841697 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1782841742 -0600\n\nSplit AGENTS.md into vendor-neutral AGENTS.md + SUBAGENT_CONTRACT.md\n\nAGENTS.md had been the subagent handoff contract -- a misuse of the\nfilename. Per the agents.md convention (https://agents.md/) AGENTS.md is the\nvendor-neutral counterpart to CLAUDE.md, readable by any coding agent or\ntool. Reviewer flagged this on PR Jbsco/adamant-agent-skills#10.\n\n- AGENTS.md: rewritten as the vendor-neutral instructions -- the same build\n  rules, admt usage, and skill inventory as CLAUDE.md, with Claude-specific\n  framing neutralized (load-order/cache claims made tool-conditional). An\n  agent reading only AGENTS.md is fully equipped.\n- SUBAGENT_CONTRACT.md (new): the handoff contract (old AGENTS.md content\n  verbatim) -- the scoped posture for an orchestrated/headless build subagent\n  (no questions, no git, output filtering, quality gates). Cross-references\n  repointed to AGENTS.md.\n- CLAUDE.md: \"Agent Configuration Files\" section now describes the three files.\n- README.md: Top-Level Files table updated to match the three-file layout.\n- Refresh skill-inventory line counts (all-files-per-skill-dir) across\n  AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, and the README headline; total ~22500 -> ~25000.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLYsACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcrRMxAAr5cUTSKBjdw2lJudI2Rrp7Qe9Hk1sHShDW+3/+EOytJurC/ZYuWV5RMP\nX1HTc77tdQ4W1D5h7w9e5RHfDXM+cETjCf0eWnhwmm8zJUhiB3wsqGyNQfyCm8+3\nYffgA70N95LcKlrv23pfdSy8bJGbrgXS13ZfThbA2L4gIJJLLUY0EENLGj7wqzlV\neinGiJ6VNy7T5RHgvUsmALt32VQgw82mfxx8YNZyPV/SgFQu/Mjs/paqtn5nejDY\nczhOxGLsyiOOn1euYURMbpVHs6+T41GC5qvonTt/NuvrrfCJzZXCxuzZ9XNFhKXa\nyXOpXA1VNNkWKKnRayDLvp3AUBtiPmxPOc3UiK16PIcTweSNVJpnjI704eavnCig\nLyNOkUoy2FODz9siagMqW1FyUaCayeDXRKk3EEf4ELrwIB38BOhNawr/gG6zvrw9\n38hbF0UiqtrzINeoIyArFQY4Gz5WF7ouPG4RcplN3y4F+ie4+N6fH8JKUgVQjKi4\nTEPaH7PZf9UsR4IoZvaptOFRJcktX/cv6aalDpNNJwCgwMrrLih00cDdWzVOUp6g\nM+607oDKdV5pyCzPtZKXh2v2bMVF2oGPU+rwslB2FKLBkQ2PkBZNGNkZ3Si9IW3Z\nXLbFe1t1bwNUfygxxI2AGtM37j8ElOiarXT4D8H/suYp3fhaI5Y=\n=bhJb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T19:09:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lasp/adamant-skills/commit/0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01","node_id":"C_kwDOUHIrOdoAKDBhZTFiYTJiNTc0NWIyOGFhOTY0NDNjMWM0NTYzOThlZjVjYmNjMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lasp/adamant-skills/commit/63caca864bf5b58b6fea7b7b195087b33b609b33","sha":"63caca864bf5b58b6fea7b7b195087b33b609b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/63caca864bf5b58b6fea7b7b195087b33b609b33"}],"sha":"0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/0ae1ba2b5745b28aa96443c1c456398ef5cbcc01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTI0MTA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/63caca864bf5b58b6fea7b7b195087b33b609b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T23:48:35Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:49:02Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"Rename adamant-cosmos-minio -> adamant-cosmos-suite-results; rewrite for COSMOS 7.x\n\nCOSMOS 7.0 replaced MinIO with versitygw (service openc3-minio -> openc3-buckets, no mc/local client), so suite-result retrieval changed. Per the authoritative method in mission_softsim''s softsim.sh, the version-stable path runs the suite via ''openc3cli script run'' inside openc3-cosmos-cmd-tlm-api (unbuffered) and gates on the streamed output + process exit code -- no object-store retrieval. Rewrite the skill around that stream method, keep the Script Runner REST API as a version-dependent alternative, and document the 6.x MinIO vs 7.x versitygw object-store rename (service/volume/credentials/bucket-URL). Rename the skill off ''minio''; update the selector routing entry + CLAUDE.md/README inventory.","tree":{"sha":"01fed22817e0af9b9300812f20714e86c3af1ebc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/01fed22817e0af9b9300812f20714e86c3af1ebc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/63caca864bf5b58b6fea7b7b195087b33b609b33","verification":{"payload":"tree 01fed22817e0af9b9300812f20714e86c3af1ebc\nparent debc6a7b2b637c7c26ebdede619baa81d3be02d5\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1782517715 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1782841742 -0600\n\nRename adamant-cosmos-minio -> adamant-cosmos-suite-results; rewrite for COSMOS 7.x\n\nCOSMOS 7.0 replaced MinIO with versitygw (service openc3-minio -> openc3-buckets, no mc/local client), so suite-result retrieval changed. Per the authoritative method in mission_softsim''s softsim.sh, the version-stable path runs the suite via ''openc3cli script run'' inside openc3-cosmos-cmd-tlm-api (unbuffered) and gates on the streamed output + process exit code -- no object-store retrieval. Rewrite the skill around that stream method, keep the Script Runner REST API as a version-dependent alternative, and document the 6.x MinIO vs 7.x versitygw object-store rename (service/volume/credentials/bucket-URL). Rename the skill off ''minio''; update the selector routing entry + CLAUDE.md/README inventory.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLYsACgkQ5dlyl7D/\nNcoeXhAAjjDAt72nb6WIXVKj8Jbo7lsBpTWINrDeL7aV/bbnikxHkpvGy0hrZ6pP\nV3WR9qjN14STqwyN7FzbydjW9WxWdDPQSkSSJ3Lvph0zS4wz/YK+9TxnpxrjG6Bg\n3lGjg4FEGG5eWEDqURrc4A4nIZa7Fv42Yahx14/kKWQOclv4cs20yULtQt+iew5H\nAcpXDP67lho1a60J5J1en/FMTlcXr3Hb2s6Zsvb8K07PvD6IOATRBbF+LXYW25l4\n+0cPIEypoRenp+Xe/5vfiKnJsD0+Ipe7rWNUWeOyUXQcOC3bcj8x3cxtNf8krsnm\ny9/RybkKWupR5sOYVCg577/f64mRh0mvxn0cxxijGiksI2Rq5z5n30JE7oHSGrSh\n6WaofMMmZGuvTurKKs4hKQg89RucZfR0JqMrtx2PFeCm1szucyWHl2u22tWGnli6\nzzcHLY+nEuoLYE9NRccdZH3Hzb63Rl1elx4X3Fhvntw1WHeF2w0CgbuHOxxosjAU\ngk9q8VL5kWPeiWgJB8Jak4n0+UnaIDswL6nrV8OamQ8nbFilszB4iWhiDZ+IEqZl\nEKAaNsh9xHqTqz+Vw8p3oC95XaUocjOnAVpD14scXfczDhFC4De2GQjLs2OFuxB8\nZoz4EEDZttU5zaLVke/GmsYEoc9o5p3OPW8L9VvVydKeE/0xF9I=\n=Q/Ye\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T19:09:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90524106?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jbsco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jbsco","id":90524106,"login":"Jbsco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwN