om/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/commits/debc6a7b2b637c7c26ebdede619baa81d3be02d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T22:08:12Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:49:02Z","email":"90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jacob Seman"},"message":"adamant-skill-campaign: scope the iteration reset (clean -fdx the scratch, not the project)\n\nConvergence burn-in showed plain ''git clean -fd'' leaves git-ignored build/ artifacts behind, so the next cold start is not pristine. Refine the reset guidance: ''git checkout -- <shared-file-edited>'' then ''git clean -fdx <scratch_dir>'' (-x clears build/), scoped to the scratch path -- never a project-wide ''-fdx'', which would also delete git-ignored essentials like docker/.env.","tree":{"sha":"5462f6316620389a749d13fa6bc9c138679b26af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/trees/5462f6316620389a749d13fa6bc9c138679b26af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lasp/adamant-skills/git/commits/debc6a7b2b637c7c26ebdede619baa81d3be02d5","verification":{"payload":"tree 5462f6316620389a749d13fa6bc9c138679b26af\nparent 50ebbadc38fdd5bc48068d773071fc165da32064\nauthor Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1782511692 -0600\ncommitter Jacob Seman <90524106+Jbsco@users.noreply.github.com> 1782841742 -0600\n\nadamant-skill-campaign: scope the iteration reset (clean -fdx the scratch, not the project)\n\nConvergence burn-in showed plain ''git clean -fd'' leaves git-ignored build/ artifacts behind, so the next cold start is not pristine. Refine the reset guidance: ''git checkout -- <shared-file-edited>'' then ''git clean -fdx <scratch_dir>'' (-x clears build/), scoped to the scratch path -- never a project-wide ''-fdx'', which would also delete git-ignored essentials like docker/.env.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEw4OO+fgBg9dPCrHf5dlyl7D/NcoFAmqTLYsAC