","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:46.764Z","repositoryId":1349850623,"sha":"7f1752a5200b99a7d57b893f95062bd94e2e10ac"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:46.764Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commits/514201d611c602b76629416c8efdb61b88afb226/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T17:19:27Z","email":"janton@cienciay.fe.edu.ec","name":"janton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T17:19:27Z","email":"janton@cienciay.fe.edu.ec","name":"janton"},"message":"validacion reporte","tree":{"sha":"227c3bb3305cd4d99defee3910587a96fdd8d4d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/git/trees/227c3bb3305cd4d99defee3910587a96fdd8d4d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/git/commits/514201d611c602b76629416c8efdb61b88afb226","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commit/514201d611c602b76629416c8efdb61b88afb226","node_id":"C_kwDOUHUV_9oAKDUxNDIwMWQ2MTFjNjAyYjc2NjI5NDE2YzhlZmRiNjFiODhhZmIyMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commit/0a65331d1526fdaa1037c7380cf808a5d31a9851","sha":"0a65331d1526fdaa1037c7380cf808a5d31a9851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commits/0a65331d1526fdaa1037c7380cf808a5d31a9851"}],"sha":"514201d611c602b76629416c8efdb61b88afb226","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commits/514201d611c602b76629416c8efdb61b88afb226"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commits/0a65331d1526fdaa1037c7380cf808a5d31a9851/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:54:17Z","email":"cary.tnas@hotmail.com","name":"Carina Torres"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:59:50Z","email":"cary.tnas@hotmail.com","name":"Carina Torres"},"message":"Anadir canchaNombre a las respuestas de ms-reservas\n\nReservaResponseDTO incluye ahora el nombre de la cancha, resuelto contra\nms-canchas. El campo canchaId se mantiene: quitarlo romperia a los\nmicrofrontends que ya lo consumen, asi que el cambio es aditivo.\n\nms-reservas solo persiste canchaId; el nombre vive en canchas_db, otra base\nde datos, por lo que hace falta una llamada HTTP. Se implementa con un\nCanchasAclAdapter propio siguiendo el patron anti-corrupcion ya usado en\nms-reportes: ExternalCanchaDTO refleja el contrato de ms-canchas y queda\naislado del dominio de reservas.\n\nEsto activa la propiedad app.services.canchas-url, que existia en\napplication.yml y en docker-compose.yml pero que ningun codigo consumia.\n\nDos decisiones de diseno:\n\n- Las listas resuelven el catalogo completo en una sola llamada indexada\n  por id, en lugar de una peticion HTTP por reserva. Mapear N reservas\n  cuesta una llamada, no N.\n\n- El nombre es un dato de presentacion, asi que el adaptador degrada en vez\n  de propagar el fallo: ante RestClientException registra un warning y\n  devuelve null. Verificado deteniendo ms-canchas: listar sigue devolviendo\n  200 y crear 201, con canchaNombre en null. Hacerlo fallar acoplaria la\n  disponibilidad de las reservas a la del catalogo por un campo informativo.\n\nNo valida que la cancha exista ni su horario: un canchaId inexistente sigue\ncreando la reserva, con canchaNombre en null. Validar es una decision\ndistinta, con acoplamiento temporal, y queda pendiente.\n\nActualiza README.md y CLAUDE.md, que describian esta llamada como una\nvalidacion que nunca existio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a5713d45a05c8343f60423ae57b3e41c535cb82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/git/trees/7a5713d45a05c8343f60423ae57b3e41c535cb82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/git/commits/0a65331d1526fdaa1037c7380cf808a5d31a9851","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commit/0a65331d1526fdaa1037c7380cf808a5d31a9851","node_id":"C_kwDOUHUV_9oAKDBhNjUzMzFkMTUyNmZkYWExMDM3YzczODBjZjgwOGE1ZDMxYTk4NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commit/4176238ebd57482da5ede8b697939da16b07172c","sha":"4176238ebd57482da5ede8b697939da16b07172c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commits/4176238ebd57482da5ede8b697939da16b07172c"}],"sha":"0a65331d1526fdaa1037c7380cf808a5d31a9851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commits/0a65331d1526fdaa1037c7380cf808a5d31a9851"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/commits/4176238ebd57482da5ede8b697939da16b07172c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:35:15Z","email":"janton@cienciay.fe.edu.ec","name":"janton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:35:15Z","email":"janton@cienciay.fe.edu.ec","name":"janton"},"message":"mapeo de nombre de cancha","tree":{"sha":"6eaa530874ca67c809c106c76429edd57ae1c763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/git/trees/6eaa530874ca67c809c106c76429edd57ae1c763"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carytnas/Final-project-g1-micro-services-fronted/git/commits/4176238ebd57482da5ede8b697939da16b07172c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"