g within the chatdashboard app.\n\n* Remove mock API delay simulation\n\nThis removes artificial latency from the overview dashboard route components and the mock product API helpers. The dashboard pages no longer wait on synthetic delays, and product CRUD/search lookups return immediately, making the UI behave closer to a real backend and improving local development speed.","tree":{"sha":"bfb6a233599561bd9ce0f3395069c7f06c11695a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/git/trees/bfb6a233599561bd9ce0f3395069c7f06c11695a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/git/commits/c49a1a11157bb1d31735189701104f8f7168efd5","verification":{"payload":"tree bfb6a233599561bd9ce0f3395069c7f06c11695a\nparent e518323b794964840f8acd364726c480af0fddec\nauthor BREWFLOCK <brewflocktechnologies@gmail.com> 1791435603 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791435603 +0530\n\nEnhance UI and add coverage for new routes (#11)\n\n* Engage setup\n\n* Added coverage for engage routes\n\n* Archives route ui setup\n\n* Refactor sidebar and header ui\n\n* UI Improvements\n\n* Added test files\n\n* Optimized 3 layout design for archive and chat routes\n\n* Improved side bar ui\n\n* Refactor gif icons\n\n* Mark GIF icon as client component\n\nAdded the `use client` directive to the GIF icon entry point so it can be used in client-side rendering within the chatdashboard app.\n\n* Remove mock API delay simulation\n\nThis removes artificial latency from the overview dashboard route components and the mock product API helpers. The dashboard pages no longer wait on synthetic delays, and product CRUD/search lookups return immediately, making the UI behave closer to a real backend and improving local development speed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxyNTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdsIQAD8tUN9Ve2U8yYA+XZ6l3Rvu\nb4JXFt0bBX5jYFepAjITeAWRaId0Rlh/JqDH8KTmnCRPRgk5n2A+Ljz3o9bfw+GN\nkxOQJ4k5s2vGTQJOOQwdZ