logies-ui","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/commit/195375153e9825ea6bdb577dd5dbf5d5f424b73c","node_id":"C_kwDOUHdoRtoAKDE5NTM3NTE1M2U5ODI1ZWE2YmRiNTc3ZGQ1ZGJmNWQ1ZjQyNGI3M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/commit/f2a45aacf83a58073d0aa672fc6a7ee4e8cab6d1","sha":"f2a45aacf83a58073d0aa672fc6a7ee4e8cab6d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/commits/f2a45aacf83a58073d0aa672fc6a7ee4e8cab6d1"}],"sha":"195375153e9825ea6bdb577dd5dbf5d5f424b73c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/commits/195375153e9825ea6bdb577dd5dbf5d5f424b73c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287257987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brewflocktechnologies-ui","id":287257987,"login":"brewflocktechnologies-ui","node_id":"U_kgDOER81gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/commits/f2a45aacf83a58073d0aa672fc6a7ee4e8cab6d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T20:19:32Z","email":"brewflocktechnologies@gmail.com","name":"brewflock"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T20:19:32Z","email":"brewflocktechnologies@gmail.com","name":"brewflock"},"message":"Add chatplatform microservices platform\n\nFour services plus shared platform infrastructure, all live-verified:\n\n- chatservice (Spring Boot 4.0.8, JPA/REST): tenant CRUD, OpenAPI contract,\n  Pact contract tests, BootUI-advisor hardening\n- accountservice (Spring Boot 4.1.1, WebFlux/R2DBC/gRPC): same shared tenant\n  table, protobuf v1 contract, resiliency (graceful shutdown, health bridge,\n  UNAVAILABLE/ABORTED error classification), business metrics\n- chatdashboardbff (Spring Boot 4.1.1, WebFlux): REST facade over\n  accountservice gRPC, per-call deadlines, read retries, Playwright E2E API\n  tests, OpenAPI contract\n- allocationservice (Go 1.27, gRPC/pgx/sqlc): hexagonal architecture,\n  idempotent creates, optimistic concurrency, keyset pagination, goose\n  migrations, distroless image, 10 ADRs\n\nShared: single-project aggregate compose (localrun/) over per-concern\ncompose files (Postgres, SonarQube, grafana/otel-lgtm), per-service\nDockerfiles, 95% JaCoCo gates, OTel traces/metrics/logs across all\nservices, Flyway migrations, AGENTS.md conventions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb43ec052ac76ffd65807f2c01cb92a32208da98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/git/trees/bb43ec052ac76ffd65807f2c01cb92a32208da98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brewflocktechnologies-ui/chatplatform/git/commits/f2a45aacf83a58073d0aa672fc6a7ee4e8cab6d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287257987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brewflocktechnologies-ui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/us