ycle §3.3 切换事务防空白窗口，行为正确），但宿主舞台没在 failed 态\n收起 outlet，视觉上成了\"旧内容 + 报错\"混排。\n\n改动：两宿主 Stage 的 #tx-stage 在 failed 态 display:none/v-show 隐藏——\n失败覆盖层独占舞台，观感对齐原示例 errorBoundary 替换内容；切回正常应用时\noutlet 恢复，A 留原位语义不受影响（实测 purehtml→missing→React 切回正常）。\n\n验证（Pages 模拟副本 + 本地副本）：两宿主 × 4 应用节点全部显示内容；\npurehtml→missing 旧内容隐藏；missing→React 恢复挂载。","tree":{"sha":"5c756b4246e36375a4654b04d25a3fe57d41aa1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/5c756b4246e36375a4654b04d25a3fe57d41aa1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/9ca1b659bba69dab37038b02a411e5e2b443657b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/9ca1b659bba69dab37038b02a411e5e2b443657b","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDljYTFiNjU5YmJhNjlkYWIzNzAzOGIwMmE0MTFlNWUyYjQ0MzY1N2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/11a6b7be1fb294d2d344603f7348e226bcbc2a4c","sha":"11a6b7be1fb294d2d344603f