键再生成 docs/demo-qiankun\n- main-vue/vite.config.ts base/outDir 随环境变量（outDir 透传绝对路径，\n  vite 相对 outDir 以工程根解析的坑）\n- 两宿主 apps.ts siblingShell 链接改由 BASE_URL 推导（部署前缀自动跟随）；\n  main-vue/App.vue footer 硬编码链接同票收敛\n- serve.mjs history fallback 泛化：宿主路由段匹配不再限定根路径，\n  本地可完整伺服带前缀的部署副本\n\n文档站侧：\n- docs/demo-qiankun/ 构建副本（对齐 demo-wujie 惯例，产物入库）\n- docs/404.html（Pages 站点级）：宿主是 pushState 路由而 Pages 无 history\n  回退——深链/刷新识别 demo-qiankun/hosts/* 后送回对应宿主入口，其余路径\n  显示普通 404\n- docs/_navbar.md 占位替换为真实链接\n\n验证（本地 Pages 模拟：静态伺服 + 未命中回退 404.html，与 GitHub Pages 行为\n一致）：\n- /taixu/demo-qiankun/hosts/main-react/ 总览渲染正常\n- 侧栏进 React：客户端路由 /taixu/.../react、子应用挂载、舞台状态头就位\n- sibling 链接跳 main-vue（base 推导正确）\n- 深链 /main-vue/react 直达 -> 404.html location.replace 回宿主入口（实测\n  ERR_ABORTED 即 replace 抢占导航，落点为 main-vue/ 总览）\n- missing 页单层失败覆盖层（原生出口已关），失败入口 URL 正确带部署前缀\n- 本地 dist（无前缀变体）重建回归通过","tree":{"sha":"364c73e93f49b72acd5eeed21a003116aee2884b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/364c73e93f49b72acd5eeed21a003116aee2884b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/11a6b7be1fb294d2d344603f7348e226bcbc2a4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github