t，宿主自己的 errorBoundary 覆盖层叠在其上。spec §6.1 本就把内置出口定义\n为 degradeUI 降级策略，但实现无 opt-out，宿主想接管错误呈现做不到。\n\n改动：\n- RecoveryConfig.errorOutlet?: boolean（默认 true，向后兼容）：false 时跳过\n  renderErrorOutlet，app/error 事件与 monitor.capture 派发不受影响\n- 负向验证：开关改坏（恒渲染）新用例红灯，还原绿灯；既有 ErrorOutlet 默认渲染\n  用例保持绿\n- spec 同步：lifecycle-management.md §6.1 补 errorOutlet 语义\n- tests/mount-transaction.test.ts 新用例：出口未渲染 + app/error 照常派发\n\n测试：npm run verify 全绿（typecheck + 361 cases）。\n发布：@taixu/core@0.1.3（changeset linked 组与 adapter-angular@0.1.2 对齐，\npatch 落在组最高版本之上，跳过 0.1.2；changelog 仅含本票改动）。","tree":{"sha":"adb3f833bc2937bdd3f09f8a9db2460d38f080ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/adb3f833bc2937bdd3f09f8a9db2460d38f080ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/890326d0968f4cc4e05829850884f6998f730444","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/890326d0968f4cc4e05829850884f6998f