6Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"chore(release): @taixu/core 0.1.1\n\n0.1.0 发布点（37d9fbc）之后 core 源码的 3 处实质修复，随本版首次上架：\n- vue2-adapter：Vue 2 $mount(el) 是替换语义，直接替换 lifecycle 容器致容器\n  引用失效（suspend/switch DOM 管理错位）→ 容器内建挂载点挂载\n- vue2-adapter：Vue 2.7 config 是只读 getter，整体赋值抛 ''Cannot set property\n  config'' → 改为就地改 errorHandler 属性\n- keepAlive：lz-string 改 default import 解构（CJS named export 在 ESM 下\n  不可靠），tsup 同步移除 noExternal 内联（产物 190.9KB，依赖走 dependencies）\n\n适配器 4 包零变更不重发：dependencies 为 @taixu/core ^0.1.0，自动命中 0.1.1","tree":{"sha":"825fb5ff70191d655a88311ce23e972fc96db8e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/825fb5ff70191d655a88311ce23e972fc96db8e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/e6311adcf783dfb64b1e37f40abbfbe56c2626e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/e6311adcf783dfb64b1e37f40abbfbe56c2626e4","node