rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/0aa03c108dde6847b396f11719f69c8d118fd182/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:25:45Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:25:45Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"fix(examples/wujie): 补齐通信页说明与 IconFont 演示；比对器加内容量骤降告警\n\n功能点判定是「能力级」的（同义正则命中即算覆盖），抓不到「页面被整体简化」——\n上一轮 vue2/rich-text 官方 2028 字 vs taixu 168 字就是人工看出来的。\n本轮把这条经验固化进 compare.mjs，并照新发现的告警补齐缺口。\n\n比对器（QA/compare.mjs）\n- 新增内容量骤降交叉告警：参考侧 ≥300 字且重写侧不足其 0.5 倍 → 报 P1「需人工确认」\n  阈值取自实测量级分布：文案精炼但内容对齐的页比值 0.54~0.63，真实简化是 0.08 / 0.23\n- 阈值支持环境变量覆盖（MIN_REF_LEN / SHRINK_RATIO），便于负向验证与调参\n\n照告警补齐的缺口\n- vue2/vue3/vite/react17 通信页：官方每项形态是「标题 + 一行机制说明 + 按钮」，\n  这 4 页只留了「标题 + 按钮」（字数仅为官方 0.23~0.33）→ 补齐总起句与三项机制说明\n  （照 react16/communication 的形态，它本来就完整）。补后 517→364、373→368、\n  361→348、375→360，基本 1:1\n- react16/font 缺官方的「IconFont 图标示例」与「相对地址」段 → 直接吃 TDesign icon\n  原始 CDN css（不引 tdesign-icons-react），用 <i class=\"t-icon\"> 渲染 3 个图标，\n  并给出相对地址解析对照（248 → 564 字）。实测字体加载成功、图标 40x40、零错误\n\n回归脚本（QA/verify-fix.mjs）\n- contact 页断言由写死的「宿主导航能力」改为「导航能力」——标题措辞会随对齐官方\n  文案微调，写死整句导致本轮文案改动误报 2 处 FAIL\n\n结果：差异仍为 0 处；内容量告警 0 处；taixu 侧 68/68 页有内容、0 运行时错误；\nverify-fix 全部通过。","tree":{"sha":"ca3335dafd2992db43e24b22f2362e53bbc09ded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/ca3335dafd2992db43e24b22f2362e53bbc09ded"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/0aa03c108dde6847b396f11719f69c8d118fd182","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatur