rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/7f74c04cc859a12f885a3f25ebb4b3e6e7c4a7c7","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDdmNzRjMDRjYzg1OWExMmY4ODVhM2YyNWViYjRiM2U2ZTdjNGE3Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/b603f389e6b212d673be68fac60f25b02d9b5592","sha":"b603f389e6b212d673be68fac60f25b02d9b5592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/b603f389e6b212d673be68fac60f25b02d9b5592"}],"sha":"7f74c04cc859a12f885a3f25ebb4b3e6e7c4a7c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/7f74c04cc859a12f885a3f25ebb4b3e6e7c4a7c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/b603f389e6b212d673be68fac60f25b02d9b5592/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:02:53Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:02:53Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(examples/wujie): 一比一还原 wujie 官方示例（自动化比对 + 缺口清零）\n\n以 wujie 官方部署站为基准，建一套跑真实浏览器的自动化比对工具链，\n按「布局样式 / 菜单结构 / 功能点覆盖 / 运行时错误」四维度逐页比对，\n再照差异清单补齐 taixu 重写版的功能阉割。\n\nQA 工具链（examples/wujie/QA/）\n- lib/cases.mjs：35 用例（取自官方菜单树）+ FEATURES 功能点同义正则判定表\n- run-suite.mjs：4 目标统一执行器（SPA 点击导航 + 空内容重试 + 菜单独立一趟采集）\n- compare.mjs：出 gap-report.md，差异分 P0/P1/P2，同名功能点跨用例聚合\n- probe-font.mjs / probe-rich.mjs / verify-fix.mjs：布局根字体探针、单点探针、回归校验\n- 一次性诊断脚本归置 probes/，采集产物（suite.*.json 等）进 .gitignore\n\n本轮照比对结果补齐的功能阉割\n- vue3/inline-event：官方 6 个内联事件场景，原先只有 1 个计数器 → 用 innerHTML\n  装载真内联属性 + 6 个带 vue3 前缀的全局函数（同文档共享 window，裸名会污染宿主）\n- vue3/dialog、vite/dialog：补「④ 手动向 body append 弹层」；vite 连带补「③ 气泡卡片」\n- vue2/dialog：补「⑤ 原生 Popper/Floating 弹出层」——用真库（popper.js 1.16.1 /\n  @popperjs/core 2.11.8 / @floating-ui/dom 0.5.4）一比一移植，不用手写伪定位\n- vue2/vue3/vite 路由页：补「① 路由同步」（官方压在文末一句，taixu 是真机制，\n  提升为第 1 项并给出可点击的前进/后退验证）；vite 页补 $wujie.location 差异说明\n- vue2/rich-text：官方这页是 wujie 自身 iframe 缺陷回归集合（#218/#513/#450·#770），\n  原先只有 1 个裸编辑器 → 补成同构三场景 + 实时 LO/RO 选区探针（168 → 1105 字）\n- react17/dialog：补「③ 气泡卡片」（对齐 react16 同款实现）\n- 各子应用首页补运行时版本 + 仓库地址；UI 库版本诚实标注「零依赖等价实现替代」\n- vite 版本号改读 node_modules 实际安装版本（声明 ^5.2.0 → 实际 5.4.21）\n\n结果：4 目标全量采集，差异 137 处 → 0 处；taixu 侧 68/68 页有内容、0 运行时错误；\n布局锚点（nav 210px / 字号 20px / padding 30px 0 · 10px 30px）与字体族四目标完全一致。","tree":{"sha":"d1ae74a00204f3c67ab75b60dfe9f307ba173293","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/d1ae74a00204f3c67ab75b60dfe9f307ba173293"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/b603f389e6b212d673be68fac60f25b02d9b5592","verification":{"payload":null,"reason