d-apps.mjs 合成 dist/\n- 场景对齐 wujie 官方 examples：弹窗 Portal/保活切换/子路由双向同步/跨应用跳转/\n  嵌套运行时/react16 内嵌 react17/富文本/postmessage 双向/multiple 六应用同屏/预加载\n- fix(adapter-vue2): 两处生命周期语义修复\n  1) $mount(el) 是替换语义——改为容器内建挂载点挂载，lifecycle 容器引用保留\n     （直接替换容器会让 suspend/switch 的 DOM 管理错位）\n  2) Vue 2.7 config 是只读 getter——errorHandler 改为就地设置属性\n- fix(hosts): mount-first（空槽位不可直接 switch）/ bus 签名 send(ctx, message) /\n  样式管线 wrapper 沿用 appId（fiber.name 决定 bus 裁决 source）/ hideAll 重置主槽位标记 /\n  parseHash 支持 /multiple\n- vite 子应用 lib mode define process.env.NODE_ENV（浏览器无 process）\n- COMPARISON.md：wujie vs taixu 十二节全方位对比","tree":{"sha":"86b5aa67c4008954afea7d28d87591fd982e3bd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/86b5aa67c4008954afea7d28d87591fd982e3bd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/3c6bc988457948f0d6de4ffbc2f75d83e2069f10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/c