oriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/8b0e18f90d2bf3af5ab29b339a92ba317d56d068/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:53:23Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:53:23Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"docs: 工程文档整理——归档/双 README/官方文档站（docsify）\n\n**1. 归档**：12 份领域规范从根目录 git mv 到 docs/specs/（根目录只留\nREADME/AGENTS/CONTEXT 三个入口文件）；docs/architecture.md 承接原 472 行\n架构概览；引用路径同步修正。\n\n**2. 双 README**：\n- README.md 重写为面向开发者：一句话定位 + 快速开始 + 特性表 + 目录结构 +\n  开发命令 + 设计原则（原架构深读链接到 docs/architecture.md）\n- AGENTS.md 增强：常用命令 / 工程事实（测试是语义源、规范即契约、验收三合一、\n  负向验证）/ 代码模式（闭包工厂、data-tx-* 标记族、双看门狗、deny-by-default）/\n  提交与协作约定 / git remote 说明\n\n**3. 官方文档站**（docsify，参考 qiankun/wujie 文档形态，零构建纯静态）：\n- docs/index.html：docsify 入口（搜索插件 + TS 高亮 + 主题色）\n- _sidebar.md / _navbar.md：导航（快速开始/核心指南/API/深入/设计规范全文直链）\n- 首页 docs/README.md：痛点对照表 + 30 秒上手 + 六条设计主线\n- guide/ 10 篇：intro / getting-started / adapters（5 技术栈）/ lifecycle /\n  router / state / bus / sandbox / style-theme / observability / ssr / faq\n- api/ 2 篇：createCordis 全量配置 / 应用侧 API 与适配器表\n- .nojekyll（下划线文件直出）\n\n部署：GitHub Pages -> Settings -> Pages -> Source 选 main /docs 目录后生效\n（https://yvyuv.github.io/taixu/）。设计规范（docs/specs/）同时作为站点内容直出。\n\n验证：npm run verify -> 54 文件 / 360 case 全绿（纯文档改动，测试零影响）","tree":{"sha":"c7f85e4feafb44dc15485e845405119621a32e9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/c7f85e4feafb44dc15485e845405119621a32e9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/8b0e18f90d2bf3af5ab29b339a92ba317d56d068","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/8b0e18f90d2bf3af5ab29b339a92ba317d56d068","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDhiMGUxOGY5MGQyYmYzYWY1YWIyOWIzMzlhOTJiYTMxN2Q1NmQwNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/bf8966918f873ef4fef0f401716f8ea914fb6cc7","sha":"bf8966918f873ef4fef0f401716f8ea914fb6cc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/bf8966918f873ef4fef0f401716f8ea914fb6cc7"}],"sha":"8b0e18f90d2bf3af5ab29b339a92ba317d56d068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/8b0e18f90d2bf3af5ab29b33