.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/f32d255749084d4f0dfa269c5141c2e3a9473a4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T03:34:16Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(lifecycle): SSR 同构 adopt——容器复用 + vue3 hydration 绑定 (F5-04)\n\n**friction**：F5 阶段 2（同构模式，heterogeneous §九）——服务端 renderToString 已把\n应用渲染进槽位容器，但 lifecycle.mount 总是**新建空容器**：SSR 内容留在外层、应用挂\n进空容器，hydration 无从绑定（首屏闪烁、SSR 白干——这正是 adopt 要消除的）。\n\n**改动**：\n1. lifecycle：`createOutletContainer` 检测宿主元素内已有 `data-tx-ssr=\"1\"` 容器\n   （服务端写入的拼装容器）-> **复用**而非新建；shadow 应用不做 adopt（shadowRoot\n   服务端无法预渲染，回落新建）\n2. vue3 适配器：容器带标记 -> `createSSRApp`（Vue 3 在已有内容上做 hydration 绑定，\n   复用 SSR 节点）；无标记 -> `createApp`（CSR 重建，既有行为）；标记消费后保留\n3. 约定：容器标记 `data-tx-ssr=\"1\"`（与 F11 的 data-tx-mount-hidden 同一标记约定族）\n4. 降级：无标记 = 完整 CSR 挂载（行为与 F5 之前一致）；任何一步不满足自然回落，\n   不抛错不阻断\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/ssr-adopt.test.ts，2 case）：\n宿主内有 SSR 容器 -> lifecycle 复用（instance.container === ssrContainer，引用相同）\n+ hydration 后内容节点原样保留（DOM 引用断言）/ 无 SSR 容器 -> 新建容器 CSR 重建\n（既有行为，残留不进新容器）\n\n**负向验证**：去掉 adopt 分支 -> 复用用例红灯（新建容器导致 hydration 断链）；已还原。\n\n验证：npm run verify -> 52 文件 / 360 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"203d7b1995f8d6262632da7c2a3a257380e54233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/203d7b1995f8d6262632da7c2a3a257380e54233"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/f32d255749084d4f0dfa269c5141c2e3a9473a4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/f32d255749084d4f0dfa269c5141c2e3a9473a4b","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKGYzMmQyNTU3NDkwODRkNGYwZGZhMjY5YzUxNDFjMmUzYTk0NzNhNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/41264e1f1884280d8434b1737aeac54dd502c902","sha":"41264e1f1884280d8434b1737aeac54dd502c902","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/41264e1f1884280d8434b1737aeac54dd502c902"}],"sha":"f32d255749084d4f0dfa269c5141c2e3a9473a4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/f32d255749084d4f0dfa269c5141c2e3a9473a4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/41264e1f1884280d8434b1737aeac54dd502c902/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T03:27:52Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(state): 时间旅行 history + travelTo (F10)\n\n**friction**：state-sharing §八 的时间旅行（P2）未落地——devtools 状态树面板无\n历史可回放，误写无回滚手段。\n\n**改动**：\n- 新增 `services/state/timeTravel.ts`：闭包工厂 `createTimeTravel(capacity)`\n  （第 10 个推广点）——环形缓冲默认 500 条，溢出覆盖最旧；记录粒度 = 单键提交\n  { key, version, source, ts, value }（**全量值快照非 diff**——回滚 O(1) 无需重放）\n- 接线：`StateConfig.timeTravel?（enabled?/capacity?）` -> commit 钩子入账\n  （唯一数据源）；未启用 = 零记账开销\n- 查询面：`state.history()`（只读快照，防御性拷贝）+ `state.travelTo(version)`：\n  恢复该 version 的键值，经**同一 commit 管线**（source=''time-travel''，通知/持久化/\n  跨 tab 语义一致；回滚本身也入账，可再旅行回未来）\n- **默认禁用**（规范''仅开发模式提供（生产禁用）''）；未启用时 travelTo 抛错而非\n  静默 no-op（静默会让宿主误以为回滚成功）\n- 粒度说明：单键回滚覆盖''误写回滚''主场景；整树快照回滚需全量克隆账本（内存翻倍），\n  不在本票\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/time-travel.test.ts，4 case）：\n默认禁用零记账 + travelTo 抛错 / 启用后 commit 全量入账 + history 只读防御性拷贝 /\ntravelTo 恢复 + 版本原子推进 + 回滚入账可再旅行 + 无效 version 抛错 /\n环形缓冲 capacity 溢出覆盖最旧\n\n**负向验证**：去掉 commit 钩子的 record 调用 -> 3 红；已还原。\n\n验证：npm run verify -> 51 文件 / 358 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"2f12d46e48cca97187013c05886e5d1f9a92faab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/2f12d46e48cca97187013c05886e5d1f9a92faab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/41264e1f1884280d8434b1737aeac54dd502c902","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/41264e1f1884280d8434b1737aeac54dd502c902","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDQxMjY0ZTFmMTg4NDI4MGQ4NDM0YjE3MzdhZWFjNTRkZDUwMmM5MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/45e83e33fa9802636d72733f92c594984dc43124","sha":"45e83e33fa9802636d72733f92c594984dc43124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/45e83e33fa9802636d72733f92c594984dc43124"}],"sha":"41264e1f1884280d8434b1737aeac54dd502c902","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/41264e1f1884280d8434b1737aeac54dd502c902"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/45e83e33fa9802636d72733f92c594984dc43124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T03:23:58Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(adapters): Vue2 适配器 + AMD per-app 命名空间 (F6 子项)\n\n**friction**：heterogeneous §4.2 的 Vue 2 路线（§八 多版本共存案例）与 §7.1 的 AMD\n命名空间均为 P2 未落地——Vue2+Vue3 多版本共存无框架级通道；两个 UMD 应用各自\ndefine(''vue'') 撞全局单例无隔离手段。\n\n**改动**：\n1. `src/vue2-adapter.ts`：`defineCordisVue2App({ appId, render, vueRange? })` 与\n   Vue3/Angular 适配器同构。差异：经 `deps.negotiate(''vue'', ''^2'')` 共享依赖仲裁\n   （框架不硬 import vue2；^2 与 Vue3 应用的 ^3 互不重叠 = 多版本共存核心）；\n   Vue 2 API 形态（new Vue + $mount/$destroy，无 createApp）；错误边界经\n   `Vue.config.errorHandler`（实例创建前设置）；$destroy 不移除 $el（Vue 2 语义）\n   -> 适配器清空校验兑现重跑防双挂载义务\n2. `src/amd-namespace.ts`：`createAmdNamespace(appId)` 零状态工厂——per-app 的\n   define/require/registry（AMD 常用子集）。同名模块按命名空间隔离；同命名空间重复\n   注册与依赖缺失**显式抛错**（fail-closed 可观测）；匿名模块不入 registry\n3. **顺带修复 semver 简写盲区**（Vue2 适配器曝出）：`^2` / `~2.1` 等缺省次修版本\n   的写法此前正则要求完整三段、恒不匹配。现支持 npm 语义（^M -> >=M.0.0 <M+1.0.0；\n   ~M.m -> >=M.m.0 <M.(m+1).0.0；~M -> <(M+1).0.0）\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/vue2-amd.test.ts，5 case + semver 简写 1 case）：\nVue2（共享依赖仲裁 $mount/$destroy/容器清空 / 错误上报）；AMD（同名隔离 / 依赖解析\nfail-closed / 重复注册与匿名模块语义）\n\n验证：npm run verify -> 50 文件 / 353 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"b0aa799d7b8c5e01336606bb4916e5f4e7aa0186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/b0aa799d7b8c5e01336606bb4916e5f4e7aa0186"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/45e83e33fa9802636d72733f92c594984dc43124","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/45e83e33fa9802636d72733f92c594984dc43124","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDQ1ZTgzZTMzZmE5ODAyNjM2ZDcyNzM