/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/287beb222a7dd62aeaf1e26a415d2f64f307672b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T02:34:58Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(sandbox): 原型守护 freezePrototypes，opt-in 接线 (F12)\n\n**friction**：js-sandbox §3.3 的原型守护（setupPrototypeGuard）未实现——逃逸向量表\n#14「Array.prototype.xxx 被修改影响所有应用」属高风险且无缓解（customElements 前缀\n注册即向量 #9 此前已落地并有测试，本票不重复实现）。\n\n**改动**：\n- `services/harden.ts`：`DEFAULT_FREEZE_TARGETS`（Object/Array/Function/String/\n  Number/Boolean/Date/RegExp/Promise/Map/Set 共 11 个内建原型）+ `freezePrototypes`\n  （幂等、进程级不可逆、须在应用加载前调用）\n- `createCordis({ prototypeGuard: { enabled, targets } })` 接线：freeze 先于一切\n  服务与应用加载（时序明确）\n- 导出 freezePrototypes / DEFAULT_FREEZE_TARGETS\n\n**⚠️ 与规范「默认冻结」的偏差（实测发现，按 §3.3「可用性优先」收敛）**：\n默认改为 **opt-in（关闭）**——实测全量冻结与 cordis 运行时自身不兼容（cordis 内部\n存在对对象 constructor 的写点，外部依赖不可修），默认开启时 **81/343 用例失败**。\n宿主显式开启前须完成自有兼容性验证（实验性）。规范 js-sandbox §3.3 已同步偏差说明。\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/prototype-guard.test.ts，4 case）：\n默认关闭零感知 / opt-in 后默认集全部冻结且应用行为不受影响（freeze 只挡修改不挡调用，\n旧版复制方案的 Object.keys 崩溃不复现）/ 冻结后修改原型抛错（污染向量阻断）/\n自定义 targets + 幂等\n\n验证：npm run verify → 49 文件 / 343 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"ea647f3c241752129860cbde27cc473f2285489e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/ea647f3c241752129860cbde27cc473f2285489e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/287beb222a7dd62aeaf1e26a415d2f64f307672b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/287beb222a7dd62aeaf1e26a415d2f64f307672b","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDI4N2JlYjIyMmE3ZGQ2MmFlYWYxZTI2YTQxNWQyZjY0ZjMwNzY3MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/8118b2e9c2cb6d2d5c2bae91d61c978e2bcd088b","sha":"8118b2e9c2cb6d2d5c2bae91d61c978e2bcd088b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/8118b2e9c2cb6d2d5c2bae91d61c978e2bcd088b"}],"sha":"287beb222a7dd62aeaf1e26a415d2f64f307672b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/287beb222a7dd62aeaf1e26a415d2f64f307672b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/8118b2e9c2cb6d2d5c2bae91d61c978e2bcd088b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T02:27:24Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(monitor): PII 脱敏管道 + 开销自测 (F9)\n\n**friction**：monitoring §六（隐私与 PII）与 §九（开销预算·观测者效应自测）均为\nP2 未落地——错误 message/stack 直存原文（token/secret 打进日志无掩码），监控自身\n开销无自测手段（观测者效应无证据）。\n\n**改动**：\n1. 新增 `services/monitor/pii.ts`（零状态纯模块，与 monitor 同层 L0）：\n   - `redactUrl`：query 敏感键掩码（与 security.sanitizeQuery 同规则：键名子串命中\n     即掩码，非敏感键保留——排障价值优先）；**相对路径同样脱敏**（错误日志常见形态），\n     前缀保持原样仅 query 掩码\n   - `redactText`：key=value / JSON \"k\":\"v\" / k: v 三种形态掩码——只处理\n     「键名命中 + 紧跟值」的结构化片段，**不做整段猜测性替换**（过度脱敏毁掉排障价值）\n   - `newSessionId`（CSPRNG 会话随机，不指纹）/ `dntEnabled`（DNT 尊重，\n     探测失败按未开启处理）\n   - 默认掩码 `REDACTED`：**不含 URL 需编码字符**（`[REDACTED]` 会被\n     URLSearchParams 编码成 %5B..%5D 污染 query 形态）\n   - 默认敏感键族与 state sensitiveKeys 同族（token/password/secret/pii/...）\n2. monitor 接线：`MonitorConfig.privacy?` -> capture **入库前**对 message/stack\n   脱敏（与 sourcemap 还原同点：errors() 直出已脱敏结果）；管线抛错静默降级\n   （不阻断采集、不上报——避免 monitor -> security -> monitor 回环）\n3. 开销自测（§九）：`MonitorConfig.overhead?`（sampleEvery 默认 100 / budgetMs\n   默认 0.1ms / reportEveryMs 默认 30s）——抽样测量单事件 capture 耗时，超预算累计，\n   周期上报 `MONITOR_OVERHEAD` 告警；**deny-by-default**（宿主需在 alertRules 注册\n   该类型才会派发）；未配置 = 零自测开销（capture 首行不做时钟读取）\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/pii.test.ts，12 case）：\n管道（URL 掩码保留非敏感键 / 相对路径 / 无 query 原样 / 三种文本形态 / 无敏感键不抹 /\n关闭开关 / 自定义键与掩码 / 默认族同源 / 会话 ID 不指纹）+ capture 接线（配置脱敏 vs\n未配置原样）+ 开销自测（超预算上报 / 未注册规则静默 / 未配置零开销）\n\n**负向验证**：redactText 恒返回原文 + 去掉采样调用 -> 4 红；已还原。\n\n验证：npm run verify → 48 文件 / 339 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"a9f67ded679d5f53538ad4a74c7ffe26ecc905e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/a9f67ded679d5f53538ad4a74c7ffe26ecc905e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/8118b2e9c2cb6d2d5c2bae91d61c978e2bcd088b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/8118b2e9c2cb6d2d5c2bae91d61c978e2bcd088b","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDgxMThiMmU5YzJjYjZkMmQ1YzJiYWU5MWQ2MWM5NzhlMmJjZDA4OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/3c8a9e7ae0958f1ceddf91f11cb08e76501bd7b7","sha":"3c8a9e7ae0958f1ceddf91f11cb08e76501bd7b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/3c8a9e7ae0958f1ceddf91f11cb08e76501bd7b7"}],"sha":"8118b2e9c2cb6d2d5c2bae91d61c978e2bcd088b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/8118b2e9c2cb6d2d5c2bae91d61c978e2bcd088b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/3c8a9e7ae0958f1ceddf91f11cb08e76501bd7b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T02:16:51Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(theme): 主题服务 + 样式冲突检测扫描 (F7)\n\n**friction**：style-isolation §五 的 ThemeService 与 §八 的冲突检测扫描都属 P2 未落地\n——多应用主题统一无框架级通道（各应用自行维护变量），跨应用样式泄漏无检测手段。\n\n**改动**：\n1. 新增 `src/services/theme.ts`（ThemeService，provide=''theme''，**零服务依赖** L0）\n   - 配置即初始主题：`createCordis({ theme: { tokens, dark, light, followSystem } })`\n     构造期写入，宿主启动即可用\n   - 写点唯一：文档级 `:root` 的 `--tx-*`；主题变更应用**自动响应**（CSS 自定义属性\n     特性，**无事件广播**——这正是旧版 theme/change 事件与静态配置两套并存被统一掉的原因）\n   - API：setTheme（全量）/ patchTheme（增量）/ current()（只读副本）/ reset()（回初始态）\n   - prefers-color-scheme 内聚：followSystem 时 dark/light 集叠加在 base 之上，\n     matchMedia 变更自动重算；默认不跟随（不引第二机制）\n   - 降级：无 matchMedia（jsdom/SSR）时主题照常工作，只是不跟随系统\n2. `devtools.scanStyleConflicts()`（§八 冲突检测，F7）\n   - 扫描 document.styleSheets，统计选择器命中元素**归属的应用容器**——同一选择器\n     命中 ≥2 个应用即上报 { selector, apps, hitCount }\n   - 只读无副作用；O(规则 × 命中元素)，**只在开发/诊断路径调用**（不进运行时热路径）\n   - 跨源 sheet（cssRules 抛 SecurityError）与非法选择器跳过；@media/@supports\n     分组规则**递归下探**\n3. index.ts：注册 ThemeService + 导出 ThemeService/ThemeConfig/ThemeTokens +\n   CreateCordisOptions.theme\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/theme.test.ts，9 case）：\n主题（配置即初始主题 / setTheme 全量 vs patchTheme 增量 / current 只读副本 /\nreset 回初始态 / followSystem dark-light 切换重算 / 未开启时不跟随 / 应用消费写法）+\n冲突检测（跨应用命中上报 / 单应用与 @media 内规则不算冲突 / 无实例直接返回空）\n\n**负向验证两组**（均已还原）：\n1. 去掉 :root 写点 -> 6 个主题 case 红灯\n2. 冲突阈值改为 >99 -> 跨应用冲突 case 红灯\n\n验证：npm run verify → 47 文件 / 327 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"52db5c19ca0fe0523cbedd1654ce77bf0adefc3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/52db5c19ca0fe0523cbedd1654ce77bf0adefc3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/3c8a9e7ae0958f1ceddf91f11cb08e76501bd7b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/3c8a9e7ae0958f1ceddf91f11cb08e76501bd7b7","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDNjOGE5ZTdhZTA5NThmMWNlZGRmOTFmMTFjYjA4ZTc2NTAxYmQ3Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/d11a4ec8d2d634fc398c68e7ab201cbde6fe4b72","sha":"d11a4ec8d2d634fc398c68e7ab201cbde6fe4b72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/d11a4ec8d2d634fc398c68e7ab201cbde6fe4b72"}],"sha":"3c8a9e7ae0958f1ceddf91f11cb08e76501bd7b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/3c8a9e7ae0958f1ceddf91f11cb08e76501bd7b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/d11a4ec8d2d634fc398c68e7ab201cbde6fe4b72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T02:10:33Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(adapters): Angular 适配器（standalone+AOT 路线，F6）\n\n**friction**：heterogeneous-loading §4.2 的 Angular 路线（P2 实验性）此前只有\n「可行性诚实化」的结论，无实现——对比表标「实验性」但宿主无从接入。\n\n**改动**：新增 `src/angular-adapter.ts`，与 Vue/React 适配器同构\n（mount/unmount 包成**一次** effect、错误转发、重跑防双挂载、样式显式登记），\nAngular 特有的两条约束：\n\n- **零硬依赖**：`@angular/core` 经 `deps.negotiate(range, { singleton: true, strict: true })`\n  共享依赖仲裁获取——框架不 import Angular（实验性路线不应让全体宿主承担体积与版本约束）\n- **错误边界走 DI**：Angular 的错误出口是 `ErrorHandler` DI token，故在\n  `createApplication({ providers })` 阶段注入 -> `monitor.capture`（基线 §三 唯一错误入口）\n- **async effect 的静默失败显式化**：cordis 对 async effect 的错误是\n  `task.catch(logger.error)`（宿主与监控都看不到）——适配器内 try/catch 先\n  `monitor.capture(phase:''activate'')` 再上抛\n\n**顺带修复（F6 曝出）**：`deps/semver.ts` 的 `satisfies` **不支持 `*` 通配符**\n（落到精确比较恒 false）——共享依赖声明「任意版本」时仲裁永远无匹配，strict 模式下\n宿主看到的是「依赖缺失」而非真正的版本问题。现支持 `*`/`x`/`X`。\n\n**测试**：\n- tests/angular-adapter.test.ts（3 case）：createApplication 独立 ApplicationRef +\n  bootstrap 到容器 + dispose 时 destroy 且容器清空 / 渲染错误经 ErrorHandler DI token\n  转发 monitor.capture / 未注册共享依赖时 Angular 不启动 + 错误显式上报（不静默降级）\n- tests/semver-wildcard.test.ts（2 case）：通配符匹配 + 既有范围语义回归保护\n\n**负向验证**：去掉 satisfies 的通配符分支 → 3 红（含 2 个适配器用例——证明适配器\n依赖该修复）；已还原。\n\n验证：n