lowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/c274ec9a1bc438553bd70db1589304f109f44993/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T01:32:15Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"docs(agents): 归档 F11 切换事务 + F8 Trusted Types（§24）\n\n- §24.1 F11：friction / 改动表 / finally 内 reveal 的设计理由 / TTL 补算已落地的核对\n- §24.2 F8：friction / 改动表 / DOMPurify 内建 TT 的关键发现 / 降级语义\n- §24.3 两票统计（45 文件 / 313 case）\n\n验证：npm run verify → 45 文件 / 313 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"742c1d90b1d8ac8b5626c6d291156112ff6fe9e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/742c1d90b1d8ac8b5626c6d291156112ff6fe9e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/c274ec9a1bc438553bd70db1589304f109f44993","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/c274ec9a1bc438553bd70db1589304f109f44993","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKGMyNzRlYzlhMWJjNDM4NTUzYmQ3MGRiMTU4OTMwNGYxMDlmNDQ5OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/75c729b41c401fd781590431fb8fe1dc38453fa5","sha":"75c729b41c401fd781590431fb8fe1dc38453fa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/75c729b41c401fd781590431fb8fe1dc38453fa5"}],"sha":"c274ec9a1bc438553bd70db1589304f109f44993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/c274ec9a1bc438553bd70db1589304f109f44993"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/75c729b41c401fd781590431fb8fe1dc38453fa5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T01:31:42Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(security): Trusted Types 纵深接入 (F8)\n\n**friction**：security §3.1 要求 Trusted Types 作为纵深（DOM XSS sink 拦截）且\n「框架自身的 innerHTML 写点全部改为安全 API」。此前框架净化结果（DOMPurify 产物）\n是裸 string：宿主一旦启用 `require-trusted-types-for ''script''`，所有 HTML sink\n赋值（应用 innerHTML / iframe srcdoc）都会抛 TypeError——TT 纵深等于不可用。\n\n**改动**：\n- 新增 `services/security/trustedTypes.ts`（零依赖纯模块 + 策略单例缓存）：\n  `trustedTypesAvailable()` / `htmlPolicy(name?)` / `toTrustedHTML(html, name?)`\n  ——`createPolicy` 同名重复调用会抛错，故按名缓存且只缓存成功项\n- `SecurityConfig.trustedTypes?: { policyName? }`（默认 `taixu#html`）\n- `security.sanitizeToTrustedHTML(html)`（新）：**净化在前、包装在后**\n  ——policy 的 createHTML 是恒等函数，净化仍是 sanitizeHTML 的职责，顺序不可颠倒\n- **DOMPurify 已内建 TT 支持**（检测到 window.trustedTypes 时自建 `dompurify`\n  策略并返回 TrustedHTML）→ 框架**不再二次包装**，否则会把 TrustedHTML 当 string\n  再喂 createHTML。框架侧包装是兜底面：覆盖 DOMPurify 未返回 TrustedHTML 的情形\n  （版本/配置差异）与安全降级转义路径\n- 接线点：沙箱 document 的 HTML sink trap（sanitize 回调类型放宽为\n  `(html: string) => unknown`）+ iframe `srcdoc`（框架自身唯一真写点，常量文档也包装）\n\n**降级**：TT 不可用（Firefox/Safari/jsdom 无 window.trustedTypes）或策略创建失败\n（CSP 未允许该名）→ 一律返回 string，行为与启用 TT 前完全一致；不抛、不削弱净化。\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/trusted-types.test.ts，8 case）：\n适配器直测（包装 / 同名策略缓存复用 / 能力缺失原样返回 / 策略名可配置）+\n服务面（TT 可用返回非 string 且净化生效 / 策略创建失败降级 / 应用 innerHTML 写点\n落 sink 已净化 / iframe srcdoc 经包装）\n\n**负向验证**：toTrustedHTML 的 createHTML 改为恒返回入参（禁用包装）→ 3 红；已还原。\n\n验证：npm run verify → 45 文件 / 313 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"a36adb6d8260c5b0c1e079d5aafd7a94e56e634c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/a36adb6d8260c5b0c1e079d5aafd7a94e56e634c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/75c729b41c401fd781590431fb8fe1dc38453fa5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/75c729b41c401fd781590431fb8fe1dc38453fa5","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDc1YzcyOWI0MWM0MDFmZDc4MTU5MDQzMWZiOGZlMWRjMzg0NTNmYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/bcb2170b016c1ecb356ff09b35556d4c8b18db57","sha":"bcb2170b016c1ecb356ff09b35556d4c8b18db57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/bcb2170b016c1ecb356ff09b35556d4c8b18db57"}],"sha":"75c729b41c401fd781590431fb8fe1dc38453fa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/75c729b41c401fd781590431fb8fe1dc38453fa5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/bcb2170b016c1ecb356ff09b35556d4c8b18db57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T01:22:24Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(lifecycle): 切换事务 mountHidden + reveal (F11)\n\n**friction**：lifecycle-management.md §3.3 的切换事务要求「先挂载目标（不可见容器/\n占位），成功后再处置当前应用，末步 reveal」——消除「卸 A 挂 B，B 失败页面悬空」\n与切换期间的闪烁/中间态。实现里 switch 虽已是「先 mount 后 retire」序，但目标\n应用**挂在同一可见容器**上：挂载期与让位期之间存在并排显示/闪烁的中间态。\n\n**改动**：\n- `MountOptions.mountHidden?`：容器以 `display:none` 入 DOM（缺省 false，普通 mount 不变）\n- `createOutletContainer(outlet, shadow, hidden?)`：第三参透传（public 签名向后兼容）\n- `lifecycle.reveal(instanceId)`（新公开面）：取消隐藏；未知 id 返回 false 不抛\n- switch 三步收口：mountHidden 挂载 -> retireCurrent -> **finally 内 reveal**\n  ——retire 失败也照常 reveal（宁可旧应用残留，不留空白悬空窗口），错误照常上抛\n- 显隐目标 = shadow 宿主（shadowRoot.host）或容器本身；复位用 `display: ''''`\n  （置空交还宿主样式表，不覆盖宿主 CSS）；`data-tx-mount-hidden` 标记仅供诊断\n\n**顺带核对**：§3.3 同条的「后台标签页 TTL 补算」**已落地**（keepAlive hiddenAt/\nhiddenTotal 记账 + visibilitychange 驱动 + ttlElapsed 扣除，tests/keepAlive.test.ts:266\n已覆盖），本票不重复实现——规范 P2 条目已标注。\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/switch-transaction.test.ts，8 case，顺带补 lifecycle 测试盲区）：\napply 期间容器 display:none 且收尾复位 / 目标挂载失败当前应用留原位不悬空 /\n成功路径 reveal + 重复 reveal 幂等 / 空槽位切换同样收尾 reveal / shadow 应用显隐\n作用于 shadow 宿主 / reveal 未知 id 返回 false / 普通 mount 不受影响 /\n显式 mountHidden 需宿主自行 reveal\n\n**负向验证两组**（均已还原）：\n1. 去掉 mountHidden -> 「apply 期间隐藏」红灯\n2. 去掉两处 reveal 调用 -> 4 个 case 红灯（含 shadow 与空槽位路径）\n\n验证：npm run verify → 44 文件 / 305 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"646fd3ab0e642ee2b3151aaf50a34b97d87b8bf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/646fd3ab0e642ee2b3151aaf50a34b97d87b8bf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/bcb2170b016c1ecb356ff09b35556d4c8b18db57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gi