aadd3a36046755d4dfa7ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/90391bc2eaba0d2a71aadd3a36046755d4dfa7ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/e233df1d7c55445d5d6bc0de5b7bd2988f0e75a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T00:15:53Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:19Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(monitor): sourcemap 还原管线接入 (F4)\n\n**friction**：monitoring.md §二 要求 capture 内 `sourcemap.rewrite(error.stack)`，\n§十 契约是「错误清单 sourcemap 已还原」；实现在 capture 直存原始 stack，\nmonitor.errors() 注释自标「随宿主管线接入后在此层应用」——P1 未落地。\n顺带发现 DevToolsSnapshot.errors 只映射 message/appId/phase，**stack 根本没\n传给 DevTools**：即使还原了，消费面也看不到。\n\n**改动**：\n- monitor.ts：新增 `SourcemapRewriter` 接口（`rewrite(stack): string`）+\n  `MonitorConfig.sourcemap?` 注入位；capture **入库前**重写 stack\n  （§十「已还原」= errors() 直出结果，查询面不二次重写，devtools 复用同一实例）\n  - 管线抛错 / 返回空值 → 降级原始 stack（不阻断错误采集，**不上报**——\n    避免 monitor → security → monitor 回环）\n  - 缓存归宿主：capture 是同步入口，异步 .map 加载须预缓存后同步消费\n- devtools.ts：snapshot().errors 补出 stack 字段（此前丢失，还原不可见）\n- index.ts：导出 `SourcemapRewriter` 类型\n\n**向后兼容**：未配 sourcemap 时行为完全不变（原始 stack 直出）。\n**契约变更**：DevToolsSnapshot.errors[] 增加可选字段 stack（devtools.test.ts\n严格断言已同步）。\n\n**测试**（新增 tests/monitor-sourcemap.test.ts，5 case，顺带补 monitor 测试盲区）：\n未配管线原始直出 / 入库前重写且查询面不二次重写 / monitor-report 事件与 errors()\n同源（无两套 stack）/ 管线抛错与返回空值均降级不阻断 / devtools 复用同管线\n\n**负向验证**：rewriteStack 改为恒返回原始 stack → 3 个 case 红灯；已还原。\n\n验证：npm run verify → 43 文件 / 297 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"f537069e139cc172e1387286b99ac25a33de044e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/f537069e139cc172e1387286b99ac25a33de044e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/e233df1d7c55445d5d6bc0de5b7bd2988f0e75a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/e233df1d7c5