S 网络裁决面（含中途方向修正说明：删包装 → 补裁决）\n- §22.3 F2 state 冲突消解四策略（递归 merge 的设计理由）\n- §22.4 本批统计（3 commits / 1 新模块 / +16 case / 1 破坏性变更 / 三票负向验证）\n- §22.5 剩余候选（F4 + 规范 P2 八项 + 测试盲区）\n\n验证：npm run verify → 42 文件 / 292 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"c648fd1e6c8f291c7572712d70397883533ea4d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/c648fd1e6c8f291c7572712d70397883533ea4d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/dbf6a9854cda708b0b7c70a66a1a38b82578a4af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/dbf6a9854cda708b0b7c70a66a1a38b82578a4af","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKGRiZjZhOTg1NGNkYTcwOGIwYjdjNzBhNjZhMWEzOGI4MjU3OGE0YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/a7c16baca80be4a42f545fe5fe15bc7a3b30c137","sha":"a7c16baca80be4a42f545fe5fe15bc7a3b30c137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/a7c16baca80be4a42f545f