纯对象 = **递归**逐字段合并（remote 为底、local 覆盖、同名字段下探）；\n    类型不一致 / 深度超限（>8 层，防深层与环引用）= 回退 local（LWW）\n    ——仅浅合并会让数组字段被 local 整体覆盖、丢掉 remote 内容，与 §4.5 意图相悖\n- state.ts：StateConfig 加 `conflict?`；setIfMatch 版本不匹配时交由 resolver，\n  reject 抛 VERSION_CONFLICT（文案不变），其余策略的消解值经**同一 commit 管线**\n  提交（版本原子推进，通知/持久化/跨 tab 语义一致）；权限裁决仍在最前置（消解不绕过）\n- index.ts：导出 lwwResolver / mergeResolver / defaultMerge / REJECT_RESOLVER + 类型\n\n**向后兼容**：默认 REJECT_RESOLVER = 既有行为（抛 VERSION_CONFLICT），未注入\nconflict 的宿主零感知。\n\n**测试**（tests/state.test.ts +6 case）：默认 reject 真值不变 / LWW 覆盖且版本\n按 current+1 原子推进 / merge 数组去重保序 / defaultMerge 递归嵌套+深度超限回退 /\n自定义 merge 与 custom 策略（冲突上下文 key·版本·source 全透出）/ 无写权仍被拒\n\n**负向验证**：setIfMatch 内绕过 resolver 恒 reject → 3 个 case 红灯；已还原。\n\n验证：npm run verify → 42 文件 / 292 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"9badb7514e93f8559f675c2f441c94a945a0b707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/9badb7514e93f8559f675c2f441c94a945a0b707"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/a7c16baca80be4a42f545fe5fe15bc7a3b30c137","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/a7c16baca80be4a42f545fe5fe15bc7a3b30c137","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKGE3YzE2YmFjYTgwYmU0YTQyZjU0NWZlNWZlMTViYzdhM2IzMGMxMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/d5a9059583207ad94323bfaa8d3703c56a93c04c","sha":"d5a9059583207ad94323bfaa8d3703c56a93c04c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/d5a9059583207ad94323bfaa8d3703c56a93c04c"}],"sha":"a7c16baca80be4a42f545fe5fe15bc7a3b30c137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/a7c16baca80be4a42f545fe5fe15bc7a3b30c137"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/d5a9059583207ad94323bfaa8d3703c56a93c04c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T16:47:47Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:18Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(sandbox): XHR/EventSource/WebSocket 网络裁决面 (F3)\n\n**friction**：security.md §六 承诺「fetch/XHR/WebSocket/EventSource 全覆盖经\nscoped 包装拦截」，js-sandbox §3.6 要求 XHR 是「open/send 包装：URL 白名单 +\ntraceparent + 埋点」；实现只在构造期**记账**（上报一条 violation），不裁决、\n不注入 traceparent——fetch 之外的网络面等于裸奔（networkAccess 类承诺无法兑现）。\nsandbox.ts 头部注释自称「过渡实现，bus 落地后回收」，但回收只会让覆盖面更窄。\n\n**改动**：\n- security.ts：抽 `safeUrl`（协议门：https-only / allowInsecure 例外 / ws 豁免）供\n  sanitizeURL 与新增 `checkNetUrl` 复用；`checkNetUrl(appId, url, allowWs?)` =\n  **同步**裁决（XHR 的 open/send 与 ES/WS 构造是同步 API，无法 await sanitizeURL 的\n  adjudicate 超时路径 ADR-0024；代价：同步面只认精确源 `net:fetch:{origin}`，\n  拿不到粗授权 `net:fetch`）\n- sandbox.ts：SandboxOptions 加 `adjudicateNetworkUrl?(url, api)` 注入位；\n  拆出 xhrConstructor / esConstructor / wsConstructor 三个包装\n  - XHR：裁决点在 `open`（URL 此时才给定）——拒绝 = 不真正 open，`send` 抛错\n    （fail-closed，应用侧症状明确而非静默无响应）；放行时 send 注入 traceparent\n    （仅 tracing 启用时——未启用不注入，不给应用请求平白增加触发 CORS 预检的自定义头）\n  - EventSource / WebSocket：无 open 阶段，裁决点在构造器——拒绝 = 构造抛错\n    （super 之前，不建立连接）\n  - 注入位缺省降级为「只记账不拦截」（测试/独立用法向后兼容）\n- services/sandbox.ts：create 默认接线 `security.checkNetUrl`（调用方显式提供则优先）\n- 记账（sandbox-network-*）与拒绝（sandbox-network-*-denied）分列上报\n\n**破坏性变更**：未配 net:fetch 授权的应用，其 XHR/EventSource/WebSocket 现被拦截\n（suspend.test.ts 的 WS 用例已补授权——这是覆盖面兑现的预期代价，宿主需显式授权）。\n\n**测试**（+6 case）：\n- security-wiring：端到端 XHR 白名单源 open 生效 vs 越源不 open + send 抛错；\n  WebSocket 越源构造即拒 + ws 协议不被 https 门误杀\n- sandbox：XHR 拒绝/放行/未注入降级、traceparent 注入（启用 vs 未启用）、\n  EventSource 裁决（jsdom 无 ES，stubGlobal 替身）\n\n**负向验证**：adjudicateNet 改为恒 true（禁用裁决）→ 5 个 case 红灯；已还原。\n\n验证：npm run verify → 42 文件 / 286 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"a301aa142cd9d00b4206c0580f545613bf328c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/a301aa142cd9d00b4206c0580f545613bf328c6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/d5a9059583207ad94323bfaa8d3703c56a93c04c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/d5a9059583207ad94323bfaa8d3703c56a93c04c","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKGQ1YTkwNTk1ODMyMDdhZDk0MzIzYmZhYThkMzcwM2M1NmE5M2MwNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/9b3291154f66ee6d1ac2e3e9794af11a1ff49642","sha":"9b3291154f66ee6d1ac2e3e9794af11a1ff49642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/9b3291154f66ee6d1ac2e3e9794af11a1ff49642"}],"sha":"d5a9059583207ad94323bfaa8d3703c56a93c04c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/d5a9059583207ad94323bfaa8d3703c56a93c04c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/9b3291154f66ee6d1ac2e3e9794af11a1ff49642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T15:42:09Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:18Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(bus): 多实例精确定向 instanceId (F1)\n\n**friction**：communication-protocol.md §3.1/§二 定义 target 携带 instanceId 维度，\n实现把 target 平铺为 appId 字符串——同 appId 挂多个实例时 dispatch 只能\n「取最新」（bus.ts 原注释标 08 号票），多开场景无法定向投递。\n\n**改动**（向后兼容，不破坏既有 target: string 形状）：\n- events.ts CordisMessage 加 `targetInstanceId?`（消息携带目标实例，DLQ/重放可复现）\n- SendMessageInput / RequestOptions 加 `instanceId?`（send / request 均可定向）\n- bus.resolveTarget（新助手）：instanceId 精确匹配优先，缺省回退「同 appId 取最新」；\n  两者共存时校验归属——instanceId 不属于该 appId 视为不可达（fail-closed，不静默错投）\n- dispatch 改用 resolveTarget；request 透传 instanceId\n- 修复 findByInstanceId 定义行缺换行的格式缺陷（{ 与 for 同行）\n\n**测试**（tests/bus.test.ts +4 case，describe 多实例定向 instanceId）：\n- 同 appId 多实例：instanceId 精确投递 vs 缺省回退最新（targetInstanceId 落载荷）\n- 归属不符 = 死信：冒充目标的 instanceId 不投递 + 进 DLQ（不静默错投两边）\n- request 定向：指定实例应答 seq=0，未指定回退 seq=1\n- 已卸载实例的 instanceId：不可达死信（与未指定路径一致）\n\n**负向验证**：把 resolveTarget 的 instanceId 分支改为 `if (false \\&\\& ...)`\n→ 3 个新 case 红灯（精确投递 / 归属不符 / request 定向）；已还原。\n\n验证：npm run verify → 42 文件 / 280 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净",