r_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/97973ca93e6c83b41f154faa472be22b319e9067/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:15:29Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:18Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"test(services): 依赖方向机器校验 (C16-B)\n\n**friction**：ADR-0054 要求依赖方向单向（monitor / security 零业务依赖、\n最先可用），但依赖图此前无自动化校验——未来有人给 security 加\ninject = [''monitor''] 即成环，运行时表现为''注入 undefined''或启动死锁，\n症状与根因距离远。\n\n**改动**：新增 tests/dependency-graph.test.ts（5 case）\n- 从 src/services/**/*.ts 提取 static provide + static inject\n  （同文件多服务各自成条：devtools.ts 的 DevTools + Hmr）\n- 断言 1 无环（Kahn 拓扑排序）：依赖图可拓扑排序——循环注入即红灯\n- 断言 2 零业务依赖叶子：monitor / security 不 inject 任何服务（ADR-0054）\n- 断言 3 核心八服务不反向依赖 devtools（诊断工具层不进运行时主路径）\n- 断言 4 核心八服务全部声明在案（ADR-0011 保护列完整）\n\n**负向验证已做（两组）**：\n1. monitor 加 inject=[''security''] → 「零业务依赖叶子」红灯\n2. security + monitor 双向注入 → 「无环」红灯（捕获循环注入）\n两组均已还原；typecheck 干净。\n\n**长期价值**：依赖环 / 零依赖破坏 在静态层直接捕获——与 npm run verify 同跑\n\n验证：npm run verify → 42 文件 / 276 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"731367ec72aa171c19eb03df67dc4222fa79d609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/731367ec72aa171c19eb03df67dc4222fa79d609"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/