d, leakSuspects, sweepOnce, destroy } handle\n  - WeakRef/FinalizationRegistry 特性缺失整体降级为纯记账（不抛错）\n  - observeHeapDecline (performance.memory 堆下降事件) 迁出\n  - sweepOnce 返回 suspect 列表——告警副作用保留给 monitor.trigger\n- src/services/monitor.ts: -21 行净，关注面从 7+ 收敛到 4 类本职\n  (错误 / 指标 / 告警 / 隔离门面)\n  - trackDisposed / leakSuspects 改 thin delegate 到 detector\n  - 构造内轮询回调：sweepOnce() 返 suspect -> monitor.trigger LEAK_SUSPECT\n  - leakReported Set 留在 monitor（告警去抖属告警引擎本职）\n  - ctx.effect cleanup 同时 clearInterval + detector.destroy()\n\n**deletion test**：\ngrep -E ''observeHeapDecline|sweepSuspects|leakSupported'' src/services/monitor.ts\n0 命中 ✓\n\n**架构边界**：leak detector 非 cordis service 形态——无 service 抽象必要，\n保持轻量模块 + 函数对象工厂 pattern（C5-A KeepAliveCore 抽离同源）。\n\n**验证**：npm run verify → 40 文件 / 267 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净","tree":{"sha":"ffb3b9786b1c13b9681879499a41282faf5e5ba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/ffb3b9786b1c13b9681879499a41282faf5e5ba2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/615ee4d10e36cc96b73e8da43d7fa195f7ecb188","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc