ifecycle.ts: static inject 加 ''suspendScope''；requestSuspend/\n  Resume 直访 ctx.suspendScope.freeze/unfreeze（不再经 sandbox.freeze 中转）\n- tests/suspend.test.ts: 断言改走 host.suspendScope.closedSockets(appId)\n\nC5-A · KeepAliveService 抽离（165 行保活子系统迁出 lifecycle）：\n- src/services/keepAlive.ts: KeepAliveCore class（账本/探测/仲裁/快照 6 关注点）\n  + KeepAliveService Cordis Service 形态（Q3/Q8 全局单例）；bindHost(host)\n  二次注入模式同 C1.2 setReconnect\n- src/services/lifecycle.ts: 删 -219 行；构造内 ctx.keepAlive.bindHost；\n  lifecycle.destroyByAppId 调 ctx.keepAlive.destroyLedger（Q4/Q5 KillSwitch 路径清理）；\n  LifecycleConfig.keepAlive 字段删除（配置面改走 KeepAliveService 注入 Q12）\n- tests/keepAlive.test.ts: tests/eviction.test.ts 重命名 + header 注释更新\n  （C5-A 投票 Q15 helper = file 一一对应）\n\nC5-B · cleanup 声明式统一：\n- src/services/lifecycle.ts: 增 finalizeInstance(instance) 私有方法（8 步确定性\n  清理原语：releaseIsolatedMonitor → sandbox → portal → container → instances →\n  bus.unregister → trackDisposed → app/disposed）；destroy finally 改调\n  finalizeInstance；cascadeCleanup 方法删除（Q2 不留两个顺序源）；mountOnce\n  的 abort/事务失败路径与 destroy 同构（补齐旧 cascadeCleanup 漏掉的\n  bus.unregister/trackDisposed/app/disposed 派发）\n- tests/mount-transaction.test.ts: +1 case — entryGate promise 挡住 apply 制造\n  ''instance 已登记、激活未完成'' 窗口，断言 abort 后 app/disposed 派发 + bus\n  注销幂等\n\nC5-C · scopedFetch owner 重划：\n- src/services/scopedFetch.ts: createScopedFetch(ctx, appId) 纯函数模块（非\n  Service）；安全裁决（security.sanitizeURL/applyCsrf）+ 链路执行\n  （bus.runNetwork）的编排点\n- src/services/lifecycle.ts: 删 scopedFetch 方法；mountOnce 注入点直调\n  createScopedFetch(this.ctx, appId)\n- tests/network-chain.test.ts + tests/csrf.test.ts: 6 处调用点切 createScopedFetch\n- src/index.ts: re-export KeepAliveService + createScopedFetch；createCordis\n  plugin 顺序 SuspendScopeService → KeepAliveService → LifecycleService\n- CONTEXT.md: §保活段（C5 抽离说明）+ §Scoped Fetch 段（C5-C 归属说明）同步\n\n退出标准（deletion test 全部 0 命中）：\n- grep -E ''snapshotPool|trimSnapshotPool|enforceBudget|pickPressureCandidate|\n  snapshotLocalKeys|hydrateLocalKeys|underPressure|ttlElapsed'' src/services/\n  lifecycle.ts 0 命中 ✓\n- grep ''private async cascadeCleanup|await this.cascadeCleanup'' src/services/\n  lifecycle.ts 0 命中 ✓\n- grep ''this.scopedFetch|private scopedFetch|scopedFetch(appId:'' src/services/\n  lifecycle.ts 0 命中 ✓\n\n验证：npm run verify → 40 文件 / 267 case 全绿 + typecheck 干净\nlifecycle.ts 累计 846 → 610 行（-236，降幅 27.9%）","tree":{"sha":"0430a82f49094e698d473cddc202c7c51a64db59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/0430a82f49094e698d473cddc202c7c51a64db59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/980b380d5bab426c478badfcd90d4e97fd006cb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Himoriarty","id":28705788,"login":"Himoriarty","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzA1Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/980b380d5bab426c478badfcd90d4e97fd006cb1","node_id":"C_kwDOUHvI-toAKDk4MGIzODBkNWJhYjQyNmM0NzhiYWRmY2Q5MGQ0ZTk3ZmQwMDZjYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/taixu-micro/taixu/commit/accc07500b65eaf3f1d