iarty/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/commits/a21f8fa4cc7423508b67c92e9257c2abcc4c457f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T02:07:47Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:13:18Z","email":"948604918@qq.com","name":"Himoriarty"},"message":"feat(style): CSS-in-JS 运行时补丁 + 滚动锁重定向 + z-index 分层（style-isolation §4.4/§4.2，P1）\n\n- style.observeRuntimeStyles(ctx)：MutationObserver 观察注册后的注入——未打标\n  style 归因当前应用 + §3.1 等价选择器前缀重写（@media 等条件块递归；\n  html/body/:root 语义重写为 scope）；既有未打标节点不捕（无归因证据——\n  误归因会以错误 scope 重写宿主样式）；观察挂 ctx.effect；cssinjs_patched 指标\n- prefixSelectors 递归块解析器导出（@keyframes/@font-face 原样；§3.2 动画名\n  相撞风险与 characterData 更新如实列入未落地清单）\n- 滚动锁重定向（§4.2）：沙箱 body.style 代理——overflow 写（属性赋值 +\n  setProperty 双路径）改容器级、读镜像容器值、视图缓存单例身份稳定；\n  其余读写透传真实节点\n- z-index 分层 registry：setZLayers 写 :root --tx-z-{layer} 唯一写点 +\n  zIndexVar 取值面（弹层经 token 而非裸数字）\n- style-isolation §4.4 补落地形式注记；tests/cssinjs.test.ts 4 例；全量 224/224 绿","tree":{"sha":"071d77234571b58be2809a32ca7bb4fbbedc3f39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/trees/071d77234571b58be2809a32ca7bb4fbbedc3f39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taixu-micro/taixu/git/commits/a21f8fa4cc7423508b67c92e9257c2abcc4c457f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28705788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Himoriarty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://