s/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/ec7799f4f603fc9a4b26682693ff5d54a32939c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:13:00Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:13:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Line up a wrapped Archived tag under the status tag (#110) (#116)\n\nIn Finnish, \"Lopetettu\" and \"Arkistoitu\" don''t fit on one line of the\nStatus column. The second tag wrapped but kept the `.tag + .tag` left\nmargin, so it sat 4px to the right of the first. The desktop status\ncells now hold their tags in a wrapping flex row with a 6px gap, so the\ntags sit flush left when stacked and slightly further apart when side\nby side.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d62cf5a2ed1384588b7da8468b4315049de83d2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/d62cf5a2ed1384588b7da8468b4315049de83d2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/ec7799f4f603fc9a4b26682693ff5d54a32939c0","verification":{"payload":"tree d62cf5a2ed1384588b7da8468b4315049de83d2f\nparent b57d1875d45d2cbbb4a3258e5ece114dc5b5e3c1\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791432780 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791432780 +0300\n\nLine up a wrapped Archived tag under the status tag (#110) (#116)\n\nIn Finnish, \"Lopetettu\" and \"Arkistoitu\" don''t fit on one line of the\nStatus column. The second tag wrapped but kept the `.tag + .tag` left\nmargin, so it sat 4px to the right of the first. The desktop status\ncells now hold their tags in a wrapping flex row with a 6px gap, so the\ntags sit flush left when stacked and slightly further apart when side\nby side.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by