{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/0a2c31c76b57a1be866b17a16fa92c1a2aab2d10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:24:28Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:24:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Send security headers from the frontend (#106) (#108)\n\nThe nginx image now renders its server config from nginx.conf.template at\ncontainer start, next to config.js, so the CSP''s connect-src follows\nAPI_URL. Adds a CSP (Report-Only for now), nosniff, Referrer-Policy, HSTS\nand a Permissions-Policy denying camera, microphone and geolocation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"357925d978961c998a05297e2bb3cb233095d1e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/357925d978961c998a05297e2bb3cb233095d1e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/0a2c31c76b57a1be866b17a16fa92c1a2aab2d10","verification":{"payload":"tree 357925d978961c998a05297e2bb3cb233095d1e1\npare