"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/5f058023cf25c4185695c08738609ae6334f152b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:15:45Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:15:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Cap how much one account can store (#105) (#107)\n\nSignup is open and the whole app shares Neon''s 0.5 GB free tier, so one\nscripted account could fill the database.\n\n- 500 subscriptions and 100 categories per account. Creating, restoring,\n  naming a new category on a subscription, and importing all check the\n  limit and answer 409 when it would be exceeded.\n- An import is checked after a replace has emptied the account and after\n  merge matching. Over the limit, it rolls back whole, so a refused replace\n  leaves the account as it was.\n- Request bodies over 1 MB get a 413, whether or not they declare a\n  Content-Length. CORS headers stay on the 413.\n- Finnish translations for the new messages.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d278384b7f5c12625ad255882665629d4c04b81d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/d278384b7f5c12625ad255882665629d4c04b81d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/5f058023cf25c4185695c08738609ae6334f152b","verification":{"payload":"tree d278384b7f5c12625ad255882665629d4c04b81d\nparent effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791285345 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791285345 +0300\n\nCap how much one account can store (#105) (#107)\n\nSignup is open and the whole app shares Neon''s 0.5 GB free tier, so one\nscripted account could fill the database.\n\n- 500 subscriptions and 100 categories per account. Creating, restoring,\n  naming a new category on a subscription, and importing all check the\n  limit and answer 409 when it would be exceeded.\n- An import is checked after a replace has emptied the account and after\n  merge matching. Over the limit, it rolls back whole, so a refused replace\n  leaves the account as it was.\n- Request bodies over 1 MB get a 413, whether or not they declare a\n  Content-Length. CORS headers stay on the 413.\n- Finnish translations for the new messages.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxNhhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARa8QAEhDyxQX/qRId5IsyI3l/sDs\nZO/J5qe8Sqia3RxYttmtF7H/Tu7vOv+qhtBHem81X70UnaVebNdoLgbmWu4bFds7\nEkb292bKl+3X4Hk4tUXIe6/oCqHCiF3QTY4iIaIRhpndHWdBHn9wRlVCDQsNYP4G\nwaAdo+j0jhXRUJEPyXd0GLBNMnd2Ikx9Qg4wKhpwSMS14jaCrSikA1IXblCNWoLK\neAOj4d+la/1D0snAwwDnJqCergHBpzlEebfudw6Pg783C3Fe7zjfFXi6s3x5e4/i\n90CHUHgO9PXOJX0wjBv7hkbfe5+qH2aS0rDyJpGUBjD2Q0nF8/UfEP840VRet8P5\nfIW4uneDiiLcTIy7Y+16s37XZlSDBYjYNw0VB6QCp8LrHQ8i4sAHQ7l1Q5BUxbBu\niilrcJ+A/CfDMcOfgPtCrs3n+Q9f7Gfl9KkEFHiQxGWqN/rXsjzZD0eCoh/Gs8GT\nEYanuuQwHB924b5hH+eRUlXx9oY3069Yi8MSlkMFp6U5TN7iUmYua6Y5tyj5jd8i\nec6Rat9Mm1R9haU+iIWY4JRavQuL8hq2KLJ/OIMhnorj/vnOd9/1qMrKEsTFWVUT\ndgDUIvyKSogHvFkLv1ec/97QqLNSc1+kcm+g0FG1PPE78e5lE39MlMeJY1Xg25UQ\n1EKD0Olg1b6y1uMHWVOa\n=z4ze\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T11:15:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/5f058023cf25c4185695c08738609ae6334f152b","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDVmMDU4MDIzY2YyNWM0MTg1Njk1YzA4NzM4NjA5YWU2MzM0ZjE1MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d","sha":"effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d"}],"sha":"5f058023cf25c4185695c08738609ae6334f152b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/5f058023cf25c4185695c08738609ae6334f152b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:52:39Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:52:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Open signup: confirm before sign-in, no enumeration, email caps, Turnstile (#104)\n\n* Open signup: confirm before sign-in, no enumeration, email caps, Turnstile\n\nThe invite code goes. Four protections take its place:\n\n- /token answers 403 email_not_verified, but only after the password\n  checks out. get_current_user rejects unconfirmed accounts too, so tokens\n  issued before this rule stop working.\n- /register is 202 with no body for every address. The inbox says what\n  happened: a confirmation link for a new address, \"you already have an\n  account\" for a verified one, and a choose-a-password (reset) link for\n  one that was never confirmed, so the inbox''s owner ends up holding it.\n  /verification (resend, email + password) replaces /me/verification and\n  always answers 204.\n- email_sends (migration 0008) caps mail at 5 per address and\n  EMAIL_DAILY_CAP (default 90) per 24 hours, under Resend''s free 100/day.\n- Cloudflare Turnstile on /register and /password-reset, off until\n  TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY and the frontend''s TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY are set.\n\nFrontend: no invite field, a \"check your inbox\" screen after signup or a\nrefused sign-in with a resend button, the Turnstile widget, and the\ndashboard''s confirm nudge removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Turnstile: require the form''s action and our hostname\n\nCloudflare''s success only says a token is good, not that it was solved on\nthis site''s signup form. The widget now sends an action (signup or\npassword_reset) and the backend checks it, plus the answer''s hostname\nagainst TURNSTILE_HOSTNAMES, failing closed when that is empty. Cloudflare''s\ntest secret answers with no action, so its test answers skip that one check.\n\nRecords the production widget''s site key in the go-live notes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab21e4797fb9be6b2d283108b4e2bdd8b5518bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/ab21e4797fb9be6b2d283108b4e2bdd8b5518bd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d","verification":{"payload":"tree ab21e4797fb9be6b2d283108b4e2bdd8b5518bd9\nparent 48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791283959 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791283959 +0300\n\nOpen signup: confirm before sign-in, no enumeration, email caps, Turnstile (#104)\n\n* Open signup: confirm before sign-in, no enumeration, email caps, Turnstile\n\nThe invite code goes. Four protections take its place:\n\n- /token answers 403 email_not_verified, but only after the password\n  checks out. get_current_user rejects unconfirmed accounts too, so tokens\n  issued before this rule stop working.\n- /register is 202 with no body for every address. The inbox says what\n  happened: a confirmation link for a new address, \"you already have an\n  account\" for a verified one, and a choose-a-password (reset) link for\n  one that was never confirmed, so the inbox''s owner ends up holding it.\n  /verification (resend, email + password) replaces /me/verification and\n  always answers 204.\n- email_sends (migration 0008) caps mail at 5 per address and\n  EMAIL_DAILY_CAP (default 90) per 24 hours, under Resend''s free 100/day.\n- Cloudflare Turnstile on /register and /password-reset, off until\n  TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY and the frontend''s TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY are set.\n\nFrontend: no invite field, a \"check your inbox\" screen after signup or a\nrefused sign-in with a resend button, the Turnstile widget, and the\ndashboard''s confirm nudge removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Turnstile: require the form''s action and our hostname\n\nCloudflare''s success only says a token is good, not that it was solved on\nthis site''s signup form. The widget now sends an action (signup or\npassword_reset) and the backend checks it, plus the answer''s hostname\nagainst TURNSTILE_HOSTNAMES, failing closed when that is empty. Cloudflare''s\ntest secret answers with no action, so its test answers skip that one check.\n\nRecords the production widget''s site key in the go-live notes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxNL3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABS4QADUxnLBiP89DFGtdOpAM3EHS\nO0D3QtxNc1uVyWc2eq3resVhypaJojMXJJ9iGMwkxKV5nfFLABd7cVFJpdRRzJKZ\nnXs/brIyDj1GogYTf9E89SL1lRa8VzhdGiUBKzvogGduj21vpBhyZnsTcQ127h2T\nJbSE2iE4/IjWC9Kyp9gfq6JMTx850ioOYEDTF9E+bZw3hSyX4d85Uoq9HB7Q4yrE\naypkQcxmBcohduwxUu9vUsY/qyVmf2mYJnFsRCuASoD7bo8cw3oE+l+hzkmFU1Et\nJ14H6ium4p6cKCJdiOjQFW+cLudh4sFztuqs9Sio4MGIfs2BiJLB8uh0FHJvL54G\ne1t1GayjYs3qfhBNWdoWmTmupAHZFlTl/Piq5a5TyiNBoNJ91HH1JtqM5JQ7/uKK\nJyYEbu5s7rwxZngf4Q6c1CaKuogDF6MLf5mqO3EhnzHaKTiyQ0zwk3SrJ9ovstUm\nz3epqCqDALyujYb7tRzDjpQHAtb0ZT1HfGdNmj2+uBkfqGpXjGoN2UOw2jWhySt2\n7uhG5P/FB1cSUUvU5FmufM3YZa6uIRp5g0g2z/OXbmfeM79KcDaIpLgq7rngVZtN\ni85W32To/vN11Rm81nQp1H488UULxIvxW0nCofLm0o+ymkhh2zADjkoTZhNUy+Po\nqnez+LXQXNjg/CGZ8/c9\n=N7Uv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T10:52:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKGVmZmQ4ZWY5YmU3NjAwMDNjYTc0Y2VkMjFiM2ZiN2MyMmQwNzgxMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e","sha":"48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e"}],"sha":"effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/effd8ef9be760003ca74ced21b3fb7c22d07812d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:11:53Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:11:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Key rate limits on the real client, not Azure''s proxy (#103)\n\nBehind Container Apps'' ingress every request reaches uvicorn from Envoy\n(100.100.0.x in the live logs), so /token''s and /register''s 5/minute\nlimits were one bucket shared by every user. One script could lock the\nwhole site out of signing in.\n\nclient_address() reads the last X-Forwarded-For entry, which Envoy\nappends, when TRUST_FORWARDED_FOR=true. Off by default, because without\na proxy the client controls that header. The request log line now\ncarries the same address, so the fix can be checked in production.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c03d0c1254a69dcde516109ccdfbcde8a3c8eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/6c03d0c1254a69dcde516109ccdfbcde8a3c8eb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c03d0c1254a69dcde516109ccdfbcde8a3c8eb1\nparent cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791281513 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791281513 +0300\n\nKey rate limits on the real client, not Azure''s proxy (#103)\n\nBehind Container Apps'' ingress every request reaches uvicorn from Envoy\n(100.100.0.x in the live logs), so /token''s and /register''s 5/minute\nlimits were one bucket shared by every user. One script could lock the\nwhole site out of signing in.\n\nclient_address() reads the last X-Forwarded-For entry, which Envoy\nappends, when TRUST_FORWARDED_FOR=true. Off by default, because without\na proxy the client controls that header. The request log line now\ncarries the same address, so the fix can be checked in production.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxMlpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWoEQAGhVcKC9VhDLIUwTE3ahRT81\npeJTTZ7jsIq6AzdC1O5/CCwlG9eowm/C1+uONvf/z9NqKykm/CoE5/lkYDYugqvV\n1qpEGpzxBggvVLZXqWNVXAWrQuHkgBwj4aZoCkN4O+PqiRBfcHtG4aMMNLGFlTod\nqt7qxi1F3k6XzsT03feydeWgIjgYKuqWIgsJ6TwyAM2191mUnzje9e6wLAYUqbWu\noUCyGsozwLu2t4X+YMP6bnscfpaPOHP6ZUoexSYMiYP4LDDh3B91sMFLlL1ObXH7\n9Q5AiZVVTzdnHggDZc5vx+DBxhA8TVe5ud2jVQrLbDJ6YP4fr3dOosMUV58ho6oi\n216xXhMcqIEhuUu6ZCkE/+LyjlLfyYB44LNAzDywXe3zqWMgTQAiGDS8Kwb6ujBj\nKOpBcx8Qn6/TaG966oikQzFid6VEs1OSzkjGCibZPvdkVj11m7YMla2btuhGr0IB\nIiEn/JS4WAep/0PB5WBv9vt9xA50g/3qz2N6ciZU76C7Jk9CrrqcVgSmqgmtXP8T\nPti6vPNx3z8FKl/qmYxypOGnZ+5xdicDBtDmEpUdxqUEtP+gMbG2MgrlyVSXOI38\nXz4SiuHI0n627TaDbzhfbVeKPbqHWTVl72ePcPMm4yb7FfkRban4Js3E8TME+D8l\nnROgPWcsZn1ChR02QZtw\n=HuPB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T10:11:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDQ4YmMyNjRlNmM5YTgxNGIxODRlY2Y4MThhNDgwODc0OTU4MDU0MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12","sha":"cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12"}],"sha":"48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/48bc264e6c9a814b184ecf818a4808749580542e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:26:33Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:26:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"One treatment for trial actions, and Ink focus on fields (issue 5) (#102)\n\nCritique 2026-10-06, issue 5. The next-charge strip drew a trial''s\n\"Convert to paid\" and \"Cancel before it charges\" as ghost buttons while the\ntrial section drew the same two actions as Secondary. Both now use the\nbordered Secondary pair at one width, so neither looks like the default,\nand the strip''s \"Mark as cancelled\" matches. On phones the pair stays\nstacked beside the charge, so the strip still ends above the action bar.\n\nA focused field turned its border Signal Red, which is how an error is\ndrawn. Focus on fields is now a 2px Ink frame; an invalid field keeps its\nred border while focused. DESIGN.md says both.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c33818add95d951eca9e4773169077784729cd33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/c33818add95d951eca9e4773169077784729cd33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12","verification":{"payload":"tree c33818add95d951eca9e4773169077784729cd33\nparent 7d97f7c64da71742ff4f61e81c5ca271df5460cd\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791278793 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791278793 +0300\n\nOne treatment for trial actions, and Ink focus on fields (issue 5) (#102)\n\nCritique 2026-10-06, issue 5. The next-charge strip drew a trial''s\n\"Convert to paid\" and \"Cancel before it charges\" as ghost buttons while the\ntrial section drew the same two actions as Secondary. Both now use the\nbordered Secondary pair at one width, so neither looks like the default,\nand the strip''s \"Mark as cancelled\" matches. On phones the pair stays\nstacked beside the charge, so the strip still ends above the action bar.\n\nA focused field turned its border Signal Red, which is how an error is\ndrawn. Focus on fields is now a 2px Ink frame; an invalid field keeps its\nred border while focused. DESIGN.md says both.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxL7JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgC8QAAZuZTcYoZanXkocUow6BB/h\nV/iJxCq0FzOu/DwmKNYUtKLZ7HivWbNFU5+WUyf1+APeY2F49ViblvFSzRR2GvtR\nz1I83cQFJprW+mc+7WdUkXSYpoaO9KLvBi15FyMW2gNozChPtrtlRYvGGNEeXDwk\nnbHp1W7JqP1Lph/YHE8szUibljBu5JWJ7iH3tej26U3gPbA8oqpgTR/itmAtSMnN\ns+AgXLZPMjYTMwlBtYAAl4I07aUsBeY5FihOZfG/dR1/1VsfthSaDvmYFQRlib8Y\nHN8p58JbH/z8QxCT6sNBzwQM8xziZPQhO3qnXVff7HXEF5J+FCH+A+ZUPGHIDSO9\nknOicuaOVb2SHaQpiVlGVMp+8rmvChf5wMATluYfkxNJrNTG+qFyQUofyyIj4eb3\npmulbdf2LMsF91L8jJNopxT4+52b/rlPKJeN5ByPP/hbtpGP0RE4KUtlOZN6zINM\n5X/9pvUgbxSnw3kizoopSCghbqJTzHuPV0+DceBYmu8cOaqlouW0Hlj2yNHo39sG\njBkhuxC7oIq/jS9fpila3mnU67R1KH/CF1QkRBg3DowFlcjG0YnIubV6FJb8ubQK\naFlxnlsoz7N0o1ZyaQRVkMzuIyqxLFepMclccNv4eMJ3/2YTUSKt5CAmygJVVrt5\ncPwsSjZEsuiJR3Og2ncH\n=WrOm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T09:26:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKGNmZWY0ZjZmZWY1MjhhM2E3OGI1N2MwNmNkZDJlOGJkYmFhM2JkMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/7d97f7c64da71742ff4f61e81c5ca271df5460cd","sha":"7d97f7c64da71742ff4f61e81c5ca271df5460cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/7d97f7c64da71742ff4f61e81c5ca271df5460cd"}],"sha":"cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/cfef4f6fef528a3a78b57c06cdd2e8bdbaa3bd12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/7d97f7c64da71742ff4f61e81c5ca271df5460cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:13:39Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:13:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Close the currency honesty gaps from the critique (issue 4) (#101)\n\n- Per month on desktop is in the user''s currency, \"≈\"-marked, with the\n  native figure under it, matching the mobile row and the column''s sort.\n- The hero names the totals'' currency and links to changing it; the\n  Account dialog opens focused on the currency select. On mobile the line\n  sits below the next charge, with the period controls.\n- A change that rounds to €0.00 carries no \"≈\".\n- \"Largest single charge\" becomes \"Largest charge this month / this\n  year\", ranked over the charges that actually fall in the period.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b83f738fef27a0d1e9887562ee02b5e7c3a14eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/5b83f738fef27a0d1e9887562ee02b5e7c3a14eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/7d97f7c64da71742ff4f61e81c5ca271df5460cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b83f738fef27a0d1e9887562ee02b5e7c3a14eb\nparent 8779023b81353c32b03a0bcd5f8981db5456184c\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791278019 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791278019 +0300\n\nClose the currency honesty gaps from the critique (issue 4) (#101)\n\n- Per month on desktop is in the user''s currency, \"≈\"-marked, with the\n  native figure under it, matching the mobile row and the column''s sort.\n- The hero names the totals'' currency and links to changing it; the\n  Account dialog opens focused on the currency select. On mobile the line\n  sits below the next charge, with the period controls.\n- A change that rounds to €0.00 carries no \"≈\".\n- \"Largest single charge\" becomes \"Largest charge this month / this\n  year\", ranked over the charges that actually fall in the period.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxLvDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAvQQAIWi2DOzW3tlMlL1PAPlM2w2\nl39clM4uFgMNWHEJ+PfA2tJGsSGMl/uXGQEpLvbBI/hkI5fanBWOQGqV6NEll6if\nAVIn3hQ0VV6KUPZ9uhKR9vmdnvvtTw90t8PH7JXisp7SQ0kGVOJ15g4ixDMcxglf\nTIWHKyTiaT9kt7jTcqY6I3mfFJ8+xw6ZfGr0wbvrekJsUSTx+Msu5tLY85goxIar\ntDH/jbCcgAfpfhi0uE711CGv7U5yys5YeK649qIe6cfPtXhZwycMw51OVkR9ZziI\nbwm/vhC962E6UqL+eY0KGdR3134vJd7tVyEZPmonioW9GtyorluTp9UkgKC3vsiA\nB7fwRLcudAzeB14JPQ1gQNL/iOVO9Q2WoycR+RiDX3Vd2fq5wEammCebjfAnxnf7\nA+ud7C8ELJlYyBEytgs8E3jkGVPfZ9sigwSj8fb+XgFCfWcofV5+xEPHKa3J3sRB\n7LAMgHR8KGza1nkEOIYQVGu9hg5DKULEu7bRDf8IlQapA9R3ufxtn+UXLlytjVgI\nYHYYpXC29g1ynxXar+NFZl+WCA31413oKt36sEqX9BYW8YwrmRxvpo6RR1CNqGcv\nPEHriKzJZ2xCTQBAp6A2crzPXTcFZ+UO1AxqWCBnT711ZuT+XVUMcdFFl7zQQ3jD\nnk3rZJDJw7fNWRD6Hf9f\n=o/sz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T09:13:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_ev