thub.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/8779023b81353c32b03a0bcd5f8981db5456184c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:02:36Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:02:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Say the trial once, and 44px touch targets on phones (#100)\n\n* Say the trial once, and give every phone button a 44px target\n\nDistill: with one trial converting in the next 30 days, the KPI note now\npoints at the next-charge strip (\"Not counting the trial above\") instead of\nrepeating its name and price, and Coming up''s \"trial converts\" label drops\nfrom red to Ink, so the red is spent once, on the strip with the actions.\nSeveral trials still get their summed price in the note.\n\nAdapt: at 760px and below every .btn has a 44px floor (Log out and Manage\nwere 34-35px), sort chips go 40 -> 44px, the avatar button and the footer\nlink get 44px targets, and the trend''s month letters go 10 -> 12px. The\nper-component 44px rules this replaces are removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update visual baselines for the 44px buttons and the single trial mention\n\nRegenerated in the Playwright CI container. Desktop changes only on the\ndashboards (KPI note, Coming up''s trial label). On mobile every screen with a\nbutton grows it to 44px, including the sign-in, reset and verify forms and\nthe account sheet''s Close, since the floor is one .btn rule at 760px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b79f51c0f423613cff343153fd71e84c7626a45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/0b79f51c0f423613cff343153fd71e84c7626a45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/8779023b81353c32b03a0bcd5f8981db5456184c","verification":{"payload":"tree 0b79f51c0f423613cff343153fd71e84c7626a45\nparent 1fbdbc8eeac5e4c37d414283487754a75bcd4665\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791277356 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791277356 +0300\n\nSay the trial once, and 44px touch targets on phones (#100)\n\n* Say the trial once, and give every phone button a 44px target\n\nDistill: with one trial converting in the next 30 days, the KPI note now\npoints at the next-charge strip (\"Not counting the trial above\") instead of\nrepeating its name and price, and Coming up''s \"trial converts\" label drops\nfrom red to Ink, so the red is spent once, on the strip with the actions.\nSeveral trials still get their summed price in the note.\n\nAdapt: at 760px and below every .btn has a 44px floor (Log out and Manage\nwere 34-35px), sort chips go 40 -> 44px, the avatar button and the footer\nlink get 44px targets, and the trend''s month letters go 10 -> 12px. The\nper-component 44px rules this replaces are removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update visual baselines for the 44px buttons and the single trial mention\n\nRegenerated in the Playwright CI container. Desktop changes only on the\ndashboards (KPI note, Coming up''s trial label). On mobile every screen with a\nbutton grows it to 44px, including the sign-in, reset and verify forms and\nthe account sheet''s Close, since the floor is one .btn rule at 760px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxLksCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHRAQAJn2V9FSU5cj//uvAWjnrWvR\nd019TuunKYOo18IdyPYjNrLRtMcsDNptEViNhE6nstduBLl6TDX/pAuDKKBhcJU9\nAAVYvaAnp5yj7E3K7ACjGU9iP4TEZiaKNG4b2sJxxRuJ7Wpk4vCr90vagkviN39J\nmngJlsG5179eMM0sJIq+LunkA+cuLcwLv/kroHW/ye6fWCujd/uk8wjhLeCl445S\nxlT