,"sha":"8779023b81353c32b03a0bcd5f8981db5456184c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/8779023b81353c32b03a0bcd5f8981db5456184c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/1fbdbc8eeac5e4c37d414283487754a75bcd4665/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:48:23Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:48:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Put the next charge on the first phone screen (#99)\n\nOn a phone the hero showed the total, its prose, the per-currency statement\nand the period controls before the next-charge strip, so the soonest charge\nand a trial''s keep/cancel actions sat below the fold. On mobile the statement\nnow folds to one line naming its currencies, and the strip is rendered before\nthe period controls (in the markup, so focus order follows). On an iPhone 13\nviewport every strip action now ends above the fixed Add bar; a new spec\nasserts that.\n\nOn desktop a single running trial was shown five times. The trial section\nnow renders only when it lists more than the strip already shows: two or\nmore trials, or one whose conversion date has passed.\n\nFixes critique issue 2 (P1) from 2026-10-06.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"929f67a3ca55a9397863238e0cea91fbb511d1b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/929f67a3ca55a9397863238e0cea91fbb511d1b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/1fbdbc8eeac5e4c37d414283487754a75bcd4665","verification":{"payload":"tree 929f67a3ca55a9397863238e0cea91fbb511d1b7\nparent e95c19c960c917892aa42aa1016fdf4b13c517fd\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791276503 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791276503 +0300\n\nPut the next charge on the first phone screen (#99)\n\nOn a phone the hero showed the total, its prose, the per-currency statement\nand the period controls before the next-charge strip, so the soonest charge\nand a trial''s keep/cancel actions sat below the fold. On mobile the statement\nnow folds to one line naming its currencies, and the strip is rendered before\nthe period controls (in the markup, so focus order follows). On an iPhone 13\nviewport every strip action now ends above the fixed Add bar; a new spec\nasserts that.\n\nOn desktop a single running trial was shown five times. The trial section\nnow renders only when it lists more than the strip already shows: two or\nmore trials, or one whose conversion date has passed.\n\nFixes critique issue 2 (P1) from 2026-10-06.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxLXXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABfoQAI/t51hB2fJW7YnevJE5VRtC\nlDqoDyToAY1TMGN2hcOlK0P1st2Fzf+DlOf1DbYJfjpuclA5NF9bwyzNGJ