mits/8264a3e0740335cd61e1897e8462680f70923277"}],"sha":"e95c19c960c917892aa42aa1016fdf4b13c517fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/e95c19c960c917892aa42aa1016fdf4b13c517fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/8264a3e0740335cd61e1897e8462680f70923277/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:18:44Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:18:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Multi-currency support (milestone 10) (#97)\n\n* Add currencies and ECB rate conversion to the API\n\nEach subscription now has a currency, and each user has a currency for\ntotals. Both default to EUR, which is what every existing row already was.\n\n/summary/spend, /upcoming and /summary/monthly-total convert into the\nuser''s currency at European Central Bank reference rates. A past charge\nuses its own day''s rate and a coming one the latest rate. Each charge is\nrounded to the cent before summing, so a total always matches its\nper-currency lines.\n\nRates come from Frankfurter on demand and are cached in a new fx_rates\ntable. If the provider fails, stored rates are used and the response is\nmarked stale. A currency with no rate at all is left out of totals and\nreported, not guessed. A provider outage is retried at most every ten\nminutes.\n\nNew: PATCH /me {currency} and GET /rates. A subscription''s currency is\nfixed once added: an edit that changes it gets a 422, and restore can\nstart the new run in another currency. Backups move to version 4 with a\ncurrency field (and a CSV column). Older files import in the user''s\ncurrency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Return each subscription''s paid total in the user''s currency\n\nGET /subscriptions now adds paid_total_converted next to paid_total. It\nis the same figure with each past charge converted at its own day''s ECB\nrate, which is what a lifetime line adds up when a service''s runs were\nbilled in different currencies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show subscriptions in their own currency and totals converted\n\nEach subscription now shows its cost in its own currency, and every\ntotal is in the user''s currency, marked ≈ when it includes a\nconversion:\n- The hero lists what charged in each currency when the period mixes\n  them, with the rate date, and says so when the rates are stale.\n- The next-charge strip, Coming up, trial rows and table sub-notes add\n  \"≈ €17.05\" after a foreign amount.\n- The KPI band notes when a change since last month comes only from the\n  exchange rate.\n- Sorting compares converted values.\n\nThe add form joins a currency picker to the cost field, defaulting to\nthe user''s currency. An edit shows the currency as fixed text, and the\nReactivate dialog is where a service can move to another currency. The\nAccount dialog has a Currency section after Language. Backups read and\nwrite a currency column. Strings are in English and Finnish.\n\nA euro-only account looks exactly as before: the dashboard golden is\nunchanged. New visual baselines cover the mixed-currency dashboard and\nthe add form on both layouts. The UI mock seeds a USD and a GBP plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"487c3bc9f0b7615c4e47de01e6b2feb89673a026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/487c3bc9f0b7615c4e47de01e6b2feb89673a026"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/8264a3e0740335cd61e1897e8462680f70923277","verification":{"payload":"tree 487c3bc9f0b7615c4e47de01e6b2feb89673a026\nparent d373375cd77dbf85b232cc728afaebc945f2ba42\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791271124 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791271124 +0300\n\nMulti-currency support (milestone 10) (#97)\n\n* Add currencies and ECB rate conversion to the API\n\nEach subscription now has a currency, and each user has a currency for\ntotals. Both default to EUR, which is what every existing row already was.\n\n/summary/spend, /upcoming and /summary/monthly-total convert into the\nuser''s currency at European Central Bank reference rates. A past charge\nuses its own day''s rate and a coming one the latest rate. Each charge is\nrounded to the cent before summing, so a total always matches its\nper-currency lines.\n\nRates come from Frankfurter on demand and are cached in a new fx_rates\ntable. If the provider fails, stored rates are used and the response is\nmarked stale. A currency with no rate at all is left out of totals and\nreported, not guessed. A provider outage is retried at most every ten\nminutes.\n\nNew: PATCH /me {currency} and GET /rates. A subscription''s currency is\nfixed once added: an edit that changes it gets a 422, and restore can\nstart the new run in another currency. Backups move to version 4 with a\ncurrency field (and a CSV column). Older files import in the user''s\ncurrency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Return each subscription''s paid total in the user''s currency\n\nGET /subscriptions now adds paid_total_converted next to paid_total. It\nis the same figure with each past charge converted at its own day''s ECB\nrate, which is what a lifetime line adds up when a service''s runs were\nbilled in different currencies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show subscriptions in their own currency and totals converted\n\nEach subscription now shows its cost in its own currency, and every\ntotal is in the user''s currency, marked ≈ when it includes a\nconversion:\n- The hero lists what charged in each currency when the period mixes\n  them, with the rate date, and says so when the rates are stale.\n- The next-charge strip, Coming up, trial rows and table sub-notes add\n  \"≈ €17.05\" after a foreign amount.\n- The KPI band notes when a change since last month comes only from the\n  exchange rate.\n- Sorting compares converted values.\n\nThe add form joins a currency picker to the cost field, defaulting to\nthe user''s currency. An edit shows the currency as fixed text, and the\nReactivate dialog is where a service can move to another currency. The\nAccount dialog has a Currency section after Language. Backups read and\nwrite a currency column. Strings are in English and Finnish.\n\nA euro-only account looks exactly as before: the dashboard golden is\nunchanged. New visual baselines cover the mixed-currency dashboard and\nthe add form on both layouts. The UI mock seeds a USD and a GBP plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxKDUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAasEQAEm8812kEmeKuPMLahdnjfe5\nhh8wnPHmmLIHPnv5ZXNO1jjGFoCM7Zd/DNw3YZ+M+C1brFEyTLNOiwLFQOeKl2qO\nyEGGneq1NvID7kW0EMKoH2Okd7V4KM7Jbi+WNa4Yyr1Dl+2rLal0pYx/iNojAA0J\n2wHWAQO3lxcDxHTLorZPYz+AxiA+UhYcToMwj6+6MBDcK9NA8Ba6g2OV9/2oTZQp\nj8yv8pM6ylGTXgHmUpJV6gU8gCo/bTzgjKui2VgXJ1tXoNUrID7ZcMi5fGopAApc\nrFwrqFcBxPFNIzdf7mNwB+2mc9GNu7OYoAq4IsAwp2WdOqV7vJXo1IURqfJX65IQ\nbPjvuzNRM4WikQe6JFp5iELWK+gKR1XgCqC1wBFdhMC0G3mly5s0O2MC7rxe/1Vi\nzoG6E3wh6q5d9Mwpx41qjfa+h9PA1sdfRIKxlZAhGk1iwP8xg6/nHNnrCtSdB4r0\nf7b8TitysV/eY0DwTkiAbpoVN6WG7N/RNfDKbR5U8SvibqNLVmkzBh2Pq0ZQivnc\noAULedHXFO2JUgVAnAYu41rjfpDd+0iV7S9lu89P6ztl6STXY8wJE85JjZQFPxaA\n3jHV6wZkfv04JV1RCdfjLtfJf8Br4sEUZw/lse6o72+0UyoPrnAm9aj/MunM58Vo\nteg++kuvBU/lZVcSI/RN\n=Y8N3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T07:18:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/8264a3e0740335cd61e1897e8462680f70923277","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDgyNjRhM2UwNzQwMzM1Y2Q2MWUxODk3ZTg0NjI2ODBmNzA5MjMyNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/d373375cd77dbf85b232cc728afaebc945f2ba42","sha":"d373375cd77dbf85b232cc728afaebc945f2ba42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/d373375cd77dbf85b232cc728afaebc945f2ba42"}],"sha":"8264a3e0740335cd61e1897e8462680f70923277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/8264a3e0740335cd61e1897e8462680f70923277"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/d373375cd77dbf85b232cc728afaebc945f2ba42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:58:41Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:58:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Plan milestone 10: multi-currency support (#96)\n\n* Plan milestone 10: multi-currency support\n\nSettle the open questions in PLAN.md''s milestone 10: totals convert into\nthe user''s currency at ECB reference rates (via Frankfurter, cached in\nPostgres) and are marked ≈, with a per-currency statement under the hero\nwhen currencies mix. Past charges convert at their own day''s rate.\n\nAdd a refreshed mock, docs/mocks/milestone-10-multi-currency.html, built\non the shipped modernist.css and dashboard.css. It covers mixed and single\ncurrency, stale rates, desktop and mobile, the add form, the locked\ncurrency in an edit, and the Account dialog''s Currency section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Record the multi-currency decisions in PRODUCT.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a66f99bfc21e22b3aade8b70217ba76567bbca8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/a66f99bfc21e22b3aade8b70217ba76567bbca8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/d373375cd77dbf85b232cc728afaebc945f2ba42","verification":{"payload":"tree a66f99bfc21e22b3aade8b70217ba76567bbca8d\nparent 6ad39e1821c08b0402c1e89ae50f1fbac3c03f73\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791269921 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791269921 +0300\n\nPlan milestone 10: multi-currency support (#96)\n\n* Plan milestone 10: multi-currency support\n\nSettle the open questions in PLAN.md''s milestone 10: totals convert into\nthe user''s currency at ECB reference rates (via Frankfurter, cached in\nPostgres) and are marked ≈, with a per-currency statement under the hero\nwhen currencies mix. Past charges convert at their own day''s rate.\n\nAdd a refreshed mock, docs/mocks/milestone-10-multi-currency.html, built\non the shipped modernist.css and dashboard.css. It covers mixed and single\ncurrency, stale rates, desktop and mobile, the add form, the locked\ncurrency in an edit, and the Account dialog''s Currency section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Record the multi-currency decisions in PRODUCT.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxJwhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6LcQABFdKVBpUp3qJr6g2FV2VBzh\nMZNCqbQC9G5p6RtUSI73fOf64LbRnOGffYXxk2hoxyYQnVW9DGfHDMPbaxw8pzyR\nTMal+kGSVXoCk91IOS0J46/3BTVEf3XC6mMrU8X8+UCQ2xyXugzjvsbIIhix71H6\n21a4Ed1JM6pxtAK9rY5WBEj5Y3EGUmoMG96h8ghP3c9duXF/L89/0rHCydaJ3D2n\noVJ5SqjZg4HExTXk4Ypa4v3QPBaRVlWVpxKp6cLzUVKTvatLkrAYf5fNewePjqDG\nC++yf0iQwARQL6BVFPbWcq80gr9D0bZF2qIU8fEBPDYgBrrLINYNwuLuruwDEpQQ\nIctRgE6nMcfM9pxdml2L1/O6hbmTWn9JFHzuRrUzTQOFFq4IzIr3wSZxYcd4aa5g\nUEb8XAY0d0ZnLmqHjRJHMAqwbyioAVXAQGE50YWmKHnMfUs4nwf4f0slZkSE/3eb\nK2z+TtwQ7Z4X7ITSY8IHpyIjyTy3QCYWjKj1NXrB4yrfL1W0sbYKMzHxW13ewnXI\nH+7drGOjgtYkGf/TzhFkBy47feqHKA5AWoQiLPk6Fw/gj1mBRkD/lE97Zfc1t/eN\nj2xkhfu6OhgLIux+jnZqZyaR4hjIquvRVDzLe2bj1XbCtfK6R992b64aZ1lnF1aW\n7Ah3vEgcP96X0OfX0oPt\n=BqcK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T06:58:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","