b.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bring README and PLAN up to date with what has shipped (#95)\n\nREADME had drifted since milestone 6-8: it described three containers\n(Redis is a fourth), one hardcoded CORS origin, 143 backend-only tests\nand no browser tests, and it left out the account, archive and email\nroutes, rate limits, token_version, the Finnish translation, the visual\ntest workflow and the issue #88 mock.\n\nPLAN''s data model and folder tree were the milestone-1 sketch, milestone\n7 still said the invite code goes once step 9 lands, and the milestone\n10 currency mocks now carry a note listing the dashboard changes made\nsince they were drawn on 2026-09-06.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1341a55c663207d8f4e0009b426cee60c21e7c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/b1341a55c663207d8f4e0009b426cee60c21e7c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/6ad39e1821c08b0402c1e89ae50f1fbac3c03f73","verification":{"payload":"tree b1341a55c663207d8f4e0009b426cee60c21e7c5\nparent b23e7011993ab9bd3b43927c1afa7fdc9f06e038\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791265358 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791265358 +0300\n\nBring README and PLAN up to date with what has shipped (#95)\n\nREADME had drifted since milestone 6-8: it described three containers\n(Redis is a fourth), one hardcoded CORS origin, 143 backend-only tests\nand no browser tests, and it left out the account, archive and email\nroutes, rate limits, token_version, the Finnish translation, the visual\ntest workflow and the issue #88 mock.\n\nPLAN''s data model and folder tree were the milestone-1 sketch, milestone\n7 still said the invite code goes once step 9 lands, and the milestone\n10 currency mocks now carry a note listing the dashboard changes made\nsince they were drawn on 2026-09-06.\n\nCo-authored-by: