acker/commit/6ad39e1821c08b0402c1e89ae50f1fbac3c03f73","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDZhZDM5ZTE4MjFjMDhiMDQwMmMxZTg5YWU1MGYxZmJhYzNjMDNmNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/b23e7011993ab9bd3b43927c1afa7fdc9f06e038","sha":"b23e7011993ab9bd3b43927c1afa7fdc9f06e038","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b23e7011993ab9bd3b43927c1afa7fdc9f06e038"}],"sha":"6ad39e1821c08b0402c1e89ae50f1fbac3c03f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/6ad39e1821c08b0402c1e89ae50f1fbac3c03f73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b23e7011993ab9bd3b43927c1afa7fdc9f06e038/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T05:12:29Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T05:12:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add password reset and email verification (milestone 9) (#94)\n\nNew accounts get a confirmation link by email and stay fully usable\nbefore clicking it. \"Forgot your password?\" on the sign-in screen sends\na reset link that works once, for 1 hour, signs out every other session\nand confirms the address. Unconfirmed accounts can reset too.\n\nLinks carry signed JWTs with a purpose claim instead of rows in a token\ntable, and get_current_user refuses any token that has one. Mail goes\nout through Resend in production and is logged locally (EMAIL_BACKEND).\nThe invite code stays while the app is in beta.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b91c51909ad89439e4e3a6aafcf9ce5c7d259e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/3b91c51909ad89439e4e3a6aafcf9ce5c7d259e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/b23e7011993ab9bd3b43927c1afa7fdc9f06e038","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b91c51909ad89439e4e3a6aafcf9ce5c7d259e2\nparent ebf40f65fb6188b2fd6405283f6fa4dad2b43600\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791263549 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791263549 +0300\n\nAdd password reset and email verification (milestone 9) (#94)\n\nNew accounts get a confirmation link by email and stay fully usable\nbefore clicking it. \"Forgot your password?\" on the sign-in screen sends\na reset link that works once, for 1 hour, signs out every other session\nand confirms the address. Unconfirmed accounts can reset too.\n\nLinks carry signed JWTs with a purpose claim instead of rows in a token\ntable, and get_current_user refuses any token that has one. Mail goes\nout through Resend in production and is logged locally (EMAIL_BACKEND).\nThe invite code stays while the app is in beta.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxIM9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwzEQAFcS4w+P6Kv