3,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/e8081ef321a77a51ec93143d48d145bd65c808e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:47:05Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:47:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add a Finnish translation and a language picker (#89) (#92)\n\nThe interface speaks English or Finnish. The default follows the\nbrowser''s preferred languages; a choice made on the sign-in screen or in\nthe Account dialog is remembered on the device. Switching re-renders in\nplace, so an open dialog, the period and the sort survive it.\n\nNo i18n library: src/i18n.js holds t() and the language state, messages\nlive per area in src/locales/, plurals and Finnish inflection are small\nfunctions. Money, dates and month names follow the language (\"1 234,56 €\",\n\"4.9.2026\"), and the server''s user-facing error details are translated on\nthe client. check:locales fails CI when a key exists in one language only.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"968282ca4afbc96bdf6bf7ca68d24440e3bde367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/968282ca4afbc96bdf6bf7ca68d24440e3bde367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/e8081ef321a77a51ec93143d48d145bd65c808e7",