com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/d54765d157dbb47ccf6b03294ea95bf788556b5c"}],"sha":"083748e461d4058d6193544c4bd7db17dd49a992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/083748e461d4058d6193544c4bd7db17dd49a992"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/d54765d157dbb47ccf6b03294ea95bf788556b5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:29:51Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:29:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show what each subscription has cost to date (#88) (#90)\n\n* Mock: show what each subscription has cost to date (#88)\n\nA static design mock for issue #88, following the #49 mock''s format.\nThe list''s Started column becomes a sortable Paid to date column, the\nmobile row gains a third line and a Paid sort chip, and the mobile\ndetail sheet splits a group''s total from this run''s share. Every\nfigure is the existing per-run paid_total, so no backend change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Ignore the mock toolbar''s cramped-padding finding in the #88 mock\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show what each subscription has cost to date (#88)\n\nThe list''s Started column becomes a sortable Paid to date column: the\nwhole group''s paid_total, with a note saying the span it covers or why\nthere is no figure. It sorts largest first, unknown figures last either\nway, and search matches it. On mobile it is the row''s third line, with\na Paid sort chip, and a head row''s detail sheet splits out this run''s\nshare. The lifetime line under an open group now splits the total into\nthis run and the earlier runs. The list guide explains the term, and\nthe published UI mock''s API returns paid_total like the real one.\n\nBookmarks with sort=started fall back to the default sort.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"968d84324bda684c510e29490939eb547120fc2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/968d84324bda684c510e29490939eb547120fc2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/d54765d157dbb47ccf6b03294ea95bf788556b5c","verification":{"payload":"tree 968d84324bda684c510e29490939eb547120fc2a\nparent adee0007b2890e6a146e2be04e15becc2dfffb1a\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791260991 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791260991 +0300\n\nShow what each subscription has cost to date (#88) (#90)\n\n* Mock: show what each subscription has cost to date (#88)\n\nA static design mock for issue #88, following the #49 mock''s format.\nThe list''s Started column becomes a sortable Paid to date column, the\nmobile row gains a third line and a Paid sort chip, and the mobile\ndetail sheet splits a group''s total from this run''s share. Every\nfigure is the existing per-run paid_total, so no backend change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Ignore the mock toolbar''s cramped-padding finding in the #88 mock\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show what each subscription has cost to date (#88)\n\nThe list''s Started column becomes a sortable Paid to date column: the\nwhole group''s paid_total, with a note saying the span it covers or why\nthere is no figure. It sorts largest first, unknown figures last either\nway, and search matches it. On mobile it is the row''s third line, with\na Paid sort chip, and a head row''s detail sheet splits out this run''s\nshare. The lifetime line under an open group now splits the total into\nthis run and the earlier runs. The list guide explains the term, and\nthe published UI mock''s API returns paid_total like the real one.\n\nBookmarks with sort=started fall back to the default sort.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxHk/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaV4QABbc0ZidWlwYomORJYIIuwrf\nz0uCLKDqzoMzue8JApnzVqcsx2rdwIktZrNH7uVLdXcxz3D5J+IcfQBugKyYyKyG\npZcT5zH1jGf/cIRg2B/F3P2bwHovbZD2mCLy+sYkhi+UAtTh/ymxTIM7l1YmDkvG\nF4kj4LaoPqXJa8WNl0HcxCzs4EnovMZTIJqaKD+CZwYfN2VsoY1vDBmqzWLgnWhx\nFt9IIOVO1f7GRUGhOXpwNZNK4usemG2C3pcKyHCCOOeKOBChLm+jNi8yPKK5Ijcg\nab9sSta/hY0D+HA8MM4iAgif78SOzdezt0koQcJBYiyKvo0Frd9F8jLIEUXgSm1p\n67Wvm4EU5nLLpAJCPbVWXW8rPilvxZ1WiePGQbRRTRiK0p1nei607OsqFr7Qk1xq\naxgq0RyCa9ZDpRb2rI6yX2b3lPvHtZgUprc2BA26Vujn+woGgBkCLqYlUe/w+FOZ\nnPjToImeSSocVxQ4YB8tPmKqk7RG7QBs3SFA8i9MqfO8QHBc/DE5ErqaoayjeHEg\nj0CJBVZDKyVZYbrAbK3IjNonQvRRakqgHqcr/D7BQ31DlFf7UL7c0KmAsa5dPX/+\n/1NtsxkxSP3bPsIWkj5bm3aPLWUgJ2ipMN6QIGe9kr6OLajZmnELaJ2JshiybTdA\n/uVZnOHRentCGLFKZ7bi\n=MaLL\n-----END P