ers/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/adee0007b2890e6a146e2be04e15becc2dfffb1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:50:53Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:50:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Polish the dashboard''s loose ends from the critique (#87)\n\n- Spotify''s tile: black on its green (white was 2.6:1).\n- .hint leading 18px instead of 14px on 13px text.\n- Sort arrows are hidden from screen readers; aria-sort on the header,\n  and a spoken direction on the mobile chip, say which way instead.\n- Ended plans sort last whichever way the list is sorted, rather than\n  topping the default renewal sort with a past date.\n- The period picker marks today''s month or year (aria-current, underlined\n  like the nav''s current page).\n- \"Review trials in the table\" scrolls to the list it re-sorts.\n- The URL says ?ended=1, after the button; an old ?cancelled=1 bookmark\n  still opens Show ended.\n- Mobile: Import & export and the left KPI cells sit on the page edge\n  instead of 20-22px in.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4cce1fdff35f1960a686423752b085982d672166","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/4cce1fdff35f1960a686423752b085982d672166"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/adee0007b2890e6a146e2be04e15becc2dfffb1a","verification":{"payload":"tree 4cce1fdff35f1960a686423752b085982d672166\nparent bbbd0f6629074a656d6d49105c4ac5c8f3e482b3\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791222653 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791222653 +0300\n\nPolish the dashboard''s loose ends from the critique (#87)\n\n- Spotify''s tile: black on its green (white was 2.6:1).\n- .hint leading 18px instead of 14px on 13px text.\n- Sort arrows are hidden from screen readers; aria-sort on the header,\n  and a spoken direction on the mobile chip, say which way instead.\n- Ended plans sort last whichever way the list is sorted, rather than\n  topping the default renewal sort with a past date.\n- The period picker marks today''s month or year (aria-current, underlined\n  like the nav''s current page).\n- \"Review trials in the table\" scrolls to the list it re-sorts.\n- The URL says ?ended=1, after the button; an old ?cancelled=1 bookmark\n  still opens Show ended.\n- Mobile: Import & export and the left KPI cells sit on the page edge\n  instead of 20-22px in.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw+N9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAocUQAJ91CrqDI6dtavDfwX7cWs2b\nuSOZAOKLNU8kftxc6JJmIDaifH8cZtyPZiEljC7tOdeG9i544nKe066j8CxIfs22\nx4AWxlP0dPg2Xfa7ZCBiz3wO7CyIndEw8Q2cjoBrEVlCThyGv34s1TQVgVXDwRN1\nQ6X2Be9fOPupKlBfOLchkInkPBZwaT0rkvxgCRO6ML4pfQeoI8RuJkzvDZkef3TK\nP+80Jb69ozRp7P1HqxWxPwuMvrSVzynAIENpqcSQYR5KrONi4koD3N4XyoMUhABK\nW8BQFC8X+PllUvjCzEZAo60+GBoPA6f/fshgvuPJP7/D5igSnt8hf0qZA1Z+30Zq\nXzjittgmOlLGu0CoTI+hZ0GIB0ie0oVHa/7s1gtisrlv9GBHWGAPSqp+esdvTm+R\nqGJFVkmujmqHGzbNU5CHIStH0zOp3bnPrzYRbUrp0bFRUsr2/G/vn8FVmT13UKeC\nW4rAYGHC1MHe7vyTVU26djJjPkzjVK1YOF3GjY17/QoQkdfr