acy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/bbbd0f6629074a656d6d49105c4ac5c8f3e482b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:47:16Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:47:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Explain the list''s own words where they appear (#86)\n\nOnboarding pass from the 2026-10-05 dashboard critique (help and\ndocumentation scored 2/10).\n\nA folded \"How this list works\" section now sits under the list. It\ndefines each status as the list sets it (Active, Scheduled, Trial,\nPaused, Cancelled), plus ended against archived and what an earlier run\nis. On desktop it also lists the keys: / and N, which nothing on the\npage showed before, plus Enter and Esc. It is folded by default, so a\nreturning user passes over one ruled line.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f0cd310f12a6960deff8534344d46269b333bce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/8f0cd310f12a6960deff8534344d46269b333bce"},"u