3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/c49911c0bf13f3c3b38bc5b0ae3adfa405c46832/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:39:55Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:39:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Close the hero on one rule, name idle categories, end trials on their rows (#85)\n\nLayout pass from the 2026-10-05 dashboard critique.\n\n- The next-charge strip''s last hairline and the 2px rule after the hero\n  stood 42px apart. The strip now ends on the section rule.\n- A category whose plans billed nothing in the period (a trial, a yearly\n  plan renewing later) was missing from By category, so the half sat\n  empty and disagreed with the hero''s \"in 2 categories\". It is now named\n  in a quiet \"Nothing billed in September\" line under the bars.\n- \"Review trials in the table\" moves into the trial section''s head, so\n  the section ends on its last trial instead of a stranded link and a\n  second doubled rule.\n- Coming up''s row rules run unbroken under all three columns.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0284f44a40a1964aaaf8026e7d31f17b2a8ac55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/f0284f44a40a1964aaaf8026e7d31f17b2a8ac55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/c49911c0bf13f