l":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/4568f0ae9aa99afe8e216531aa132cbec63ec7cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:17:48Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:17:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Make clear that cancelling here does not cancel with the provider (#81)\n\nCritique issue 2. The cancel dialog read as if it acted on the real\nservice, showed when access ends only after confirming, and offered\nDelete permanently inside the cancel decision.\n\n- Title and button now say \"Mark as cancelled\", and the first line says\n  this updates your records only and to cancel with the provider too.\n- The date access ends is worked out as the date changes and shown\n  before confirming (renewals.accessEndsAfter mirrors the server).\n- A trial asks for no date, because the server ignores it, and names the\n  conversion date the user has to beat.\n- A paused plan defaults to its pause date, as the server would.\n- Delete permanently is gone from the dialog; it stays in the row menu.\n- The row menu, next-charge strip and save notice use the same verb.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c97e3967da8b672f77c02a1beeed34e36ddfd0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/5c97e3967da8b672f77c02a1beeed34e36ddfd0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/4568f0ae9aa99afe8e216531aa132cbec63ec7cb","verification":{"payload":"tree 5c97e3967da8b672f77c02a1beeed34e36ddfd0f\nparent b664316d5ebf5b5cd4254889cc51c25eec5a57c1\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791206268 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791206268 +0300\n\nMake clear that cancelling here does not cancel with the provider (#81)\n\nCritique issue 2. The cancel dialog read as if it acted on the real\nservice, showed when access ends only after confirming, and offered\nDelete permanently inside the cancel decision.\n\n- Title and button now say \"Mark as cancelled\", and the first line says\n  this updates your records only and to cancel with the provider too.\n- The date access ends is worked out as the date changes and shown\n  before confirming (renewals.accessEndsAfter mirrors the server).\n- A trial asks for no date, because the server ignores it, and names the\n  conversion date the user has to beat.\n- A paused plan defaults to its pause date, as the server would.\n- Delete permanently is gone from the dialog; it stays in the row menu.\n- The row menu, next-charge strip and save notice use the same verb.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw6N8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlnsQAGPeqFjHIuRsQbL4q/nfRj8O\nCYhMaDbWDG6AedcgtefidVjWmCU6Sd9yn0W2yLIcrXpRBqOpiUIkKjdbbu0H1NXD\nU+eeH/oRuulrfc59yCYg9uj1oIsKD3qVdbmOkeHlkYAx8Roiiw3vh+h8flxs7i2k\nFCH66ZA0QRjrlSmE4sirm1/waVpV0wKaU5iuvQjG/yXBrlIRrT5hFoBUWdptRpeE\nAgNXGzwn65cSbv5wk4XYRDmfZF6O1PykY+IwMGZ0PHN2bLLyIPIXhg+x7Z7EQp1h\nz7C+u9v38YayLzcDa+/e/7jOLnPi