maa/subscription-tracker/commits/4568f0ae9aa99afe8e216531aa132cbec63ec7cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b664316d5ebf5b5cd4254889cc51c25eec5a57c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:09:38Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:09:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show a trial''s price the same way everywhere: \"if kept\" (#80)\n\nComing up showed a converting trial at €0.00 while the next-charge strip\nand the trial banner showed its real price, and the 30-day KPI left it out\nwithout saying so. Now Coming up, the strip and the banner all give the\nprice with \"if kept\", and the KPI says which trial it is not counting and\nwhat it would add. Totals still exclude trials until they charge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40d3daf977b5750024cb132ff10f4c5833b14087","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/40d3daf977b5750024cb132ff10f4c5833b14087"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/b664316d5ebf5b5cd4254889cc51c25eec5a57c1","verification":{"payload":"tree 40d3daf977b5750024cb132ff10f4c5833b14087\nparent 6a14b9ee4d094872681a1af7b95c5a86b7677464\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791205778 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791205778 +0300\n\nShow a trial''s price the same way everywhere: \"if kept\" (#80)\n\nComing up showed a converting trial at €0.00 while the next-charge strip\nand the trial banner showed its real price, and the 30-day KPI left it out\nwithout saying so. Now Coming up, the strip and the banner all give the\nprice with \"if kept\", and the KPI says which trial it is not counting and\nwhat it would add. Totals still exclude trials until they charge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw6GSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3XkQAKww23K6hW3nLUjm6V8HL82n\nlgaME9XdYv0aY9lKfeifDLhtFqh1xxCa72It45vdsuFaBDlihxAkhaLPV++zHhNt\nG1Bz0xhJczqYjOeZiwT5UHC2t2W/2xvTESu08zMRE/+EzuYUHkvSerUBu9p+gpLw\nv5CeVoi43W/5w2zcnvQaYq7feEgNYn0dzknA2Qh/r1k9WyHnnmfgE2NCJajot9wy\nfovj9LbJU37va3iwuBYDeoMClNd2+oOdUT0KkHxpwwiCFQ6g4jsb1R7krVNGHolR\n7BCHIznTAdst+5lavDWvmb0POR5Ra0LowNIixgyDnlNDzjslhvk0wZemMuovaJGc\n8GE0XJBvxTz1pxAL6DWyrjLwXxpiVJnL17L0QbVMBwVH6oTQF3rkbwd4pi2Fa6aP\nIisYghjZoVxtZF8zSF44/v23fVhZHylLuFsQ+Xr0geyitAf4a1PJtmBzCIZ/I9Jr\n5xMCqYNl6zNF3RiJfJVo7GW8O5TA1U5ae35wTp9q/Cnn7zxkg2BQgPAAwc+4jjXf\nZZVFd98quWH+Z1qLhuvpJ4u2SGHQkSz6wNS3qjhJzsJNiIcNS+5+EM/e/vynuEy5\n9eEdfN2fjvjFLV8m6FyN+5iOFIALnmwzHqUOR9BAd1nDPm9GgityVaGQnYJZPQXx\nTPoF9+3vWaU9iXLQ6aCn\n=GXuj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T13:09:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","