celled plan is paid up front, so it keeps working until the term\nalready paid for runs out. Until then it now stays in the list in full\nink with its Cancelled tag and \"access ends\" date. Once access has ended\nit goes grey and moves behind the toggle, renamed \"Show ended\", along\nwith \"Archive all ended\". The ?cancelled=1 URL key is kept so old\nbookmarks still work.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw50OCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApCYQADCWFlY1nQnqSkGcCh86ZEXy\nqb8WH7f2CRGp7FPUSdN/WMEr6XW9hAsP2+lPeP8wgiD+U5Xg3TVgpqfNMlrC/ozH\nopkD2bfcbQlIz4dULeWy9Y4T+U8dMNibyRwTWYZrx0SzgX19s1bSyeE9t0roy56G\nvJsHAMn0fbjUduVSmv6v/mRIKJ3gG/7X+tcwT4miDV5MxEN851i50PgeEkFSFne9\nFaRet6pm+8l+VOgsyKIgQ+Uwym/DHQdRGf79hIN/5qObUVyuNIHz5hEriL0A8Bsi\n0oVXV0moTUyyjsFZLA+OlkFWSRSIl1wwT3wxuXCQypeBhIp4asGaSrwTAwMrbYh8\n0rByAcgvgu6d7pPITm2LWkGiEPshK+KeffKPwLTbJ5omKBbXzQD5HU9QiQJLnngJ\npz+p/D1H+j1MyAGYEYS95q6Ffnk8PSMPu+BCNWU52H0QjsRZlKZYxg9XMpzKTvXR\n1MYNFHOfSLJGe0JpXYIxmSMjDtnGCs5tcx77K1BuUzqJ+/qlRNG/4UJsVXDMaU/z\ngzaM7DX6FOh2+n/yfBZCCbTtLH9I384NykXrslmt5CGZnbx4K8ugZTP0Wi2c7U86\ndQAI6k2ae7Sm08HsHilPt1ndAcBpklQe/o2h3z++RPc7Doj/dGE7RW3XvwIa5U9H\nfmLqhtIu4F3xHVGLUt7m\n=l267\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T12:50:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/