cker/commits/97967a5efc0832b9d16328d66acd4619b5f5bb80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:33:55Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:33:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show cancelled plans in By category for the months they billed (#54) (#78)\n\nThe category list and the per-category spend requests both skipped\ncancelled subscriptions, so a category whose only plan was cancelled\nshowed nothing, even for the months the server says it billed. Both now\nconsider every subscription and leave the per-period filtering to the\nserver''s subscription_ids. The Uncategorised members line uses the same\nrule, from the all-subscriptions breakdown.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba63b42fca68ab4f7fb940dfcf4643e11e475265","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/ba63b42fca68ab4f7fb940dfcf4643e11e475265"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/97967a5efc0832b9d16328d66acd4619b5f5bb80","verification":{"payload":"tree ba63b42fca68ab4f7fb940dfcf4643e11e475265\nparent b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791203635 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791203635 +0300\n\nShow cancelled plans in By category for the months they billed (#54) (#78)\n\nThe category list and the per-category spend requests both skipped\ncancelled subscriptions, so a category whose only plan was cancelled\nshowed nothing, even for the months the server says it billed. Both now\nconsider every subscription and leave the per-period filtering to the\nserver''s subscription_ids. The Uncategorised members line uses the same\nrule, from the all-subscriptions breakdown.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@an