Dk3OTY3YTVlZmMwODMyYjlkMTYzMjhkNjZhY2Q0NjE5YjVmNWJiODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08","sha":"b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08"}],"sha":"97967a5efc0832b9d16328d66acd4619b5f5bb80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/97967a5efc0832b9d16328d66acd4619b5f5bb80"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:26:26Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:26:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Enter to save, view in the URL, / and n shortcuts, archive all cancelled (#67) (#77)\n\n- Enter in any field of the inline edit row (and the mobile edit sheet)\n  saves it. A <form> can''t wrap a table row, so it''s a keydown handler.\n- Period, sort and the cancelled/archived toggles live in the query\n  string (viewUrl.js), so \"Yearly 2025\" can be bookmarked and survives a\n  reload. Only non-default values are written; replaceState, not\n  pushState.\n- \"/\" focuses search and \"n\" opens the add form, except while typing,\n  with a modifier, or with a dialog open. The search placeholder says\n  \"press /\" on desktop; the Add button has a title and aria-keyshortcuts.\n- \"Archive all cancelled — N\" shows while the cancelled list is on\n  screen, with Undo in the save notice.\n\nDesktop baselines regenerated for the new search placeholder.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c74f3b50ab9292ecc7a8b744b30c134e056b7ab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/c74f3b50ab9292ecc7a8b744b30c134e056b7ab8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08","verification":{"payload":"tree c74f3b50ab9292ecc7a8b744b30c134e056b7ab8\nparent 62aa4e2fc354341fa4a9c3ed96d189fa9529f70f\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791203186 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791203186 +0300\n\nEnter to save, view in the URL, / and n shortcuts, archive all cancelled (#67) (#77)\n\n- Enter in any field of the inline edit row (and the mobile edit sheet)\n  saves it. A <form> can''t wrap a table row, so it''s a keydown handler.\n- Period, sort and the cancelled/archived toggles live in the query\n  string (viewUrl.js), so \"Yearly 2025\" can be bookmarked and survives a\n  reload. Only non-default values are written; replaceState, not\n  pushState.\n- \"/\" focuses search and \"n\" opens the add form, except while typing,\n  with a modifier, or with a dialog open. The search placeholder says\n  \"press /\" on desktop; the Add button has a title and aria-keyshortcuts.\n- \"Archive all cancelled — N\" shows while the cancelled list is on\n  screen, with Undo in the save notice.\n\nDesktop baselines regenerated for the new search placeholder.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw5dyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1x4QAEun+KmoB9phhzugEnhjgHYx\nO1jkChRsimDiU6QJwmxeL99BdZMGnVLrVf1yPoB52sbsIkutjtKxm7r15/0A/AQ6\nfGODyvCFCAnaWuA+2x2oAmKwMMdi+gvdQ5OiLex2PMGG+j44j9/RqPEfKH4kHKlB\nP80KfGNcmeJHNHYrdnwPB+Blux60jtdIi7SwJJpgO7aVsjHDErVMtSNN84H315UZ\nGon4A2IMtgr8cR5bU+VAxhQVqHxcC+AJTDW6/o5NwjJZg2UvBjSY2cSVBlrhEyFK\ngQFKCtmUTlI+yP1oLufwe/Rq2mPcd2/qzfIlA6JmG73V2eofssF/sXpo63PWH//K\n7nq5SAL03aNgAkc6zQOVD37uuC3UZCat7wz4otpzpQ6WKQbZ8l7vIYDlJxVLLNRw\nLuKffyD41SYVkIUqIaoZPSb9yuX93F8OKG4Id4jSL8moLLuS8Mucm9SaMjN4pBYV\noq1wzWY88khsa6+RQecj3sV/SydGBbGK0oVOPC3ydRsFsil3O96Pf8OBGGk7EhXd\nze8bRa9IlpvH1N9Gk9phlx9wSYLM//uPypuin3nv4lMuomZYkFjQOvUUaJZ6As6d\nykQI7BBiHINC6n970043HTun1/fyK8xslK1hmxG3Q8vIOgkwlh14X7NsAzCJ1c6M\nFDDFHRRKvYaJKoz+sF4S\n=hhga\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T12:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKGI1NjMxODllMjk5ZGFjNDliZTRkZmU1MDRhZmZhNzQxOWVmNmVkMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/62aa4e2fc354341fa4a9c3ed96d189fa9529f70f","sha":"62aa4e2fc354341fa4a9c3ed96d189fa9529f70f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/62aa4e2fc354341fa4a9c3ed96d189fa9529f70f"}],"sha":"b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b563189e299dac49be4dfe504affa7419ef6ed08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/62aa4e2fc354341fa4a9c3ed96d189fa9529f70f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:13:12Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:13:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Work out Next renewal from Started and Cycle (#66) (#76)\n\nThe add form defaulted Next renewal to today whatever the start date said,\nso a plan someone already pays for landed with wrong totals and a wrong\n\"Coming up\" unless both dates were changed by hand.\n\n- Next renewal now follows Started and Cycle (the first charge on or after\n  today) until it is edited by hand; after that it is left alone.\n- A trial''s end date is left empty and required, since a trial''s length has\n  nothing to do with its billing cycle.\n- A start date in the past shows \"Counts from <Month YYYY>.\" and the\n  renewal shows \"Worked out from Started and Cycle.\" while it is a suggestion.\n- A cleared renewal date is caught on submit instead of being sent as a 422.\n\nApplies to the desktop add form and the mobile add sheet (same component).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f35bd6d8260c412863f019b0c5552f9ab336ac8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/f35bd6d8260c412863f019b0c5552f9ab336ac8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/62aa4e2fc354341fa4a9c3ed96d189fa9529f70f","verification":{"payload":"tree f35bd6d8260c412863f019b0c5552f9ab336ac8e\nparent 445724f55f130b2c836857971a06303ee05033fc\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791202392 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791202392 +0300\n\nWork out Next renewal from Started and Cycle (#66) (#76)\n\nThe add form defaulted Next renewal to today whatever the start date said,\nso a plan someone already pays for landed with wrong totals and a wrong\n\"Coming up\" unless both dates were changed by hand.\n\n- Next renewal now follows Started and Cycle (the first charge on or after\n  today) until it is edited by hand; after that it is left alone.\n- A trial''s end date is left empty and required, since a trial''s length has\n  nothing to do with its billing cycle.\n- A start date in the past shows \"Counts from <Month YYYY>.\" and the\n  renewal shows \"Worked out from Started and Cycle.\" while it is a suggestion.\n- A cleared renewal date is caught on submit instead of being sent as a 422.\n\nApplies to the desktop add form and the mobile add sheet (same component).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw5RYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqDAQAGRfm2c/Q7c32is6TNKgX8YC\nG5UjbXu1D3+1t/GWpGkVYjgsy3A6CCXglsA4omcXDdRTyxPrbizoYpqtXjjnlEnx\ncukZJp2ueimdr5FQldmZOzJW/E7Tw038xQWO5M/uNhSGhCfBK2yqM1ARQlMA466Y\nKY2bNb5xcHw5RTl6XgliZqEsu0k4SE5aD2LzSpk3mK0Fb0cvBzgZUOLXR5FR462B\nfSdpJWZkKRIx+fyKmLbB4ZDyjveNu7n/Y4ejbBxc/bMZxNxGIGLCauBaoLOInV5h\n3EwLtMvCfo5w9eA8dkYsqDhL6SY5UrDMRzP9K6IiZUZ2aOT9FRw7DHVQjBIn2DUo\niqjTheRGdMiryfNZmKtofK3xwggtalG+tSAvHgIZNH9HW0//6Znh4767gsdyOVT4\nAobcfkwgkL3skssKO72fELc2iHKNRYpBHvVXdLCsiO/s+60bAITY0cBrQ1xR+J/m\nWJVaKo73Tg2SI+/zfowwqEynOCvhq0zqdSOe1KMovVmGMRt2eqNi8HQR4QggVtRd\nKYFbxAXp7jkToYzvqpGfTsUdXbjseQ1XHrWaVXbSBnQEpx5j/5iSp2TDxWzWMtp/\nKCUeiyoHSy5NRaWWdWUR6+R6XJMQsSysCV00/NtOz2OqPn8uxAz8N+bxYOxqEWI1\n7VD8f2Ex+ahh4921GTr7\n=IpO0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T12:13:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","