simaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/3b1993fe122836899eb2bf6ff77ccbf294e89331/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:52:34Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:52:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Say when a save went through; Discard instead of Cancel (#63) (#73)\n\nAdd, save, convert, cancel, reactivate, archive, restore and delete now\nleave a role=\"status\" line next to the list (or under the desktop add\nform): \"Netflix cancelled. Show cancelled\". Archive, restore to list and\nconverting a trial offer Undo; cancel does not, since the API does not\nlet a cancelled run go back.\n\nThe desktop edit row''s \"Cancel\" is now \"Discard\", matching the mobile\nedit sheet. Quick-add tiles say they only fill in the form, and move\nfocus to the cost field they guessed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfcb2e803cbd699ee25b8f0922b65ae4a7d8fc32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/bfcb2e803cbd699ee25b8f0922b65ae4a7d8fc32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/3b1993fe122836899eb2bf6ff77ccbf294e89331","verification":{"payload":"tree bfcb2e803cbd699ee25b8f0922b65ae4a7d8fc32\nparent 5e0059bfc70727acb0a5dd3a26e38f0e32f43a98\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791201154 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791201154 +0300\n\nSay when a save went through; Discard instead of Cancel (#63) (#73)\n\nAdd, save, convert, cancel, reactivate, archive, restore and delete now\nleave a role=\"status\" line next to the list (or under the desktop add\nform): \"Netflix cancelled. Show cancelled\". Archive, restore to list and\nconverting a trial offer Undo; cancel does not, since the API does not\nlet a cancelled run go back.\n\nThe desktop edit row''s \"Cancel\" is now \"Discard\", matching the mobile\nedit sheet. Quick-add tiles say they only fill in the form, and move\nfocus to the cost field they guessed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw4+CCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnD4QAKED0L2v5gJtb6vmSmxVo58V\nIjZYh2MRi5cbA79ZRM6Mn9fYwtbZy0LBg0hdzdo6VtsjbP+Ekcziqs6MQz2UW7P2\n3nc1YACedMIXaIi0sUgzD5TZKSE2EKwNnKYM01huGIkfs5Y8Br0dVJP2aHa6bTHZ\n+CUNe8Yy/fUxHwWFbJf2btZQb1pbkAQaMwgbtbr5tPLDJgwz0y9WTUEeaI4zfyic\nQkHdykpDlvcACBTcqgor5e/9DXOnbfYopRLJc0XIhXXaFmyKhwKTMf14IOG23Nxp\niZLgEyb2axQFQpTkYHkash0oc2BtO4rBjkWf1qVC1DjJz1iMjRpxugKZ8ZuitBEW\nmK9kzeio7Bvrfi8tb7sEMapjGAEFbuD1rXS3qvqTw9WnHGHR03OXfI9X7UYjwizn\nIrlWGW2gTwZmUl/HyrmzmgNqtPjBaFmq5LVmhbwPvkSN+qbKlb2burxU9PWF2HT2\njCELed0PK8TRBi264KHcTMZm4BGSTrWr03KoyrDH6PS/fbf73zLXhHyRNTNIntQS\n7C+6TRJJe6CNqNCSHTyH5KWHNaXbfC3ntpqQBnJmhWpE5viaQwW5T3OZN9nwofdu\njn4teedZ6EwdMpiC0FDOzPn4+pzHe7RA9q5MtEhgBh3oHpjNM/qxnyXKjyk/Iqyo\nSwQlFArbGVwAx73BvBSq\n=jCn6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T11:52:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/r