tracker/commits/440bfb12d6f284d25598b892645a85b0124088d7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/7c75c1a1f9b5908018a79946b8f4e5a28d008d3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:19:20Z","email":"jouni.uu@icloud.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:19:20Z","email":"jouni.uu@icloud.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"message":"Harden the dashboard and its dialogs\n\n- Dialogs and sheets share useModal: focus moves in, Tab is trapped, Esc\n  closes the topmost only, focus returns to the opener.\n- Cancel/delete dialogs stay open until the write lands and show failures\n  in place; trial conversion is single-flight with a per-row error;\n  archive/restore failures show on the row.\n- Costs accept a decimal comma; name/category/cost limits match the server.\n- Requests time out after 45s.\n- Row menu keyboard support, labelled row actions, picker Esc/outside\n  close, trend bar labels, <main> landmark and h1/h2 section headings.\n- Long unbroken names wrap, very large figures break at a thousands\n  separator, signed zero shows as €0.00.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82f7e965f56e8765015b4f08be03bcf267f7cf8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/82f7e965f56e8765015b4f08be03bcf267f7cf8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/7c75c1a1f9b5908018a79946b8f4e5a28d008d3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/7c75c1a1f9b5908018a79946b8f4e5a28d008d3f","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDdjNzVjMWExZjliNTkwODAxOGE3OTk0NmI4ZjRlNWEyOGQwMDhkM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/d97ac60704f05db9bda5953d253da504e5cf3a31","sha":"d97ac60704f05db9bda5953d253da504e5cf3a31