 as the spend summary (moved onto models.Subscription.charge_dates).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c555624696fdf0cc6bba5f8a56cae6cc74b0ec0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/3c555624696fdf0cc6bba5f8a56cae6cc74b0ec0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/cb4b28b4ce69b9749899549fedc34a7d74b246ee","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c555624696fdf0cc6bba5f8a56cae6cc74b0ec0\nparent 0111fe281f5c868cd0ce3c69e17ce316787e8761\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1791016485 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791016485 +0300\n\nGroup runs of the same subscription in the list (#49) (#52)\n\nThe list now shows one row per subscription group: the run that isn''t\ncancelled (or the newest), with earlier runs folded under a disclosure and\nclosed by a lifetime total. Filtering, search and sorting work on groups;\nsearch opens a group when only an earlier run matches. Earlier runs offer\nonly Archive and Delete, and archived ones stay hidden until Show archived.\n\nThe API adds a read-only paid_total per run, computed from the same charge\nschedule as the spend summary (moved onto models.Subscription.charge_dates).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwL4lCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWcIQABEBTDauof2Rk7wT38bmNi65\n/w3jcmK5Jeqm9OqfaYOTnfI9yzFpTyjGx6jBCBUeLaoYTGmlCy9T4B2uO4AKCyKv\nT6hnBIrgnnOahvXosvyoS4koqsYTEIW5Ftvam9zaOJU4ctPpUMoCmTHnmrviHFvM\nFHil3kM2ck4LKSVZbDaNdxvRG/c8UW7X+bSYXnp7JArXUwI55K6VMwrK4sf0s5lt\n/uKjwL2qf2eWROa7v0XH8J5Ql3UHW9rsdZ6O8fYV8iiXg8lh3JX9p8Qu9SvHsDQ7\npVs788N60y25Lx8omSBKEvzp6iYZ9sHogklhAKCtIBbocaq1vdAQ4XfedCEiTGmc\nIXYBr/UGxG1Ri04F4Mj/ZuDk4+HFXQxwTDBo9NpUS4YdpMJGqVedwUbvL2yhmJGH\nbQTIhHN2AM5/Aq6Ot0E