n into each other whenever a subscription carried more\nthan one (e.g. Cancelled + Archived). Adds margin between adjacent\n.tag elements and trims the tag padding/font-size slightly per the\nissue''s request.\n\nFixes #32\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7375a6290620ddb722bbad8ceb0a9f652da7f650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/7375a6290620ddb722bbad8ceb0a9f652da7f650"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/053a888a18f590c211e3de66ea95aeded51303ee","verification":{"payload":"tree 7375a6290620ddb722bbad8ceb0a9f652da7f650\nparent fa14df288217c5a96c5fb7171ba7ba44877171bc\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788855333 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788855333 +0300\n\nAdd margin between status tags and shrink them (#32) (#42)\n\nStatus/archived tags in the list view had zero space between them,\nmaking them run into each other whenever a subscription carried more\nthan one (e.g. Cancelled + Archived). Adds margin between adjacent\n.tag elements and trims the tag padding/font-size slightly per the\nissue''s request.\n\nFixes #32\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn8QlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/JQQAAJQHkFYEgRxda2nwVQuV5ak\n+e/Xnp+NRRFZYtZf1zDiRy26zdXRgyHz5RY8WCj5y5zcJaHR8p94pK9VWL76PPMc\nt2TRU18xWr38jUHzQduVSA4WZw6BVHgXDqzDQuiDEPX0PtS1ebP1AlXF7Ib5Dg8I\nl2mi8tSVOka6KSK1gsoXE83rZ1lQs72Cj2poif7IxAYG58QkALWKJiMthT6vtVYb\nVomq9QGiUz8HMNUVFD+WZ4HbK/KkMbT3FuAdpmLNK/TT6+eu+h2RI8XyR+lnaxgL\n/fjfJ1an0qNKGXjQ2ATuxojpNkc/TmBsJwzlxcFwUxDq/sGfTSU7LPyynCQ6PB9n\nsyymOy11SefiYvD61YFvs3UDhFcV1CPS4OblZGDnU9TUSBTEMmz6tE7jGIfuAgpH\nZ0GXq6yWNrSrIrfpQqMMMdwRm3MhNI8CWkBfbXVGFAaYpGSsxpAVCpsHjiksCrZz\nKA13EQZBOW6mGWjWREEKgUg9Y3yGbswuCpIxpudAXrH2ss5TLXb