om/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/637babae0ff6773237fd61bc3298304a5a99026d","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDYzN2JhYmFlMGZmNjc3MzIzN2ZkNjFiYzMyOTgzMDRhNWE5OTAyNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/0eb66883721e21d7973d051c7bf16eceab6b3a8e","sha":"0eb66883721e21d7973d051c7bf16eceab6b3a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/0eb66883721e21d7973d051c7bf16eceab6b3a8e"}],"sha":"637babae0ff6773237fd61bc3298304a5a99026d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/637babae0ff6773237fd61bc3298304a5a99026d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/0eb66883721e21d7973d051c7bf16eceab6b3a8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:31:38Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:31:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Require the exp claim when decoding a token (TODO item 15) (#37)\n\nPyJWT only validates exp if the claim is present, so a signed token\nminted with none at all decoded cleanly and never expired -- the only\nthing besides a password change that revokes a token. Pass\noptions={\"require\": [\"exp\"]} to jwt.decode to close that.\n\nEvery issuer this codebase has ever had sets exp (create_access_token\nalways has), so this costs nothing for real tokens. Gave the\n\"tv\"-less legacy-token test from TODO item 12 an exp claim so it keeps\ntesting precisely a missing \"tv\", and added a test that a token with\nno exp at all is rejected.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8233639c82ec69a57b325a927c67be9c56f34286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/8233639c82ec69a57b325a927c67be9c56f34286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/0eb66883721e21d7973d051c7bf16eceab6b3a8e","verification":{"payload":"tree 8233639c82ec69a57b325a927c67be9c56f34286\nparent 76544648ed40949efd9e6e4a4630317fe5d1fec4\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788852698 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788852698 +0300\n\nRequire the exp claim when decoding a token (TODO item 15) (#37)\n\nPyJWT only validates exp if the claim is present, so a signed token\nminted with none at all decoded cleanly and never expired -- the only\nthing besides a password change that revokes a token. Pass\noptions={\"require\": [\"exp\"]} to jwt.decode to close that.\n\nEvery issuer this codebase has ever had sets exp (create_access_token\nalways has), so this costs nothing for real tokens. Gave the\n\"tv\"-less legacy-token test from TODO item 12 an exp claim so it keeps\ntesting precisely a missing \"tv\", and added a test that a token with\nno exp at all is rejected.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn7naCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsvoQAK9Wt4DVllSCJEY+myKHaiSd\nth6e9z3kW9uCCcB5VUgzbiKF7Lwv/ys3xZADYhYYc3c+TZb/Rsb7csYrcQMnTwRE\nHP2j2goq7ivh+haKsFUgasH964CCYCaeCJH33UV1qKKWSiXKHVdRi5+bJMAaboSv\nK0B2P5cQAqPjjfUJZj151YDrUbRsdFp6EMmhC+wZwNXuvd6WizcqrNBifRh2y0e6\nP4RWCu2B6gddJCSHr/x2R5n6tBoZng6ZqLmIztVz0qxy/bWI+edxCl91mDA0RhcX\nR64trHR0Y2cOkb+01nCw+DfWnFl8pHNXrVcrNot4Ym50rpa3W68hXVutKTM2Y/jU\nof7XiLfJ3ls608RKntRYxszpe2bB5dbcg43WIjQ86bw5n3Q+3M7pzPIVICD57+UB\nQ7jahfFlauPl8jjU2PRP7+pum0gcJjPGcX9x3lM8hVctnu/q1KEhHH5QXWhXGFya\nnt/c8O5Ce6+/frNghuD0r0AJS1nJVKOc7EFOr7Mc7o/Ccn2YWyKQQIQ7G0YEGNQh\n4u3oHFJDadiiv2KdgefGtm2GwvoCyEXi+INzvPuMTzZaYHTo4zlhdhgPbKzgkeIz\n3bDH71ZO6Sqrijc11a0thjV0VrmSU4y+NMq0cD+w2LP9i6SM6JBD5nSGpGqxq0B5\nmsLTFVHv3a9QevBlEIv+\n=7EJ9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T07:31:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/0eb66883721e21d7973d051c7bf16eceab6b3a8e","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDBlYjY2ODgzNzIxZTIxZDc5NzNkMDUxYzdiZjE2ZWNlYWI2YjNhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/76544648ed40949efd9e6e4a4630317fe5d1fec4","sha":"76544648ed40949efd9e6e4a4630317fe5d1fec4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/76544648ed40949efd9e6e4a4630317fe5d1fec4"}],"sha":"0eb66883721e21d7973d051c7bf16eceab6b3a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/0eb66883721e21d7973d051c7bf16eceab6b3a8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/76544648ed40949efd9e6e4a4630317fe5d1fec4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:51:14Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:51:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Record TODO items 13-15 from the 2026-09-08 validation review (#36)\n\nThree findings from a review of the branch that fixed item 12, each\nreproduced against the pinned dependencies before being written down:\n\n- 13: Cost bounds the value but not its scale, so 0.001 validates and\n  Numeric(10, 2) stores it as 0.00 -- a row that passed gt=0 sitting at\n  zero. This was a Minor bullet describing the same truncation as\n  harmless; that held for rounding up but not for rounding down through\n  zero, so the bullet is removed and re-filed here as a bug.\n- 14: The password limit is 72 characters while bcrypt''s is 72 bytes, so\n  a 25-character non-ASCII password is truncated before hashing --\n  silently, since bcrypt 4.2.0 does not raise the way the field''s own\n  comment claims. Affects both UserCreate.password and\n  PasswordChange.new_password.\n- 15: jwt.decode does not require exp, and pyjwt only validates a claim\n  that is present, so an exp-less token is accepted indefinitely. Item\n  12''s legacy-token test now mints exactly that shape; compatibility only\n  ever needed a missing tv treated as version 0, not a missing expiry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3179097bbe2e603775b0f771bdb8a4847ccf34e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/e3179097bbe2e603775b0f771bdb8a4847ccf34e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/76544648ed40949efd9e6e4a4630317fe5d1fec4","verification":{"payload":"tree e3179097bbe2e603775b0f771bdb8a4847ccf34e\nparent 29c9b6401d7c74e8a2aa29e1616905f19b0fcc35\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788850274 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788850274 +0300\n\nRecord TODO items 13-15 from the 2026-09-08 validation review (#36)\n\nThree findings from a review of the branch that fixed item 12, each\nreproduced against the pinned dependencies before being written down:\n\n- 13: Cost bounds the value but not its scale, so 0.001 validates and\n  Numeric(10, 2) stores it as 0.00 -- a row that passed gt=0 sitting at\n  zero. This was a Minor bullet describing the same truncation as\n  harmless; that held for rounding up but not for rounding down through\n  zero, so the bullet is removed and re-filed here as a bug.\n- 14: The password limit is 72 characters while bcrypt''s is 72 bytes, so\n  a 25-character non-ASCII password is truncated before hashing --\n  silently, since bcrypt 4.2.0 does not raise the way the field''s own\n  comment claims. Affects both UserCreate.password and\n  PasswordChange.new_password.\n- 15: jwt.decode does not require exp, and pyjwt only validates a claim\n  that is present, so an exp-less token is accepted indefinitely. Item\n  12''s legacy-token test now mints exactly that shape; compatibility only\n  ever needed a missing tv treated as version 0, not a missing expiry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn7BiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4mEQAK7VFH0vG08fT04nM6N3Ecad\no1rcxaLK/tLvRTee7HGTTNy/LFMZ9T98oBKmfZfJnIjMWt4rMnTB5ovtIezl/sEf\n7YuRXDwjkSi++cBgUbYeBizD6ANfJzar08ffTeGqeB3rU+RUMoRnytF/b+9SXWsK\navDX7zAzpFfvwsSPypN+dM/Bm2qdY9XO291+3UqERHwps3aPYA25OignzdMws10D\nY2IbnIwqVjehCcD0eMmF/k2FRhEq2ywUxHThuxpVD24TSEqgxn4xkPJLvY0ZUgyh\nFx+rvR/h6+gETJUUM01UvQ+LIjm3ZU9w/eh6AEstenm07EGXxPWVDOlfQyGv6eUR\n7ktkll4GAhXVxPateT0K428Hu3kqEH9pOqmpbuA00yvpOhM/Ayuuy16BsXJQA8lJ\nya95NzhvPKco4WBYrtTLDWPVSc4oCuTVxaD3CT19eDgBCul1OYbdhTxtWJyWPDr6\nxh+9qAqjEO5mLCBo87aaJphOO4HFVgqlsDZHdmU7SBbfeRMq5g0epxOyc32RSpmT\nYEtgYhyO5QMYOndTVrr5xL1rYQ9j1IhtI2OJwtDaopMVhzXicZzWlNjA4TcyI/Y4\nbHOCgf3MP1+sG2ZadfJ3aTyf7LIfaKw0GXSxkzXS+gF4uCFyDgTkqOfF3Rfa06uQ\nSoFHq7lnEgyCPMLbdMOU\n=RsDn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T06:51:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users