juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/29c9b6401d7c74e8a2aa29e1616905f19b0fcc35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:30:33Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:30:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Treat a missing JWT tv claim as version 0 (TODO item 12) (#35)\n\nget_current_user compared payload.get(\"tv\") to user.token_version\nliterally, so a pre-migration token with no tv claim at all (None)\nnever matched the backfilled 0, signing out every session issued\nbefore migration 0004 shipped -- contradicting that migration''s own\ndocstring claim that its backfill signs no one out.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f07d0209320e21630307f0d6abcf4bdee5af671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/2f07d0209320e21630307f0d6abcf4bdee5af671"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/29c9b6401d7c74e8a2aa29e1616905f19b0fcc35","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f07d0209320e21630307f0d6abcf4bdee5af671\nparent b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788849033 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788849033 +0300\n\nTreat a missing JWT tv claim as version 0 (TODO item 12) (#35)\n\nget_current_user compared payload.get(\"tv\") to user.token_version\nliterally, so a pre-migration token with no tv claim at all (None)\nnever matched the backfilled 0, signing out every session issued\nbefore migration 0004 shipped -- contradicting that 