flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/29c9b6401d7c74e8a2aa29e1616905f19b0fcc35","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDI5YzliNjQwMWQ3Yzc0ZThhMmFhMjllMTYxNjkwNWYxOWIwZmNjMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095","sha":"b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095"}],"sha":"29c9b6401d7c74e8a2aa29e1616905f19b0fcc35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/29c9b6401d7c74e8a2aa29e1616905f19b0fcc35"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:21:16Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:21:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix trial conversion backfilling charges for the free period (TODO item 11) (#34)\n\ncrud._sync_status_dates cleared cancelled_date/paused_date on a status\nchange back to running, but never touched started_date, so a trial\nconverted through PUT /subscriptions/{id} kept its original trial start\nas the billing anchor -- main._charge_dates then counted every month\nsince the trial began as paid, not just since it converted.\n\nstarted_date now resolves to today on that same transition unless the\nrequest''s value genuinely differs from what the row carried before the\nupdate, which distinguishes an omitted/unchanged value (a plain PUT\n{status: \"active\"}, or SubscriptionTable.jsx''s editable row resending\nthe stale draft) from a deliberate backdate (Dashboard.jsx''s \"Convert to\npaid\" button, which sends next_renewal_date).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"551e7adf24144678a3f8d9cd4af5872dad833231","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/551e7adf24144678a3f8d9cd4af5872dad833231"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095","verification":{"payload":"tree 551e7adf24144678a3f8d9cd4af5872dad833231\nparent 06f89b91261f0de51d747f43ccc10c24e4f4a523\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788848476 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788848476 +0300\n\nFix trial conversion backfilling charges for the free period (TODO item 11) (#34)\n\ncrud._sync_status_dates cleared cancelled_date/paused_date on a status\nchange back to running, but never touched started_date, so a trial\nconverted through PUT /subscriptions/{id} kept its original trial start\nas the billing anchor -- main._charge_dates then counted every month\nsince the trial began as paid, not just since it converted.\n\nstarted_date now resolves to today on that same transition unless the\nrequest''s value genuinely differs from what the row carried before the\nupdate, which distinguishes an omitted/unchanged value (a plain PUT\n{status: \"active\"}, or SubscriptionTable.jsx''s editable row resending\nthe stale draft) from a deliberate backdate (Dashboard.jsx''s \"Convert to\npaid\" button, which sends next_renewal_date).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn6lcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPLsQAE87hj9dTg183fdo46zFSYBg\nkkCzNCVB1E1OPrwwZiba4jyXYvK3+sUFtUfXhRwyFjDg8Levhxli2GuX2ZzWX6th\n8LesrwdxmKgP2lF5Vigd14fd9DWpFBQ7bP8CQfZtzuNG8PozWxPygdCTF2uD7VN6\nFHDeTE+vb+Cd+yg9brsSUsPnBRFYWyzRf+ZIUodMx/KjQXAXaTfPtAkARm6LaXlq\n/wgRzR64oZHbM1LobiUTI2ix2kpwO1PXSM2MHSGZ3iBBqUrMvk6Gh4LMTPcbq1SC\n+EJr/r3Pb7vzspSMZltkDuK1K+CszoV2siyfv4me6Q0QSWtAQ1w1vr30yi1yzZY+\n5JfAuCVnHXrlB9L+tKJy0YJE/+zO5hcntyQCmbPKDb+R0k3wNOZarG/h6ssBJ++p\noqvHU8kz7wlK7e+lxwB2V8bOFHnS6Ol/yh+i4D/oIgoN4CN/dIaR2qcxLaKnKCQs\ncgv1qfGm/NPfIA4cEYsAbVCmzeoPC1xA29Mwa2RWg6qggxvOWi6mxuCWN4ETipC1\nRFnB1xIVUWfC9fpkEWrUEH8NPMFywYFE3OMBHyPn38uDt78VvG1VG4gZPt/bJkHa\n5KhF1MvjPI0RPYcSoFIvn3Nea1KCwYxiTKg0IQQzW5bwbjK65GfEojWix9uetkpy\nAUd+HpElZ/7xIIg39Q8p\n=AIRv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T06:21:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKGIyYzhhMzA2YzY3OTM3Yzg0ZGY2ZTZkOWIxMWNiMWY2NzMxOTEwOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/06f89b91261f0de51d747f43ccc10c24e4f4a523","sha":"06f89b91261f0de51d747f43ccc10c24e4f4a523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/06f89b91261f0de51d747f43ccc10c24e4f4a523"}],"sha":"b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/b2c8a306c67937c84df6e6d9b11cb1f673191095"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/06f89b91261f0de51d747f43ccc10c24e4f4a523/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:08:41Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:08:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Reject invalid date/archive states on POST /import (#33)\n\nBackupSubscriptionImport only tightened name/cost, so a hand-edited\nfile could store an active subscription with an archived_date, or a\ncancelled_date earlier than started_date -- states POST/PUT already\nreject as 422s, and that quietly corrupt spend-history arithmetic.\n\nGives BackupSubscriptionImport a model validator calling check_dates\nand check_archived, the same shape item 6 used for name/cost.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"690e9e27c834e166959f3fe4e1fc7102709eb8b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/690e9e27c834e166959f3fe4e1fc7102709eb8b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/06f89b91261f0de51d747f43ccc10c24e4f4a523","verification":{"payload":"tree 690e9e27c834e166959f3fe4e1fc7102709eb8b7\nparent 48da77b32208fbe00c266e1afa6fbd766bbba950\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788847721 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788847721 +0300\n\nReject invalid date/archive states on POST /import (#33)\n\nBackupSubscriptionImport only tightened name/cost, so a hand-edited\nfile could store an active subscription with an archived_date, or a\ncancelled_date earlier than started_date -- states POST/PUT already\nreject as 422s, and that quietly corrupt spend-history arithmetic.\n\nGives BackupSubscriptionImport a model validator calling check_dates\nand check_archived, the same shape item 6 used for name/cost.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\n