ption. Round-trip\narchived_date the same way the other two dates already are, including\nin the pre-import diff so an un-archive shows up in the summary the\nuser confirms before anything is written.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4673939837b65bee47bf538a9a007c3aab131b95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/4673939837b65bee47bf538a9a007c3aab131b95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/48da77b32208fbe00c266e1afa6fbd766bbba950","verification":{"payload":"tree 4673939837b65bee47bf538a9a007c3aab131b95\nparent 17c07ed3c45fd4cc8be249cba9dc37a41d35fdcc\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788847005 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788847005 +0300\n\nFix backup import silently unarchiving cancelled subscriptions (#31)\n\nbackup.js parsed cancelled_date and paused_date from a backup file but\nnever archived_date, so re-importing any export (merge or replace)\ncleared the archived flag on every cancelled subscription. Round-trip\narchived_date the same way the other two dates already are, including\nin the pre-import diff so an un-archive shows up in the summary the\nuser confirms before anything is written.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn6OdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI7sQAEMUPWuoLEV8uiClp7u0f5HZ\nz3kqF6R5rdZlPalTgqQqLxYihYtUBPlZ1/5XpOklnJ2ipaLj9rn8rCVj6+Z3Et1G\nXuzldhdUjfbxBgis2HpY8k+i6PacqZQ/W4YJA7sO5XR3AsyINH/ABXgoldkmthVo\nWPCVlWWsRO6KR5QDfaNvvMPR0m5yEWmCxKMX2QYGDMIQ/Y5FZpLQL6jaU32UmpX2\nxS3KHQ0bfHG4Y5KmNZdPd/iv2/wUEglpzN0MAIaWZ4kJyzPIE/dDR/C5fhEN6Ak/\nxtQ2/W7c+YJ9xLxPaZkRORD9K7UtfNbXLJXwRy7w4wmAeaapFMeSw/sEh8Bs0/Kg\n5ywRzKkiHMFFxCJMouA2+NSxEAtCplRzRj0A0hAxihDez9gpVo1xhY7ag8N5u9b1\n19Z2m8lV7C5dNL0ouXzL8/ucTF2To3PHjxGx+ovPp