723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/17c07ed3c45fd4cc8be249cba9dc37a41d35fdcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T05:33:56Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T05:33:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Skip QueuePool-only kwargs for in-memory SQLite engines (#30)\n\npool_size/max_overflow/pool_timeout only apply to QueuePool, which\nbacks Postgres and file-based SQLite. An in-memory sqlite:// URL gets\nSingletonThreadPool instead, which rejects those kwargs -- breaking\nthe \"Publish API docs\" workflow, which imports the app with\nDATABASE_URL=sqlite:// to generate openapi.json without a real\ndatabase.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f2e620810db9af9e9957c71e8c4f87887c5f6f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/6f2e620810db9af9e9957c71e8c4f87887c5f6f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/17c07ed3c45fd4cc8be249cba9dc37a41d35fdcc","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f2e620810db9af9e9957c71e8c4f87887c5f6f4\nparent a2c40bcc2e656deebdd05580b0485c8e8a91b27a\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788845636 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788845636 +0300\n\nSkip QueuePool-only kwargs for in-memory SQLite engines (#30)\n\npool_size/max_overflow/pool_timeout only apply to QueuePool, which\nbacks Postgres and file-based SQLite. An in-memory sqlite:// URL gets\nSingletonThreadPool instead, which rejects those kwargs -- breaking\nthe \"Publish API docs\" workflow, which imports the app with\nDATABASE_URL=sqlite:// to generate openapi.json without a real\ndatabase.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn55ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgpIQABYmV7fQGam+v5zwWmhpfCsW\nQ8pxMEuOSDYqcHfMWuDUKS08/dYF8VCxznTeT/yc3XrqGvO5ZMgehJ0yw5fo4Hri\nHaezVykoXYxFpoTtk/CO3X7wOdxifdLahaYQdRKWTo0v6MQGwnDm06AmsesRITaY\nMk8Gu95BP2lFNZk/iTtTNO4UDxwM1acvW56Le5o+a4AEd2kjQlC6/+8kYGeEOc1V\nmV5fQxozjDJRWMCeYQOgR/ufb9uAvTEnwg89Hx3XJvKkp/6aYs8iIrzOJ1rURo+D\nK6N9kxajFAp/UEggqNRsMTJC1ZN920N5sVp9rUJTuB0lWQe3VuHHx9RbB0BxnCXC\n9tTTmDWkaGL29eIbafdwnaZmYg83Sns9gMxAdbFOppxefpwDX+FAFvJMxci+x2LF\nlzw8MEU9K6wtT6VSU4yGXSeem36Zny90woj2agYeVkW0uKTzkiuo5axFBjUjbTju\nVeJryxfzDyKTN+nIAcJ2uQVna1IL9MTTRnXdcNJ9j4Xs4rcTtaUoJk4UqLx4/Non\noQRq1EVrGnpI7bBy4cWkJxCdKmPes+NDv7bAfUwN/hgOJSJSfw+Cg5y5fildpL8x\nLdL1uqH13BJXLkBXe8dESAFNvU9V8HggnCdvWSxUpNL/h8kh/I5ABnkansj1GYyP\nLT+XTEOIEtMKJe7qrhC3\n=ismY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T05:33:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/fol