s","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/a2c40bcc2e656deebdd05580b0485c8e8a91b27a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T05:12:28Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T05:12:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Configure explicit connection pool settings for the DB engine (#29)\n\nAdds pool_pre_ping, pool_size, max_overflow, pool_timeout and\npool_recycle instead of relying on SQLAlchemy''s defaults.\npool_pre_ping matters most here: the Neon production database scales\nto zero and drops idle connections on suspend, so without it a stale\npooled connection surfaces as an intermittent \"server closed the\nconnection unexpectedly\" error on the first request after idle.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d928f885e76cc1597cd0d2b5283912c932c06334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/d928f885e76cc1597cd0d2b5283912c932c06334"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/a2c40bcc2e656deebdd05580b0485c8e8a91b27a","verification":{"payload":"tree d928f885e76cc1597cd0d2b5283912c932c06334\nparent 3b4a792e30c88b611bdbe0c70e679658ef6dda30\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788844348 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788844348 +0300\n\nConfigure explicit connection pool settings for the DB engine (#29)\n\nAdds pool_pre_ping, pool_size, max_overflow, pool_timeout and\npool_recycle instead of relying on SQLAlchemy''s defaults.\npool_pre_ping matters most here: the Neon production database scales\nto zero and drops idle connections on suspend, so without it a stale\npooled connection surfaces as an intermittent \"server closed the\nconnection unexpectedly\" error on the first request after idle.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn5k8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz7cQAF/k/SQnT8AZ7s6ZjFaIWC/d\nsG+1p8aNqqBBB3/4UVKNlc3iCxUeNg7rbKVVFG3zMFN5wpO2fBTqv4UtDmL75REB\nVup0c9yqB3sKPnkdqJCCGHwOp8C1KA4hHdasv4ul7DFUIA5NpZJeX4B8N+9hXxxr\nZHdGwXZvjt0wb6wMsyjMb95eZRk92wVFw2e0diPlItRH0YJY6F//IERSVneJVsGR\nZbed+uKsZdo3CwaI+xS8oFYJdB0I9uOAfDRqwcaARFYoyPClzlNhEKUhEHhWM4tY\nZ4EgL4omFE6DY3KsGPXtljsvrP8MZkGeocG0P3NvJaZFqIuCatXwBE1Hao3VStOu\nZM8Pk8DvZgk4d/6bRa2REzCiiDpa3oaPEWP9AEaMGZ6nkQwkfZtcj+wvD1Vj0kf+\nCmfUzUsjRKyym/+5DDDxc4f1reIfqaUpxKXtv4bYAoSztFBOqF/VUll4RjocBEiV\nAuZQIP/qfKWg2NqBv9mQGCTjIpJRu5KXP/0zkkbz7b2SEydgZsDdf1KwtoJJCc5V\njh4y7PidFtjriyaniqoxh0CBr6Nz659C5aVJmuZEbn1U34DDSLo/rZANpAC1Dnfm\nVX04J2pprZiFLWjk4nSNRtnnHjaUrB9gcDEMa75LL+5HMtcGwNQdt2qf1GJb+jGj\n+dH0Hd20/8x1vlPVDI5M\n=+vLp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T05:12:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/a2c40bcc2e656deebdd05580b0485c8e8a91b27a","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKGEyYzQwYmNjMmU2NTZkZWViZGQwNTU4MGIwNDg1YzhlOGE5MWIyN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/3b4a792e30c88b611bdbe0c70e679658ef6dda30","sha":"3b4a792e30c88b611bdbe0c70e679658ef6dda30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/3b4a792e30c88b611bdbe0c70e679658ef6dda30"}],"sha":"a2c40bcc2e656deebdd05580b0485c8e8a91b27a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/a2c40bcc2e656deebdd05580b0485c8e8a91b27a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/3b4a792e30c88b611bdbe0c70e679658ef6dda30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T05:01:24Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T05:01:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Reject negative costs and blank names on import (#28)\n\nPOST /import validated subscriptions against the unconstrained\nSubscriptionBase (via BackupSubscription), so a hand-edited backup file\ncould set a negative cost or blank name even though POST/PUT already\nreject both. Add BackupImport/BackupSubscriptionImport, a constrained\npair used only for the import request body, while GET /export keeps\nusing the permissive Backup/BackupSubscription so an already-stored row\ncan never fail to export.\n\nTODO.md item 6.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89594f2e610883d89429fcef114bb6c8fc992267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/89594f2e610883d89429fcef114bb6c8fc992267"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/3b4a792e30c88b611bdbe0c70e679658ef6dda30","verification":{"payload":"tree 89594f2e610883d89429fcef114bb6c8fc992267\nparent 75805aa9bbeb04f03a10e6957504d1c025bb84f9\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788843684 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788843684 +0300\n\nReject negative costs and blank names on import (#28)\n\nPOST /import validated subscriptions against the unconstrained\nSubscriptionBase (via BackupSubscription), so a hand-edited backup file\ncould set a negative cost or blank name even though POST/PUT already\nreject both. Add BackupImport/BackupSubscriptionImport, a constrained\npair used only for the import request body, while GET /export keeps\nusing the permissive Backup/BackupSubscription so an already-stored row\ncan never fail to export.\n\nTODO.md item 6.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBA