2aae6f4cef9bfb8d7498e443b5b20f0c787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/0a6242aae6f4cef9bfb8d7498e443b5b20f0c787"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/79d0f8e58d2a2c308511636ab3c48a4dc15bcee8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T05:19:43Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T05:19:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add quarterly billing cycle (#21) (#22)\n\nSubscriptions can now bill every three months. BillingCycle gains a\nquarterly member on both sides, cycle-months math is derived from a\nlookup table instead of a yearly/else branch so it generalizes to any\nfuture cycle, and the Postgres enum gets a matching migration (with a\ntype-rebuild downgrade, since Postgres can''t drop an enum value).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e41f8466b8bc9e2a23585c561d737948a17f13e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/1e41f8466b8bc9e2a23585c561d737948a17f13e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/79d0f8e58d2a2c308511636ab3c48a4dc15bcee8","verification":{"payload":"tree 1e41f8466b8bc9e2a23585c561d737948a17f13e\nparent 513b3b93babc656d7f2e33bc143c434226f37b92\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788758383 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788758383 +0300\n\nAdd quarterly billing cycle (#21) (#22)\n\nSubscriptions can now bill every three months. BillingCycle gains a\nquarterly member on both sides, cycle-months math is derived from a\nlookup table instead of a yearly/else branch so it generalizes to any\nfuture cycle, and the Postgres enum gets a matching migration (with a\ntype-rebuild downgrade, since Postgres can''t drop an enum value).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnklvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAliEQAGtUEE2MFoY5LfVxlUiqc2RO\nozFJcEPd+2am4eH/KCsdnhdd7EpAdWVXiqgJdYu1thsj+deNgxiW9tGiUys+qJEQ\nKRvq3MiVKJxpZY2ko1tJK5A4aQ77CMnCpUYTTU/WSUwPP4JT2A+QVScoz4BdIm0O\nMJtwPwEso6YOr/YGfv3SpkX/3yRMg8zgcWKLYT/kKD9lXXgQv1VW2vPN3XrFIpsP\nFKLg/S6ExUq+Ar7PixE9ayme/mlJ46+PdTf+7GopjH2GuUZTtRtFOQiP+NakbCPO\n5Z3XAldDaxgdmO/VRyApIhx/f0+YAAb/MyoD2U3LZTsXzfqjf/KyEo0548f+a5eD\ndBnHELHFrJXuwjA1TKgyGNCAsTOuBIk4D9Q2AJSfF6pHl0JVNuZSIedBGTRT3TsL\nVGwsf84SY/kg5xxmJB16OKZfYfnbo7jrgquWWdEidlxVWjikKpnE4dl9sLNMZJJB\npcPVkPTKGPfY7YEPMMXswJX961HT9WiJgccfUjo7AV00iURcum9BreCRRLL0fAXV\n3/8mLafyoMa4Qa75Spc2WpbCjD16FAvPQhn+am3eRvY3vqsC6+2Mzf8Yy4Y/ezZq\n+ijpkCMntUict5QVIFISPzuGbNd2HSOc6UZcb4T7YFQTOcQfWpnPWiyk4cHNfgHS\n5SPATE+isFSiFg8bfPws\n=OhxW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-07T05:19:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/79d0f8e58d2a2c308511636ab3c48a4dc15bcee8","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKDc5ZDBmOGU1OGQyYTJjMzA4NTExNjM2YWIzYzQ4YTRkYzE1YmNlZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/513b3b93babc656d7f2e33bc143c434226f37b92","sha":"513b3b93babc656d7f2e33bc143c434226f37b92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/513b3b93babc656d7f2e33bc143c434226f37b92"}],"sha":"79d0f8e58d2a2c308511636ab3c48a4dc15bcee8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/79d0f8e58d2a2c308511636ab3c48a4dc15bcee8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/513b3b93babc656d7f2e33bc143c434226f37b92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T04:16:53Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T04:16:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix cost showing when a trial is cancelled before it converts (#20)\n\nA trial that is cancelled or paused loses its `trial` status, and\n_charge_dates then walked started_date (the trial''s start, not a billing\nstart) forward through cancelled_date as though the plan had been paying\nthe whole time. Leaving cancelled_date/paused_date unset for a trial that\nnever converted reuses the \"unknown stop date -> zero cost\" rule the app\nalready applies to legacy rows, which the UI already renders as \"--\".\n\nFixes #19\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4439cc50a253442e4eeb48a977bcfb6b02a7c9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/c4439cc50a253442e4eeb48a977bcfb6b02a7c9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/513b3b93babc656d7f2e33bc143c434226f37b92","verification":{"payload":"tree c4439cc50a253442e4eeb48a977bcfb6b02a7c9b\nparent f46d5d7c534749d9a6ff030acd77221d8d570eb8\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788754613 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788754613 +0300\n\nFix cost showing when a trial is cancelled before it converts (#20)\n\nA trial that is cancelled or paused loses its `trial` status, and\n_charge_dates then walked started_date (the trial''s start, not a billing\nstart) forward through cancelled_date as though the plan had been paying\nthe whole time. Leaving cancelled_date/paused_date unset for a trial that\nnever converted reuses the \"unknown stop date -> zero cost\" rule the app\nalready applies to legacy rows, which the UI already renders as \"--\".\n\nFixes #19\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnjq1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACGIQAKoaYH0Mwkqi6RawmQNLZJww\neC3in96rpDN4+ba5fMnS+82rZ1/DECKJYkCdVDpB59rQ5QfVmHb8kMAK/SkyY7nE\n1NG5OVyegh7xQLbGfNnXx/qPNETZ2dMhqGZetSigeK3YSGxvbCRpp3tQHvwmBHpv\nabL/VJpxnVzSF7wyxPLlctj7G4ppKLZasiGXLBzAwLtKw9FZ7tXQJUKA1VKhOvTd\ngAN1Psy19e34kyN5RVQQZWX6NTdlAdp1A5RzL0aED365igWLHAwiG676ZLCIEdTg\nivydzkXSceJhQ2buecruooxsYZ8FQMwEp/X3A2uPJtysSLmMSicTXWCIta5PIAWl\noq6++jDSs9eXUb04m9t/Nx2ii6ph8PXeHwBcHmhnoAUvKBI1vCmSLMgODbiHVAAg\n37/EVn7hVP44rF/dKQ37zs03pnFLLzYBKKbExkwJcLzZ7GkV6caoQKyLq+C+KqxP\njzAYsLyybB2Sg5GRfvWkvL+Pgam+NeFY3ngEwkIC6wOpa1D7B11quQzj81BkiGu0\n8m6UNZ0WAyptJkFEGayOnxRr0G6lumugfBitklyY0K2xIewpPgKYaIn/3YCzdjCd\n5zOAJ1GSqus9L6v5+4OTY6V7xzhmTDzOq2jH1fTwA4rBHtRbMYONWxLmp31racxQ\n4boejuCt9zJq6/qCXmNQ\n=s+zJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-07T04:16:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5O