-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/f52208e2f0361f9852b5908aaac74c4f0f7032a1","node_id":"C_kwDOUHx5BtoAKGY1MjIwOGUyZjAzNjFmOTg1MmI1OTA4YWFhYzc0YzRmMGY3MDMyYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commit/762b12bf4e09fc6356460d1ef761819dfc055006","sha":"762b12bf4e09fc6356460d1ef761819dfc055006","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/762b12bf4e09fc6356460d1ef761819dfc055006"}],"sha":"f52208e2f0361f9852b5908aaac74c4f0f7032a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/f52208e2f0361f9852b5908aaac74c4f0f7032a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1575723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juusimaa","id":1575723,"login":"juusimaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzU3MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juusimaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/commits/762b12bf4e09fc6356460d1ef761819dfc055006/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:46:38Z","email":"jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com","name":"Jouni Uusimaa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:46:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Close most spending-dashboard D-items against the shipped frontend (#15)\n\nThe dashboard shipped a while ago, so the design handoff is no longer\nthe reference for D2/D3/D5/D6/D7 -- the actual frontend is. Comparing\neach item against what got built: D2, D3 and D5 are closed as already\nresolved (in each case differently than the handoff assumed), and two\nof D7''s three bullets (brand tiles, quick-add catalogue) are done via\na client-side catalogue. D6 stays open because it turned out to be a\nreal frontend/backend disagreement, unrelated to the handoff. Currency\n(the third D7 bullet) stays open too -- still a genuine, undecided gap\nin the schema.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uu@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4449f0017296390075a92b3395926038342e01db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/trees/4449f0017296390075a92b3395926038342e01db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juusimaa/subscription-tracker/git/commits/762b12bf4e09fc6356460d1ef761819dfc055006","verification":{"payload":"tree 4449f0017296390075a92b3395926038342e01db\nparent bcfb52b27927fe228d4069f4f355592152a709e5\nauthor Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.uusimaa@gmail.com> 1788705998 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788705998 +0300\n\nClose most spending-dashboard D-items against the shipped frontend (#15)\n\nThe dashboard shipped a while ago, so the design handoff is no longer\nthe reference for D2/D3/D5/D6/D7 -- the actual frontend is. Comparing\neach item against what got built: D2, D3 and D5 are closed as already\nresolved (in each case differently than the handoff assumed), and two\nof D7''s three bullets (brand tiles, quick-add catalogue) are done via\na client-side catalogue. D6 stays open because it turned out to be a\nreal frontend/backend disagreement, unrelated to the handoff. Currency\n(the third D7 bullet) stays open too -- still a genuine, undecided gap\nin the schema.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jouni Uusimaa <jouni.