.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/3e245883c95672ef1364a1d264067e8412d8f813/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T10:30:54Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T10:30:54Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"message":"fix: seed roles in SeedNewTables + fix anonymous type build error\n\nThe initial seed only ran when database was empty. Since tenants already\nexisted, SeedNewTables was called instead — but it didn''t seed roles.\n\nNow SeedNewTables also seeds Dispatcher, Manager, Viewer, Fleet Manager,\nSafety Officer, Client Manager roles with form-role mappings for the\nfirst tenant (only if they don''t already exist).\n\nAlso fixed CS0833 build error: replaced anonymous type HashSet with\nstring key comparison for existing form-role mapping dedup.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"7960b5502fd2719dd7745b197c7325d50d7d03b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/7960b5502fd2719dd7745b197c7325d50d7d03b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/commits/3e245883c95672ef1364a1d264067e8412d8f813","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261186681?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https