"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/3f00d34c90af339a05b3c9764d62ce15d702c31b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T10:07:58Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T10:07:58Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"message":"fix: syntax error in loadPermMatrix + async Google Maps loading\n\n- Fixed orphaned try/catch in loadPermMatrix - the closing } of the\n  template literal ended the function before the catch could attach\n  to the outer try block. Moved catch inside the function body.\n- This syntax error was preventing the ENTIRE script from parsing,\n  causing: fill not defined, API not connected, maps not loading\n- Added loading=async to Google Maps script URL to fix performance warning\n\nAll 4 errors from the console are now resolved:\n1. Missing catch or finally after try → FIXED\n2. Google Maps loaded without loading=async → FIXED\n3. fill is not defined → FIXED (was cascading from #1)\n4. API not connected → FIXED (was cascading from #1)\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"6db75baba77673b24152c5f9a22b83cd83f456d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/6db75baba77673b24152c5f9a22b83cd83f456d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/commits/3f00d34c90af339a05b3c9764d62ce15d702c31b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{