tps://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/05518ac5a2e98591fe8dd730b15f07203f7daaf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T09:51:39Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T09:51:39Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"message":"fix: seed sample roles + forms + role mappings + error handling\n\nSeed data (backend):\n- Added Dispatcher, Manager, Viewer, Fleet Manager, Safety Officer,\n  Client Manager roles for Acme Logistics tenant\n- Added form-role mappings: Dispatcher gets ops forms, Manager gets\n  broader access, Viewer gets read-only dashboards\n- Each role has a description and realistic permission set\n\nFrontend:\n- Added try-catch error handling to all role management functions\n  (loadRolesList, loadPermMatrix, loadUserRoleMapping,\n  loadClientRoleMapping) so errors show gracefully instead of\n  breaking the page\n- Escaped single quotes in role names to prevent XSS in onclick\n- Added error messages that mention \"make sure backend is deployed\"\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"43bb11e42cc7042b5fe0da638e5c91dd4d2403af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/43bb11e42cc7042b5fe0da638e5c91dd4d2403af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git