ttps://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/e30ad63fb7ba4fbe8a4e98678c59224b36c533e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T09:42:54Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T09:42:54Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"message":"fix: drawing tools - create fresh DrawingManager per tool activation\n\nRoot cause: DrawingManager was created once with drawingMode:null then\nsetDrawingMode() was called to activate it. This is unreliable because\nthe DrawingManager loses its internal state after setDrawingMode(null).\n\nFix: startDrawMode() now:\n1. Calls cleanupGeoDrawingMgr() to destroy any existing DrawingManager\n2. Creates a BRAND NEW DrawingManager with the correct drawingMode set\n3. Calls setMap(geoPickerMap.map) to attach it to the map\n4. Attaches overlaycomplete listener on the fresh instance\n\nThis ensures the DrawingManager is always in a clean, properly\ninitialized state when the user clicks a draw tool button.\n\nAlso removed setupGeoDrawingManager() from initGeoPicker() since\nDrawingManager is now created on-demand.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"f394b899d4766c3b1d8bd0d8f012073591fc4a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/f394b899d4766c3b1d8bd0d8f012073591fc4a5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/commits/e30ad63fb7ba4fbe8a4e98678c59224b36c533e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261186681?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369/FMS/commit/e30ad63fb7ba4fbe8a4e98678c59224b36c533e2","node_id":"C_kwDOUHzM_NoAKGUzMGFkNjNmYjdiYTRmYmU4YTRlOTg2NzhjNTkyMjRiMzZjNTMzZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369/FMS/commit/d095687a38be5422c2abe19dbf6f5ef3027d2297","sha":"d095687a38be5422c2abe19dbf6f5ef3027d2297","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/d095687a38be5422c2abe19dbf6f5ef3027d2297"}],"sha":"e30ad63fb7ba4fbe8a4e98678c59224b36c533e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/e30ad63fb7ba4fbe8a4e98678c59224b36c533e2"},{"