 activate when buttons are clicked\n- Drawing Manager no longer blocks map clicks when not in draw mode\n\nRoute form:\n- Fixed all input indices (were off by 1 due to querySelectorAll)\n- Start Lat=i[3], Start Lng=i[4], End Lat=i[5], End Lng=i[6]\n- Added types:[''geocode'',''establishment''] to route address autocomplete\n- Increased marker size for better visibility\n\nGeofence form:\n- Fixed input indices (search bar adds extra input at index 0)\n- Latitude=i[3], Longitude=i[4], Radius from slider element directly\n- Name=i[1] (not i[0] which is the search bar)\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"f20fce9a82c27124894829534a92c39e2258fc82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/f20fce9a82c27124894829534a92c39e2258fc82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/commits/0350d2bd3a7c80c9b66d7180cad7a82a9e3fe1b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261186681?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369