x: geofence map interaction - search, click-to-mark, my location\n\n- Fixed Drawing Manager blocking map clicks when not in draw mode\n  (now only activates when a draw tool button is clicked)\n- Added dedicated search bar with 🔍 button for address lookup\n- Added Google Places Autocomplete with types:[''geocode'',''establishment'']\n  so it shows suggestions for partial queries like \"sri akk\"\n- Added ''📍 My Location'' button using browser Geolocation API\n- Added manual search fallback using AutocompleteService when\n  Autocomplete dropdown doesn''t appear\n- Made initial marker larger (scale:16) for better visibility\n- Styled PAC autocomplete dropdown to work above modals\n- Added geometry library to Google Maps script URL\n- Search bar is now separate from the form''s hidden address field\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"c94a66fa17d58a9917b60e9756576d7381378a2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/c94a66fa17d58a9917b60e9756576d7381378a2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/commits/f50c9c36d9e4109651e0e4266570e13c48d21cf6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261186681?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_ad