oordinates\n- 3 sample geofences\n- 3 sample subscriptions\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"a05de378998e41ef24d2d01dfcd9d868f8a7eede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/a05de378998e41ef24d2d01dfcd9d868f8a7eede"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/commits/98432052620543c7f38b955584545320b9f0fc7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261186681?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369/FMS/commit/98432052620543c7f38b955584545320b9f0fc7e","node_id":"C_kwDOUHzM_NoAKDk4NDMyMDUyNjIwNTQzYzdmMzhiOTU1NTg0NTQ1MzIwYjlmMGZjN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369/FMS/commit/739606c97b5a06edc11c1c72d9847b82878bd0cb","sha":"739606c97b5a06edc11c1c72d9847b82878bd0cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/739606c97b5a06edc11c1c72d9847b82878bd0cb"}],"sha":"98432052620543c7f38b955584545320b9f0fc7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/98432052620543c7f38b955584545320b9f0fc7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261186681?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/commits/739606c97b5a06edc11c1c72d9847b82878bd0cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T16:39:27Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T16:39:27Z","email":"groverlakshya.25.lg@gmail.com","name":"AlienAlien369"},"message":"fix: rewrite DB migration with PascalCase columns matching EF Core\n\nThe previous migration used lowercase column names (id, category, code)\nand quoted table names but lowercase FK references (tenants(id)). EF Core\ncreates tables with PascalCase quoted identifiers (\"Id\", \"Category\"),\nand PostgreSQL is case-sensitive — so none of the CREATE TABLE IF NOT\nEXISTS statements matched the existing schema.\n\nRewrote migration to:\n- Use PascalCase column names matching EF Core properties\n- Execute each CREATE TABLE individually (no PL/pgSQL DO blocks)\n- Execute each ALTER TABLE and CREATE INDEX individually\n- Add self-referencing FK for Lookups after table exists\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"96920295b8df2404058a73251eca926333e6f5fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/96920295b8df2404058a73251eca926333e6f5fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/commits/739606c97b5a06edc11c1c72d9847b82878bd0cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261186681?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369/FMS/commit/739606c97b5a06edc11c1c72d9847b82878bd0cb","node_id":"C_kwDOUHzM_NoAKDczOTYwNmM5N2I1YTA2ZWRjMTFjMWM3MmQ5ODQ3YjgyODc4YmQwY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369/FMS/commit/343fa334cec4f10b3129dda8a11042214659e741","sha":"343fa334cec4f10b3129dda8a11042214659e741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienA