(Domain, Application, Infrastructure, API)\n- 6 microservices: Auth, Entity, Telemetry, Config, Notification, DataCollector\n- API Gateway (Ocelot), SharedKernel, MessageBus (MassTransit + RabbitMQ)\n- Angular 17+ shell with Module Federation\n- PostgreSQL (Neon) with RLS, MongoDB for telemetry\n- MQTT ingestion with device adapter framework\n- Docker Compose for local development\n- CI/CD pipeline, Terraform IaC, architecture docs\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"36cc49f4deded8c8075049d01e6cc9bf3ff2dfc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/trees/36cc49f4deded8c8075049d01e6cc9bf3ff2dfc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienAlien369/FMS/git/commits/273d8429f203aca73085e53a7375af5b9279b8c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261186681?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369","id":261186681,"login":"AlienAlien369","node_id":"U_kgDOD5FkeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlienAlien369","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlienAlien369/FMS/commit/273d8429f203aca73085e53a7375af5b9279b8c2","node_id"