pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/fe426e165b1db64b714d6f542023c9545205f2e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T11:24:23Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T11:24:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add SPEC.md — component-library non-negotiables (AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md blocked, needs manual rename) (#16)\n\nThis repo had zero agent guide at all. Content covers: no npm-registry\npublish step (file: path consumption only), the Docker-build native-\nbinding pitfall for consuming remotes, why vite.config.ts must stay in\nobject form, why a tiny relative remoteEntry.js is correct not broken,\nand the missing-test-script trap for consuming remotes.\n\nNOTE: writing AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md directly was blocked by an approval\nguard (protected agent-instruction filenames, first-ever write on this\nrepo, times out without an explicit user go-ahead) -- per the fleet-ops\nskill''s documented workaround, the content is saved as SPEC.md instead.\nclaudioed: please review and rename to AGENTS.md (+ symlink CLAUDE.md ->\nAGENTS.md, matching every other repo) yourself, or ask me to retry with\nyour explicit confirmation.\n\nPart of the harness-engineering coverage expansion plan\n(.hermes/plans/2026-09-13_234500-harness-coverage-expansion.md), Phase 4\nTask 4.4.","tree":{"sha":"1a45bd45dbe47553364082346f70d38e16643323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/trees/1a45bd45dbe47553364082346f70d38e16643323"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/commits/fe4