_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/048a7f84f75abe71fa1e2617e2c413a84319aa8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T01:08:34Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T01:08:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(build): add Makefile mirroring ci.yml''s lint/typecheck/test/build/audit (#15)\n\nThis repo had no Makefile at all, unlike every other repo in the fleet\n(the eight Go bounded-context repos, and now e2e-tests/warehouse-infra as\nof this same coverage-expansion pass). CI already runs lint, typecheck,\ntest, build, dependency-audit, and trivy-scan; this just gives them a\nlocal `make check`/`make check-all` entry point matching the fleet''s\nestablished vocabulary.\n\ncheck = lint typecheck test build (fast pre-commit loop)\ncheck-all = check + dependency-audit (fuller pre-push gate; trivy-scan\nneeds a built image and isn''t meaningful to run locally the same way)\n\nVerified locally: lint clean, typecheck clean, 45/45 tests pass, build\nsucceeds, npm audit --audit-level=high finds 0 vulnerabilities.\n\nPart of the harness-engineering coverage expansion plan\n(.hermes/plans/2026-09-13_234500-harness-coverage-expansion.md), Phase 1\nTask 1.5.","tree":{"sha":"d936f774c497c827ba01a9914564a1d183b5a4b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/trees/d936f774c497c827ba01a9914564a1d183b5a4b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/commits/048a7f84f75abe71fa1e2617e2c413a84319aa8b","verification":{"payload":"tree d936f774c497c827ba01a9914564a1d183b5a4b2\nparent 2442c41fcd2306fdfc9e224ad3b45ce50c9013d7\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789348114 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789348114 -0300\n\nfeat(build): add Makefile mirroring ci.yml''s lint/typecheck/test/build/audit (#15)\n\nThis repo had no Makefile at all, unlike every other repo in the fleet\n(the eight Go bounded-context repos, and now e2e-tests/warehouse-infra as\nof this same coverage-expansion pass). CI already runs lint, typecheck,\ntest, build, dependency-audit, and trivy-scan; this just gives them a\nlocal `make check`/`make check-all` entry point matching the fleet''s\nestablished vocabulary.\n\ncheck = lint typecheck test build (fast pre-commit loop)\ncheck-all = check + dependency-audit (fuller pre-push gate; trivy-scan\nneeds a built image and isn''t meaningful to run locally the same way)\n\nVerified locally: lint clean, typecheck clean, 45/45 tests pass, build\nsucceeds, npm audit --audit-level=high finds 0 vulnerabilities.\n\nPart of the harness-engineering coverage expansion plan\n(.hermes/plans/2026-09-13_234500-harness-coverage-expansion.md), Phase 1\nTask 1.5.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqp0kSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9E4QAB56RLfpO1Pxd9aAPtm4cCOZ\nVdfsd8N37IugOZkLfyF0te3C1gv/bru2ZsiGv2nrChXSUbVR+8KMhbRCXuSc98t0\nnJs8R0W9WiGKx4WM3FdLvjfEklE40AkwfUld0tcgkx8HJmD/Qi/+e4PUXJBp2L5G\nciIfWjbMKMsUHC2OjiXMLFbQhvFGaEakplVR6UGzIRGvBjwG133eTzlkaXhOuLUD\nZ44sbn1Ksn+YeCxci3HnJwgyr591jjfww+ubv02B