direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix: add @typescript/typescript6 fallback for TS7''s removed JS Compiler API\n\nvite-plugin-dts (via unplugin-dts) needs the CommonJS-based JS Compiler\nAPI that TypeScript 7 removed. TS7''s own upgrade guide documents\n@typescript/typescript6 as the official compatibility shim: it lets\nTS7 handle compilation while unplugin-dts still gets the JS API it\nneeds for .d.ts generation.\n\nVerified: npm run lint, typecheck, build, and test (45/45) all pass\nclean with typescript 7.0.2.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: claudioed <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8fcf5926f4dafc9e06ef9e1ad601c4fe21ddded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/trees/a8fcf5926f4dafc9e06ef9e1ad601c4fe21ddded"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/commits/2442c41fcd2306fdfc9e224ad3b45ce50c9013d7","verification":{"payload":"tree a8fcf5926f4dafc9e06ef9e1ad601c4fe21ddded\nparent b6e71a0beb1a65b679e21a4e757e15f1512989b5\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1789309583 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789309583 -0300\n\nbuild(deps-dev): bump typescript from 6.0.3 to 7.0.2 (#9)\n\n* build(deps-dev): bump typescript from 6.0.3 to 7.0.2\n\nBumps [typescript](https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript) from 6.0.3 to 7.0.2.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/compare/v6.0.3...v7.0.2)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: typescript\n  dependency-version: 7.0.2\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix: add @typescript/typescript6 fallback for TS7''s removed JS Compiler API\n\nvite-plugin-dts (via unplugin-dts) needs the CommonJS-based JS Compiler\nAPI that TypeScript 7 removed. TS7''s own upgrade guide documents\n@typescript/typescript6 as the official compatibility shim: it lets\nTS7 handle compilation while unplugin-dts still gets the JS API it\nneeds for .d.ts generation.\n\nVerified: npm run lint, typecheck, build, and test (45/45) all pass\nclean with typescript 7.0.2.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: claudioed <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqprKPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhLkQAC/vyASklKRvN8VpNr0alcCt\ndqcuBVRTBs2jqFnUM7PrapvnFml9jxGLK5LPMvBc3Xj969m32WX0nAbc1e1Zo3rl\nZxYvduG/6W5d042GLEilqkA+iVt+WEHt4SUr+/EoaJHatDWufoLvKvmwRSj8cllA\nt8WJCfv8PstpzNrZQZh0B+wWsSswFx/AF8BvIUWj8x68ciNhtJjDu4U6g28zmrN3\nuTg46idPB+OXrgpIZ7oDDLRtocltVhmaZE1dMHoLh4vjjKTzjt/4IKfv9+uTeylW\nK/rYldXVn9UTevDr84LGHjLzd/a+Oa0CV/E52moU3yAk9vRlUqrVPlWiOxI41XSe\nUhJf53suvuAA0WuwZNYlg09e/eOzdAggYo+LYI0xUnpRzWbUDOSE6ZC+3F9Fu4Sl\nnHjXkqRpkFDcf82HXAPM2LfXPx0sGE+ER3CS/rZSKfKLwgCOYg1Loa1brdMPQsMg\nkXoUzik9HplYW9AEp6vd2TA5/71xDA1deQns/VLZskoq/TDZfldI4VmqlJeMr5ib\n4c447YNKcmdg3lnWZRQF/KGHLeAltE+l5y5PxESMZQ4Xw/t1JMxcdrdgSERBgsbk\nkb/x8qh1EaRHOZJgpzv3MpoPh3o8pHJITNETJVWaMPGEscm+SV5tvaXVc9GlJRKh\ndKCg3MeIazrf91hCxVCo\n=+ar3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T14:26:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":198644