b6e71a0beb1a65b679e21a4e757e15f1512989b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/b6e71a0beb1a65b679e21a4e757e15f1512989b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/ec9fd9cc72ac7de2ceb8e90c9ca0abecb0ce4bce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:42:18Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:42:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"build: add .dockerignore so consumer images resolve their own native bindings (#13)\n\nThis package is supplied as a named Docker build context to nine sibling\nfrontend images (the warehouse-console shell and the eight bounded-context\nModule Federation remotes). Without a .dockerignore, COPY --from=uikit drags\nthe developer''s local node_modules into those Linux builders.\n\nThat tree only ever holds the host platform''s binaries for the native\ndependencies Vite 8 pulls in (@rolldown/binding-darwin-arm64,\nlightningcss-darwin-*), so npm inside the image considers those packages\ninstalled, never fetches the linux equivalents, and the build fails with\n''Cannot find native binding ... @rolldown/binding-linux-arm64-gnu''\n(npm/cli#4828). Verified concretely while packaging order_mgmt_mfe.\n\nAlso drops ~176MB from every consumer''s build context.","tree":{"sha":"cbcccebcc655e1f970e0da7b2ae3ef62439337cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/trees/cbcccebcc655e1f970e0da7b2ae3ef62439337cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/commits/ec9fd9cc72ac7de2ceb8e90c9ca0abecb0ce4bce","verification":{"payload":"tree cbcccebcc655e1f970e0da7b2ae3ef62439337cc\nparent aeea69edfa8875e965a551a9ca61c7704e9d108e\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789234938 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789234938 -0300\n\nbuild: add .dockerignore so consumer images resolve their own native bindings (#13)\n\nThis package is supplied as a named Docker build context to nine sibling\nfrontend images (the warehouse-console shell and the eight bounded-context\nModule Federation remotes). Without a .dockerignore, COPY --from=uikit drags\nthe developer''s local node_modules into those Linux builders.\n\nThat tree only ever holds the host platform''s binaries for the native\ndependencies Vite 8 pulls in (@rolldown/binding-darwin-arm64,\nlightningcss-darwin-*), so npm inside the image considers those packages\ninstalled, never fetches the linux equivalents, and the build fails with\n''Cannot find native binding ... @rolldown/binding-linux-arm64-gnu''\n(npm/cli#4828). Verified concretely while packaging order_mgmt_mfe.\n\nAlso drops ~176MB from every consumer''s build context.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpY76CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKDUQAGZPie0Y6/ycRup0Ny8PbMej\n5sEvbs6vFLiY9xx9Mb1SBe+IXtZkvUcox+fg9IbIbYsIwajqVdAXAmU3y9QvD0UV\nzPP/BTVqbvwKs1ON9xup8SdULGHx5nP1NqGcG2720FiHPQnQciY3Ii0UPYVE