 (#3)\n\nAdds the two process-path-management ProcessPath.Status values to\nStatusPill''s DomainStatus union and STATUS_TONE map, per this file''s own\ndoc comment (\"add new statuses here as new lifecycle states ship\").\nACTIVE renders as success (green), DEACTIVATED as neutral -- matching\nthe existing pattern for other terminal/inactive states\n(Decommissioned, OffShift).\n\nVerified: npm run build (tsc -b + vite build), npm run lint (oxlint),\nnpm test -- all clean, all 25 existing tests still pass unaffected.","tree":{"sha":"aca7bebe440e6c67b95da9d1d1ae7b1273d833e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/trees/aca7bebe440e6c67b95da9d1d1ae7b1273d833e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/commits/e432f03694bd255640506a57611c8fe345d80e73","verification":{"payload":"tree aca7bebe440e6c67b95da9d1d1ae7b1273d833e7\nparent 9b63da652de7709c752c971c1295cdb9d62dd80b\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1788717231 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788717231 -0300\n\nfeat(StatusPill): add ACTIVE/DEACTIVATED for ProcessPath.Status (#3)\n\nAdds the two process-path-management ProcessPath.Status values to\nStatusPill''s DomainStatus union and STATUS_TONE map, per this file''s own\ndoc comment (\"add new statuses here as new lifecycle states ship\").\nACTIVE renders as success (green), DEACTIVATED as neutral -- matching\nthe existing pattern for other terminal/inactive states\n(Decommissioned, OffShift).\n\nVerified: npm run build (tsc -b + vite build), npm run lint (oxlint),\nnpm test -- all clean, all 25 existing tests still pass unaffected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnaivCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgs0QAAwWNA9k8Z4nIeE+ngm0kPJV\ns0gVR7iqk79I59fzgz792IvYQio3/ek/Mz9wRTblCugRZ1dKhs5Opt1FCxeDkmU0\n7U1We0iInAi28UlzKmA3moqhnEwBcWEx43kFF0CKP+Oq1YJ3bixU52SzmUtUP7WL\nY55iy2rDm2Uc/Daeqsl/MzBbHvtGHgTusJKwjv5jPQx2UA48UvMomi1DhHk4UbCb\nz1L5JRbfeemZ9AYTp0W4x