d80e73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/e432f03694bd255640506a57611c8fe345d80e73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/9b63da652de7709c752c971c1295cdb9d62dd80b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:53:36Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:53:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: navigation context, shared formatters, live-fetch state, and control-room styling (#2)\n\nAdds what warehouse-console''s Floor/Contexts/RouterLink work depends on:\n\n- NavigationProvider/useLinkComponent (src/navigation) -- lets a host inject\n  its router''s Link so nav clicks stop being full document navigations,\n  without the kit ever importing react-router itself.\n- Shared formatters (src/utils/format.ts): formatNumber, formatCompact,\n  formatPercent, formatDuration, formatInstant, secondsSince, NO_VALUE --\n  one place that decides how a quantity is written, mirroring StatusPill''s\n  role for status coloring.\n- useFetch gains polling, staleness tracking, and manual refetch\n  (FetchState.stale/lastUpdatedAt/refetch, UseFetchOptions, FetchError) so\n  a live monitor screen can poll safely and show \"last known\" on a failed\n  refresh instead of blanking.\n- Timeline gains an \"unavailable\" step state for a stage whose upstream\n  didn''t answer, distinct from a real terminal state.\n- KpiStat, AppShell, LaunchTile, DataTable restyled for a control-room\n  surface (KpiState/KpiFormat/KpiThreshold, component-scoped CSS folded\n  into dist/ui-kit.css via cssCodeSplit: false).\n\nComponent and hook tests added for KpiStat, Timeline, and useFetch (45\ntests total, up from the prior suite).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FogYxqLgj896STU3QD8qKU\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1cdb0ca92bcd279201caf50ea74cd84f712b649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/trees/b1cdb0ca92bcd279201caf50ea74cd84f712b649"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/commits/9b63da652de7709c752c971c1295cdb9d62dd80b","verification":{"payload":"tree b1cdb0ca92bcd279201caf50ea74cd84f712b649\nparent 71b431e59c9e2c2b4adef9fbcd2d1e8f7adb945e\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1788717216 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788717216 -0300\n\nfeat: navigation context, shared formatters, live-fetch state, and control-room styling (#2)\n\nAdds what warehouse-console''s Floor/Contexts/RouterLink work depends on:\n\n- NavigationProvider/useLinkComponent (src/navigation) -- lets a host inject\n  its router''s Link so nav clicks stop being full document navigations,\n  without the kit ever importing react-router itself.\n- Shared formatters (src/utils/format.ts): formatNumber, formatCompact,\n  formatPercent, formatDuration, formatInstant, secondsSince, NO_VALUE --\n  one place that decides how a quantity is written, mirroring StatusPill''s\n  role for status coloring.\n- useFetch gains polling, staleness tracking, and manual refetch\n  (FetchState.stale/lastUpdatedAt/refetch, UseFetchOptions, FetchError) so\n  a live monitor screen can poll safely and show \"last known\" on a failed\n  refresh instead of blanking.\n- Timeline gains an \"unavailable\" step state for a stage whose upstream\n  didn''t answer, distinct from a real terminal state.\n- KpiStat, AppShell, LaunchTile, DataTable restyled for a control-room\n  surface (KpiState/KpiFormat/KpiThreshold, component-scoped CSS folded\n  into dist/ui-kit.css via cssCodeSplit: false).\n\nComponent and hook tests added for KpiStat, Timeline, and useFetch (45\ntests total, up from the prior suite).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FogYxqLgj896STU3QD8qKU\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnaigCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj4QQAJEzqdGZ359zRa3EfLz/Y3oB\nl5pi0vPZ7L89Oh6oOxYLy/1Lo9sHvq+cvoFMQwIirq3x3gOnAJtsumnbkAUGLCuH\nzOt1irM9hX6VeRvA4s0G1PPpQkp3P/ZwwybAevG5UzvNXn1IbVcn861dduQ3h9+z\n+EKcTyxzwK9YD8aPGDb0he7KxRLpgBLEUGs8TSwoIU0vZThpcyRUMGKnk/2rWBfu\nO06SPd6ctjB+/VtCEQXyn2Tmg3X4I+DPaXGT3/95RwQ06h5n7hwJHXDe6r4g7cCd\n1h4pqEQTpKQeiXr8oKphen5JOCdMpq+2DISOGKAmdwlAJYnH9kdOGnnxEsqKrjbI\nE+bHsyLW/MhvxYkVfv4dC3L5emnS+Tr5pwyh/zcGc+LUIN01MRA30pisarvtC4gX\nIRk6TpxZmY4v2WV2uNPPYA8/m6Lct1A1wgN8p++LqmH6w5q9sMXn85nJ/lERroML\n934sRSQSa2MK9Iw8MU3S8lZtJ1U5s1TcFrQOfK0zvNmhTCSQeTSeXZXnY0nDk1dW\n1VeeYha1yqs0FVyS6y4VdXA+WpFsUNv+ZV+ugSux2Mr6FhEPO9wsD6de/vBCNh3v\nfsgNe7o0wIycCd7qKNmotePcF8zPYBmkuqW5XMb8t901K+zVu1l9WxaeUhIlzJUb\npge1axOlt72Zyyo6iY2K\n=tOR9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-06T17:53:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commit/9b63da652de7709c752c971c1295cdb9d62dd80b","node_id":"C_kwDOUID8y9oAKDliNjNkYTY1MmRlNzcwOWM3NTJjOTcxYzEyOTVjZGI5ZDYyZGQ4MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commit/71b431e59c9e2c2b4adef9fbcd2d1e8f7adb945e","sha":"71b431e59c9e2c2b4adef9fbcd2d1e8f7adb945e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/71b431e59c9e2c2b4adef9fbcd2d1e8f7adb945e"}],"sha":"9b63da652de7709c752c971c1295cdb9d62dd80b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/9b63da652de7709c752c971c1295cdb9d62dd80b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/commits/71b431e59c9e2c2b4adef9fbcd2d1e8f7adb945e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:19:35Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:19:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add dependency-free SVG chart primitives (BarChart, LineChart, FunnelChart) (#1)\n\nThe fleet has no charting capability at all, and the upcoming WMS and WES\ndashboard screens need real charts rather than another row of KpiStat tiles.\n\nAdds three SVG primitives that follow the existing component conventions\n(one file per component, functional component + exported props interface,\ninline styles driven entirely by tokens.css custom properties):\n\n- BarChart   -- horizontal (default) or vertical bars over a shared 0..max\n                domain, for comparing named categories.\n- LineChart  -- single time series with an optional target/threshold line.\n                The threshold is folded into the y-domain so it is always\n                on screen. Domain is data-derived, not zero-based: these\n                are trend charts.\n- FunnelChart -- stage funnel with tapering connectors, per-stage conversion\n                against the entry stage, and the drop-off between adjacent\n                stages rendered as leakage. For the WMS order funnel\n                (received -> allocated -> released) that leakage IS the\n                backordered/cancelled volume, so it is derived from the\n                stages rather than passed separately -- the chart cannot\n                disagree with itself.\n\nNo charting library is pulled in on purpose: this package is a Module\nFederation shared singleton, so a dependency here is a cost every remote\npays on every screen.\n\nNumeric edge cases are handled rather than left to produce NaN geometry:\nempty data renders an empty state instead of a plot, an all-zero series\nyields zero-length bars instead of dividing by zero, a perfectly flat line\nseries is centred vertically, and a zero entry stage reports conversion as\na placeholder. Negative bar values are clamped to zero length while still\nshowing the real number.\n\nNote: CSS custom properties are invalid inside SVG presentation attributes,\nso fill/stroke are set via `style`, never as `fill=\"var(--x)\"`.\n\nTest infrastructure: the package had no test setup at all, so this also adds\nVitest + jsdom + React Testing Library, an `npm test` script, a separate\ntsconfig.test.json project (wired into the `tsc -b` reference graph so tests\nare typechecked), and a `test` job in CI. Test files are excluded from\ntsconfig.app.json because vite-plugin-dts generates dist/ declarations from\nthat project -- verified that dist/src/components/{BarChart,LineChart,\nFunnelChart,chartCommon}.d.ts emit with real types and no test files leak.\n\n25 tests cover basic rendering, formatValue, geometry/scaling, and the\nempty-data edge case for each component.","tree":{"sha":"3ebee766bb5f11eb7262d3fbda4e8518f3d8e1a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/trees/3ebee766bb5f11eb7262d3fbda4e8518f3d8e1a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit/git/commits/71b431e59c9e2c2b4adef9fbcd2d1e8f7adb945e","verification":{"payload":"tree 3ebee766bb5f11eb7262d3fbda4e8518f3d8e1a2\nparent b08784fec9953d70b547e42831a48fd1bcce27ef\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1788603575 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788603575 -0300\n\nfeat: add dependency-free SVG chart primitives (BarChart, LineChart, FunnelChart) (#1)\n\nThe fleet has no charting capability at all, and the upcoming WMS and WES\ndashboard screens need real charts rather than another row of KpiStat tiles.\n\nAdds three SVG primitives that follow the existing component conventions\n(one file per component, functional component + exported props interface,\ninline styles driven entirely by tokens.css custom properties):\n\n- BarChart   -- horizontal (default) or vertical bars over a shared 0..max\n                domain, for comparing named categories.\n- LineChart  -- single time series with an optional target/threshold line.\n                The threshold is folded into the y-domain so it is always\n                on screen. Domain is data-derived, not zero-based: these\n                are trend charts.\n- FunnelChart -- stage funnel with tapering connectors, per-stage conversion\n                against the entry stage, and the drop-off between adjacent\n                stages rendered as leakage. For the WMS order funnel\n                (received -> allocated -> released) that leakage IS the\n                backordered/cancelled volume, so it is derived from the\n                stages rather than passed separately -- the chart cannot\n                disagree with itself.\n\nNo charting library is pulled in on purpose: this package is a Module\nFederation shared singleton, so a dependency here is a cost every remote\npays on every screen.\n\nNumeric edge cases are handled rather than left to produce NaN geometry:\nempty data renders an empty state instead of a plot, an all-zero series\nyields zero-length bars instead of dividing by zero, a perfectly flat line\nseries is centred vertically, and a zero entry stage reports conversion as\na placeholder. Negative bar values are clamped to zero length while still\nshowing the real number.\n\nNote: CSS custom properties are invalid inside SVG presentation attributes,\nso fill/stroke are set via `style`, never as `fill=\"var(--x)\"`.\n\nTest infrastructure: the package had no test setup at all, so this also adds\nVitest + jsdom + React Testing Library, an `npm test` script, a separate\ntsconfig.test.json project (wired into the `tsc -b` reference graph so tests\nare typechecked), and a `test` job in CI. Test files are excluded from\ntsconfig.app.json because vite-plugin-dts generates dist/ declarations from\nthat project -- verified that dist/src/components/{BarChart,LineChart,\nFunnelChart,chartCommon}.d.ts emit with real types and no test files leak.\n\n25 tests cover basic rendering, formatValue, geometry/scaling, and the\nempty-data edge case for each component.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqm+y3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjh4QAA6VucecnJHvds/CEjFIvk7V\nQCNtEV4g/6KNbKdFyh+raezNmn/Q3CmYmiHdyyK6wL4R7NIcxKAjEFb9RaQxDi89\nWeLaYSQm/Hty822ZkW/pYpCzr56izeK5szIQ/JjdIfBEvU3BIwzOidq0Mu6vOkSK\n6/xh/fd9bwlzWVCbb+rqd/JIFUb6QZuAR948M8JxZ1dSGG+lf5AS1jjEVn7bmtEj\nIoSASeU/zHl4PiNfgsqTuxNl3l+IG36EzIehjy9Pbpt96o4+8brY978aJgGmc7fD\ntUqNzOAO421xzcdeUR1jgM/xels5YreaFI8nRLfZkbNrKHpPiO8ztG7Ny/WxRvSR\n+h1Jz9cVmfAkkcLO06vCeBQELWcb/tks8vIyOm9sIZ5sCZ2P1jv/iKem3f7i0+zM\nR2oRhBpXDCMA1x4pmo1g5yv8Q6QT7lWr0EfII1p4rNMPJcDigRkOG9onhUlyfjMQ\nWcYwyme/iCGL89FNNUQ9wJbdyg2jVbYs1/qumovlKo+J4ffix8bqqlOU6bICMVYA\nf7t9J0L1xWpiL8d36E9u5OsUdXPBRU4Xbwkuaw42WxlYlaYrIKjL7rebx4Pe04Ju\n1gD2eqvShwCl1GfKRTB63I+Ts/ylPZQlqkpive/IKORy5xtrw6ylhwf33XYDAuKH\nGuGYKo67eqpJGwbiyqkK\n=MLiR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T10:19:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flo