,"name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mf): blank console — host must win the React singleton (#49)\n\n* fix(mf): host wins the React singleton (shareStrategy loaded-first)\n\norder-management and network-fulfillment remotes now ship react 19.3.0 while\nthe shell ships 19.2.8. With the default version-first strategy the runtime\npicked a remote''s React, so the shell''s react-dom rendered against another\ninstance whose dispatcher is null (\"reading ''useRef''\") and the console was\nblank. loaded-first keeps the host''s already-loaded singleton for every remote.\nVerified in headless Chrome against the live remotes: before = empty #root,\nafter = all 5 routes render, zero page errors.\n\n* chore(deps): bump brace-expansion to 1.1.21 in /docs\n\nFixes CVE-2026-102276 (brace-expansion DoS, HIGH) flagged by trivy-fs-scan,\nunblocking this PR''s required checks. Same fix already merged separately\nin other fleet repos'' docs subpackages.","tree":{"sha":"554455518e014b48fe63feebf47b14891984bb35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/trees/554455518e014b48fe63feebf47b14891984bb35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/commits/052d9a9c8ff04c79e50c67acdebcf0aca0238751","verification":{"payload":"tree 554455518e014b48fe63feebf47b14891984bb35\nparent 19979ea3f937aa49a6d5f24430bc4e17b3dff2e5\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790899321 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790899321 -0300\n\nfix(mf): blank console — host must win the React singleton (#49)\n\n* fix(mf): host wins the React singleton (shareStrategy loaded-first)\n\norder-management and network-fulfillment remotes now ship react 19.3.0 while\nthe shell ships 19.2.8. With the default version-first strategy the runtime\npicked a remote''s React, so the shell''s react-dom rendered against another\ninstance whose dispatcher is null (\"reading ''useRef''\") and the console was\nblank. loaded-first keeps the host''s already-loaded singleton for every remote.\nVerified in headless Chrome against the live remotes: before = empty #root,\nafter = all 5 routes render, zero page errors.\n\n* chore(deps): bump brace-expansion to 1.1.21 in /docs\n\nFixes CVE-2026-102276 (brace-expansion DoS, HIGH) flagged by trivy-fs-scan,\nunblocking this PR''s required checks. Same fix already merged separately\nin other fleet repos'' docs subpackages.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvvR5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAs0wQAJxW/VZYcm2Gn3qYoIoGH+Li\npawKvlqlCWJFSbJmkObXpkk8+h8SFWIVF3mZnyi0e8o4iBkwFZZLuzfoJXCgCmEp\nKsoO6OJiIudC9fhPmQG/PFAlZR8yCl84WTekdGhGZkRfYzhRfC/mGchKa7UHaMse\nPot07GP11iJSZcbiWGc65vyqqbcEieiI8ZkFsU1wndGz609RoSPqbK2k1AgydWi7\nWzL/JFR4+BJOH4WEtG7zTsFad8cP/xLUwtO5P11q47mxpkd6j884gU6a+Htx+6/r\nmhXKwvpx1AntqQj2faZpeJMesHu1SncXT5kmkLIzpcY/4b4eOL5xCpRHD4Sd1das\nWRJ2IsE1LDr0yAWHGqK06hstQjlsgr/RekYZV/4kZO7sRpoydf+ZWVmzFp2xIman\nL+6PEO1zXF/4Sqbgsx997IwESFU4zUPPT3N5MQVdbkYGGBv36+76/aJJk4uHO3DE\nZlW8qQW2axgLQltGYRxHc+VB8umznMY3CwECd5cifZMAf1eS8cpP/jDRGL4kaT0J\neoIiyV9TY+1EPtWJ2/ygRrtl+v19wT8a/v8ZyXqVNo+JJhZAEO2JeQ71FL5j0kX/\n9LvlD3jiQNr/4e/eFDVU1ktMuGKraQSmwaL+j0LgKRTwlrBmsdG3b91b7DYQm7Di\nosJHzj82dINMThqNxzaf\n=wgnh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T00:02:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","