a0b8cd7a38eb22ddec6035241205088/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T13:29:15Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T13:29:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(docker-publish): publish images to GHCR instead of Docker Hub (#41)\n\nSwitch docker-publish and release jobs from Docker Hub to GHCR:\n- Replace the Docker Hub login step (DOCKERHUB_USERNAME/DOCKERHUB_TOKEN)\n  with a GHCR login using the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN (no new secret needed).\n- Add `packages: write` to docker-publish''s job permissions (required to\n  push to GHCR).\n- Prefix every image reference (build tags, cosign sign/attest, SBOM\n  attestation, imagetools re-tag on release, release notes) with\n  `ghcr.io/`.\n- Update the couple of docs/README lines that named Docker Hub as the\n  registry.\n\nSame trigger, same versioning scheme (SHORT_SHA + :latest on main,\nsemver tag on release) -- registry only.","tree":{"sha":"91fa6feb4da4461921d4a726ce72c737360055d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/trees/91fa6feb4da4461921d4a726ce72c737360055d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/commits/860449afba0b8cd7a38eb22ddec6035241205088","verification":{"payload":"tree 91fa6feb4da4461921d4a726ce72c737360055d8\nparent 9f4d13d1ad934653042b4064eb5f9731173950d4\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790429355 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790429355 -0300\n\nci(docker-publish): publish images to GHCR instead of Docker Hub (#41)\n\nSwitch docker-publish and release jobs from Docker Hub to GHCR:\n- Replace the Docker Hub login step (DOCKERHUB_USERNAME/DOCKERHUB_TOKEN)\n  with a GHCR login using the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN (no new secret needed).\n- Add `packages: write` to docker-publish''s job permissions (required to\n  push to GHCR).\n- Prefix every image reference (build tags, cosign sign/attest, SBOM\n  attestation, imagetools re-tag on release, release notes) with\n  `ghcr.io/`.\n- Update the couple of docs/README lines that named Docker Hub as the\n  registry.\n\nSame trigger, same versioning scheme (SHORT_SHA + :latest on main,\nsemver tag on release) -- registry only.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt8irCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9ZAQADWNohnfFDGtKvm1X7HkLhil\n8bfcPPp0vMnXRf9OwX5W8p4Okfmh5iTt3bOEEhbjIZ2UwbBFrBEzFtPJ+HbcXpv3\njtzfcxNdbCmJw31r8IAiP/zgbqljWuom7GUmZLib5NjlGB/cE5lR+a/zlzSGlprh\ns5q+3VjC//PamYsXsLd0WqXZVWNFT81scYnYXKfIx2dYVvBz4edqUkmqmAdQrXDZ\nN5oLM4TdxwZwJpnUtbxQ6lxeAWbd4ywK1UOv7/ZATkPgWZ0S9SeIQ88jkuM4pF58\n0CKDHAAMwDYJoL5Jdkdpt/E+/LC/2SqUUC+UlnJqt6VnM3TfR0/vwrtSZOqLtl/C\ne1T4L5uGcwR7rlQLaYrZMXG+Wff800twgxK+zH2mPYX2+3txEMW33VC+9MNOe2Ak\nrS8r1+bpK2iv6NVj7b4dzuk0W3Go95a91mt/Zz1+IQMk8Qxc7AIm2U7S3cYQifjI\n3iNy2DygvXxQi8CJFBurQzHfXiLtzyWtLlxh8G8h9iS2qdf+AFAGuOhxi98etWeK\nbmIcqn+KEBJSz/zXhmlnXBKJGYipZpmAK/BPHrACzTpxyJS4Kq4e6KysDDCP+Isx\nvVldcyCNAqS+l7gRsUpy1WjcEyeaTaiVeKqGEOeMLAIUHy5PXZapBrELkaU6HmGN\nxwKxWh+MAV4gcKGDXEWV\n=hqqs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T13:29:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur