:{"date":"2026-09-26T11:35:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(scorecard): trigger on pushes to develop, the default branch (#40)\n\nscorecard-action refuses to run on a push to anything but the\nrepository''s configured default branch (\"Only the default branch develop\nis supported\"), and every repo in this fleet keeps develop as its default\n(GitFlow). With `push: branches: [main]` the workflow fails on every\ndevelop->main release; the schedule and workflow_dispatch triggers were\nunaffected, which is why the problem only surfaced on release pushes.\n\nSame fix labor-performance, facility-layout, fulfillment-execution,\nprocess-path-management and warehouse-ops-agent already carry.","tree":{"sha":"4fd0f75a48964e7a37d333f054773e9ffc0c013e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/trees/4fd0f75a48964e7a37d333f054773e9ffc0c013e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/commits/9f4d13d1ad934653042b4064eb5f9731173950d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 4fd0f75a48964e7a37d333f054773e9ffc0c013e\nparent ec002e1e48ea97488821839bd03f80010413edc6\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790422549 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790422549 -0300\n\nci(scorecard): trigger on pushes to develop, the default branch (#40)\n\nscorecard-action refuses to run on a push to anything but the\nrepository''s configured default branch (\"Only the default branch develop\nis supported\"), and every repo in this fleet keeps develop as its default\n(GitFlow). With `push: branches: [main]` the workflow fails on every\ndevelop->main release; the schedule and workflow_dispatch triggers were\nunaffected, which is why the problem only surfaced on release pushes.\n\nSame fix labor-performance, facility-layout, fulfillment-execution,\nprocess-path-management and warehouse-ops-agent already carry.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt64VCRC1aQ7