owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/commits/8866abaecac6e17d11ae12d6c5078f132f338904/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T11:24:26Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T11:24:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(rules): add mfe-remotes.md — pitfalls on the remote-hosting side of the contract (#29)\n\nThis repo already has a solid CLAUDE.md but no .claude/rules/ (unlike\nevery backend repo). Adds the console-side pitfalls not yet documented\nin-repo: the vite.config.ts callback-form trap that breaks a remote''s\ntest suite, why a small relative remoteEntry.js is correct not broken,\nthe chart selector-collision issue (fixed fleet-wide, now CI-checked in\nwarehouse-infra) and how to confirm which pod actually answered a probe,\nand the two-independent-gateways localhost edge topology.\n\nPart of the harness-engineering coverage expansion plan\n(.hermes/plans/2026-09-13_234500-harness-coverage-expansion.md), Phase 4\nTask 4.4.","tree":{"sha":"99ba614bb201fe12302dc65bb7e144b66f621219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/trees/99ba614bb201fe12302dc65bb