ithub.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/commits/3355e2b2d010b553ffe365dbdae9dcce74bb97a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:41:41Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:41:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update Contexts docs to reflect all 8 bounded-context remotes (#23)\n\nThe Contexts launchpad (ContextsScreen.tsx), vite.config.ts, and App.tsx\nrouting already wired all 8 bounded-context remotes (order-management,\ninventory-storage, wes-work-planning, fulfillment-execution,\nworkforce-management, facility-layout, process-path-management,\nlabor-performance) -- process-path-mfe and labor-mfe were added to the\ncode but the surrounding docs/comments were never updated off the\noriginal \"six remotes\" count.\n\nDiscovery: cross-checked every backend repo''s origin/develop for a\nweb/vite.config.ts (all 8 have one), then diffed that against\nwarehouse-console''s vite.config.ts federation.remotes map, App.tsx''s\nlazy() imports + routes, and ContextsScreen.tsx''s launch tiles -- all\nalready list all 8. The gap was purely in prose: README, CLAUDE.md, and\nthe Docusaurus docs site (getting-started, module-federation,\ncontext-map, overview/index, docs/src/pages/index.tsx) plus two stale\nApp.tsx comments still said \"six remotes\" / listed only 6 in the port\ntable and diagrams.\n\nFixes:\n- README.md + CLAUDE.md: route lists, port table (add labor-mfe :5187,\n  process-path-mfe :5189), remote/service counts in verify:routes note.\n- docs/docs/overview/getting-started.md: port table.\n- docs/docs/architecture/module-federation.md: remote count + mermaid\n  diagram (add Labor, ProcessPath nodes).\n- docs/docs/ecosystem/context-map.md: remote count + mermaid diagram\n  (add PP/LP nodes with correct DDD classification -- Generic for\n  process-path-management, Supporting for labor-performance).\n- docs/docs/overview/index.md + docs/src/pages/index.tsx: remote route\n  list and count.\n- src/App.tsx: two stale doc comments (\"six\" -> \"eight\").\n\nADR-0001 (docs/docs/adr/0001-*.md) is left untouched -- it is a point-in-time\ndecision record describing the state at the time the ADR was written, not\nliving documentation.\n\nVerified: npm run lint, npm run typecheck, npm run build, npm test (5\nfiles / 42 tests) all green in warehouse-console; docs/ npm run build\n(Docusaurus) green.","tree":{"sha":"f3549ab58aa0e63fe4f7dc1a12ddb3d30cbaa248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/trees/f3549ab58aa0e63fe4f7dc1a12ddb3d30cbaa248"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/commits/3355e2b2d010b553ffe365dbdae9dcce74bb97a1","verification":{"payload":"tree f3549ab58aa0e63fe4f7dc1a12ddb3d30cbaa248\nparent 87b2bef6cca876c2c9153ce042d51b6066592618\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789310501 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789310501 -0300\n\nUpdate Contexts docs to reflect all 8 bounded-context remotes (#23)\n\nThe Contexts launchpad (ContextsScreen.tsx), vite.config.ts, and App.tsx\nrouting already wired all 8 bounded-context remotes (order-management,\ninventory-storage, wes-work-planning, fulfillment-execution,\nworkforce-management, facility-layout, process-path-management,\nlabor-performance) -- process-path-mfe and labor-mfe were added to the\ncode but the surrounding docs/comments were never updated off the\noriginal \"six remotes\" count.\n\nDiscovery: cross-checked every backend repo''s origin/develop for a\nweb/vite.config.ts (all 8 have one), then diffed that against\nwarehouse-console''s vite.config.ts federation.remotes map, App.tsx''s\nlazy() imports + routes, and ContextsScreen.tsx''s launch tiles -- all\nalready list all 8. The gap was purely in prose: README, CLAUDE.md, and\nthe Docusaurus docs site (getting-started, module-federation,\ncontext-map, overview/index, docs/src/pages/index.tsx) plus two stale\nApp.tsx comments still said \"six remotes\" / listed only 6 in the port\ntable and diagrams.\n\nFixes:\n- README.md + CLAUDE.md: route lists, port table (add labor-mfe :5187,\n  process-path-mfe :5189), remote/service counts in verify:routes note.\n- docs/docs/overview/getting-started.md: port table.\n- docs/docs/architecture/module-federation.md: remote count + mermaid\n  diagram (add Labor, ProcessPath nodes).\n- docs/docs/ecosystem/context-map.md: remote count + mermaid diagram\n  (add PP/LP nodes with correct DDD classification -- Generic for\n  process-path-management, Supporting for labor-performance).\n- docs/docs/overview/index.md + docs/src/pages/index.tsx: remote route\n  list and count.\n- src/App.tsx: two stale doc comments (\"six\" -> \"eight\").\n\nADR-0001 (docs/docs/adr/0001-*.md) is left untouched -- it is a point-in-time\ndecision record describing the state at the time the ADR was written, not\nliving documentation.\n\nVerified: npm run lint, npm run typecheck, npm run build, npm test (5\nfiles / 42 tests) all green in warehouse-console; docs/ npm run build\n(Docusaurus) green.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqprYlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4l8QAGwpqk7QD8FQEKtRXUbd6fkv\n3QrkvAV28JlKf0SaOBBEUAAq9i+7GkYbv/a5bOo0OfuGCY7msGe6bfHyjgxqtJ+D\nLB/+yt15a+qPa8kOOD9qryDYym4frBuoGX9tViQUbiQolgNFl7qKbjt9pFv8D+L7\njCXbLKMDe5aK7+f7iCsElERd6i6r4EsZTNDLp