ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/commits/3493942f1ce9100fec17e0056b93b441a7be6f51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:48:23Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:48:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(labor): wire labor-mfe as a new remote (#11)\n\nWires labor-mfe (labor-performance''s operator SPA, added in\nlabor-performance#16) into the shell as a lazy-loaded Module\nFederation remote at /labor/*, following the exact pattern\nprocess-path-mfe established (#10).\n\n- vite.config.ts: new federation.remotes entry, labor_mfe at\n  http://localhost:5187/remoteEntry.js -- port 5187 is the one\n  labor-performance''s own chart/README already reserve.\n- App.tsx: /labor added to REMOTE_PREFIXES (so \"Contexts\" still lights\n  up while the remote is open), module-scope lazy() import, and the\n  /labor/* route wrapped in RemoteBoundary.\n- ContextsScreen.tsx: new LaunchTile for Labor Performance.\n- scripts/verify-all-routes.cjs: /labor added 