ps) and a NotFoundScreen for\nunmatched routes, so an unknown URL explains itself instead of rendering\nempty chrome.\n\nAlso brings README.md, CLAUDE.md, and the Docusaurus overview page back in\nsync with the actual nav/screens after the Floor/Contexts split, and fixes\nthe 404 screen''s now-stale \"Back to the overview\" link.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FogYxqLgj896STU3QD8qKU","tree":{"sha":"c5615fa36ae9ccb2abb75e64d12789c18d511418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/trees/c5615fa36ae9ccb2abb75e64d12789c18d511418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-console/git/commits/c8dd30f0849e19ae9b5eb8265fe08c38117a2ffe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/warehouse-console/commit/c8dd30f0849e19ae9b5eb8265fe08c38117a2ffe","node_id":"C_kwDOUID9KNoAKGM4ZGQzMGYwODQ5ZTE5YWU5YjVlYjgyNjVmZTA4YzM4MTE3YTJmZmU","paren