sistent analytical projections, not live reads,\nso each card renders its freshnessLagSeconds through the ui-kit''s\nFreshnessBadge. Staleness is shown, never hidden.\n\nTwo failure modes kept deliberately distinct: a section arriving with\navailable:false is a routine, expected degradation of one upstream and\nrenders as one \"data unavailable\" card (the \"—\" convention Overview''s\nKPI tiles already use) while every other section still draws its real\nnumbers; only a whole-request failure produces a dashboard-level error\nstate. No number is ever fabricated to keep a card looking healthy.\n\nAlso adds scripts/verify-dashboards.cjs (npm run verify:dashboards),\nwhich stubs the report calls so all three states can be verified in a\nreal headless browser without a live warehouse-ops-agent.\n\nDepends on two upstream PRs before this is live end to end:\n  - warehouse-ui-kit#1 (feature/chart-primitives) -- BarChart, LineChart\n    and FunnelChart. Until it merges into ui-kit''s develop, this repo''s\n    CI typecheck/build jobs will fail, since they check the ui-kit out\n    at develop. No change is needed here once it merges: package.json\n    already points at file:../warehouse-ui-kit.\n  - warehouse-ops-agent (feature/console-reports-bff) -- the two report\n    endpoints themselves, which are not implemented yet.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqm+z+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAW/MQAGtujmU6+Xppy14v+yZ/TgfM\nW0ZndFvXMD3udl3hIsRhd8R+cD+RZtbjROAkga18LX3A5gcLl40D3MatgKel5rr4\nhtCNXnsLp9Rl9s0ou9Ruv0+6wMA6fzBWo6oXCF9PqZEp5cUUb4W3qx+XwfhyAiGe\nu/Vfqb/S/ogdiVNgawMWlu+aTtvD+vqWJgJCKYfwHgt3UzmKyuAjBKsSB1y27ELW\nRHs+Z1tlO4/y2idBy8Gq57ENHGaF48CGFxRhQaPNhMZST/iSd6cWLI6MSPO6VC5M\nfSsRl/tEQDu7a/jQsBHy4TwdIW9tEbfr1C+pf1ODAqiiXnO3beMa8lTjcmeAx5a7\nLpnKGc6QuRmOE4QQgKV/UzmzZWAK+j2BfewWEctJu0T/U/IJSdQkuhlybVliVFbx\n75SjUKnBha7tt4A/TqdG0BYHRmrEhoI0JKQjHRed8QLGeMxHJTExvtGMAVwXPXab\nT3DESQwcqaH9G4TQMK/jAZpl41ERy2kcAzqSG/j27XGR6Y3thROR6oU+jPUU9f7a\nkQ2qT