claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/dd26355a4f088481dddae488c39c910667dd3733/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:44:38Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:44:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: move JSON wire shape out of domain events (tier-2 1a) (#122)\n\n* test(events): pin log publisher JSON payload with goldens captured pre-refactor\n\nTier-2 item 1a, step 1: goldens pass against the current (domain-tagged) output.\n\n* refactor(events): move log JSON wire shape from domain events to adapter DTOs\n\nTier-2 item 1a. The log publisher owns explicit DTOs + mapping; shared.base loses its json tags. Output is byte-identical (goldens from previous commit unchanged). Kafka analytics/integration payloads were already adapter-built maps with golden tests; nothing there changes.\n\n* test(architecture): sensor forbidding json/db struct tags under internal/domain\n\nTier-2 item 1a: TestNoStructTagsInDomain + bad/good fixture test. No exceptions needed.","tree":{"sha":"af10160fc4d94f58a683eee7ad70bff9d0a173d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/af10160fc4d94f58a683eee7ad70bff9d0a173d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/dd26355a4f088481dddae488c39c910667dd3733","verification":{"payload":"