:"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/c098639ea22c5d48e49da1657352932af05a1cb6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/b4710a6c03d6feb672b3bf4b006be874eedc0636/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:01:20Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:01:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: refresh product docs and add ddd-crew DDD artifact pack (#119)\n\n* docs: refresh README, rules and site pages against develop\n\nPart A of the docs refresh, grounded in the code on origin/develop:\n\n- README: IQVO Pages/ghcr URLs; /readyz on the OLTP API; missing env vars\n  (MIGRATIONS_DATABASE_URL, HOUSEKEEPING_INTERVAL, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_TTL,\n  OUTBOX_RETENTION) and per-binary OTEL_SERVICE_NAME defaults; no /metrics\n  (OTLP push); missing Make targets (contract, check-fast, guide-lint,\n  harness-test) and CI jobs (guide-lint, complexity, contract,\n  evals-tests); ADR list 0016-0030; architecture tree (pgtx, bootretry,\n  sweeper, idempotency/readiness); two code-verified known gaps.\n- .claude/rules: ADR index 0022-0030 + 0009 status; /readyz; IQVO gh api\n  path; DDD pack pages added to the AsyncAPI narrative list.\n- overview: \"What runs today\" (binaries, ports, surfaces) + DDD pack link.\n- subdomain-classification: glossary moved to the new ubiquitous-language\n  page; links to domain events and core domain chart.\n- governance charter: IQVO link; MCP-server list from the fleet tool\n  snapshot instead of the stale \"five contexts\".\n- how-to-add-a-frontend-remote skill: IQVO org.\n\n* docs(ddd): add pack index, core domain chart; refresh context map\n\n- ddd/ddd-artifacts.md: index of the ddd-crew artifact pack with sources of truth\n- ddd/core-domain-chart.md: Supporting quadrant, evidence from aggregates/invariants/ADRs, evolution note\n- ecosystem/context-map.md: U/D + pattern + technology on every edge, relationship\n  table with evidence, live vs wired-but-unused vs deliberately-absent; ops agent\n  uses all four MCP tools (not two); console reads the reports API; no HTML entities\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(ddd): add bounded context canvas, aggregate design canvas, message flow, eventstorming\n\nAll derived from internal/domain, usecases, adapters and the collaborators develop branches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(ddd): add glossary, class, ER, sequence diagrams and domain events; wire sidebar\n\n- ubiquitous-language.md: every term mapped to its code identifier, differing names flagged\n- class-diagram.md: domain model, ports/read models, use cases, hexagonal view\n- entity-relationship.md: OLTP and analytics schemas (no FKs exist), table vs aggregate map\n- sequence-diagrams.md: DefineStandard, RecordTaskPerformance, outbox relay, queries, utilization, projector\n- domain-events.md: full CE types, topics, keys, dataschemas, payloads, consumers\n- sidebars.ts: DDD artifacts (ddd-crew) category\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(claude): docs site moved to iqvo.github.io, link the DDD artifact pack\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf9f154b1493573cd55e3f7f9b941574ba94baa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/bf9f154b1493573cd55e3f7f9b941574ba94baa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/b4710a6c03d6feb672b3bf4b006be874eedc0636","verification":{"payload":"tree bf9f154b1493573cd55e3f7f9b941574ba94baa1\nparent 37d51f082f5f6e216578b43cbcd9b6e8fa21c9ab\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791270080 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791270080 -0300\n\ndocs: refresh product docs and add ddd-crew DDD artifact pack (#119)\n\n* docs: refresh README, rules and site pages against develop\n\nPart A of the docs refresh, grounded in the code on origin/develop:\n\n- README: IQVO Pages/ghcr URLs; /readyz on the OLTP API; missing env vars\n  (MIGRATIONS_DATABASE_URL, HOUSEKEEPING_INTERVAL, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_TTL,\n  OUTBOX_RETENTION) and per-binary OTEL_SERVICE_NAME defaults; no /metrics\n  (OTLP push); missing Make targets (contract, check-fast, guide-lint,\n  harness-test) and CI jobs (guide-lint, complexity, contract,\n  evals-tests); ADR list 0016-0030; architecture tree (pgtx, bootretry,\n  sweeper, idempotency/readiness); two code-verified known gaps.\n- .claude/rules: ADR index 0022-0030 + 0009 status; /readyz; IQVO gh api\n  path; DDD pack pages added to the AsyncAPI narrative list.\n- overview: \"What runs today\" (binaries, ports, surfaces) + DDD pack link.\n- subdomain-classification: glossary moved to the new ubiquitous-language\n  page; links to domain events and core domain chart.\n- governance charter: IQVO link; MCP-server list from the fleet tool\n  snapshot instead of the stale \"five contexts\".\n- how-to-add-a-frontend-remote skill: IQVO org.\n\n* docs(ddd): add pack index, core domain chart; refresh context map\n\n- ddd/ddd-artifacts.md: index of the ddd-crew artifact pack with sources of truth\n- ddd/core-domain-chart.md: Supporting quadrant, evidence from aggregates/invariants/ADRs, evolution note\n- ecosystem/context-map.md: U/D + pattern + technology on every edge, relationship\n  table with evidence, live vs wired-but-unused vs deliberately-absent; ops agent\n  uses all four MCP tools (not two); console reads the reports API; no HTML entities\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(ddd): add bounded context canvas, aggregate design canvas, message flow, eventstorming\n\nAll derived from internal/domain, usecases, adapters and the collaborators develop branches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(ddd): add glossary, class, ER, sequence diagrams and domain events; wire sidebar\n\n- ubiquitous-language.md: every term mapped to its code identifier, differing names flagged\n- class-diagram.md: domain model, ports/read models, use cases, hexagonal view\n- entity-relationship.md: OLTP and analytics schemas (no FKs exist), table vs aggregate map\n- sequence-diagrams.md: DefineStandard, RecordTaskPerformance, outbox relay, queries, utilization, projector\n- domain-events.md: full CE types, topics, keys, dataschemas, payloads, consumers\n- sidebars.ts: DDD artifacts (ddd-crew) category\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(claude): docs site moved to iqvo.github.io, link the DDD artifact pack\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxJzACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATBEQAEeVWQWEBqDnLcQ6+EVd/aIW\nCSSab3pqCPOYp+CqZxbruXeTQqio3KLoqqhRqVdNDH2h2TXw4STv6bkPgsticiMe\njWnuNYhJo84HyLiCrlv8GbFC0+0xIejwkG+Zn7EfGZk+DEJLM3kYLFNVNVMRLRcK\nD35cmWMLGgLc8/YDxC/vVD2Y+qFnzSOiR/xgL