b\n\nNo integration test reads DATABASE_URL; every one boots its own testcontainers Postgres/Kafka. Job name unchanged (required status check).","tree":{"sha":"2d9a11b92eddd23cbe4acb3455d159258497c26e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/2d9a11b92eddd23cbe4acb3455d159258497c26e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/37d51f082f5f6e216578b43cbcd9b6e8fa21c9ab","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d9a11b92eddd23cbe4acb3455d159258497c26e\nparent a3a9b4fd23a11216fe90fd46e0d9960cd8a1d66e\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791253862 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791253862 -0300\n\ntest(architecture): Postgres-testcontainers fitness sensor (tier-1) (#117)\n\n* test(architecture): add Postgres-testcontainers fitness sensor\n\nTestPostgresIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers fails on DATABASE_URL/ANALYTICS_DATABASE_URL gates or DB-env t.Skip in *_integration_test.go and requires a testcontainers postgres import in the package; fixture test proves it fails on bad input. Mirrors wes-work-planning#141.\n\n* ci: drop unused Postgres service container + DATABASE_URL from integration job\n\nNo integration test reads DATABASE_URL; every one boots its own testcontainers Postgres/Kafka. Job name unchanged (required status check).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxF1mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATAwQAHPAgnan02LL9MEA4ynnU2c8\nkbIO7xTb/L4mOz4nAkt3D17Cgq96q/evqY1tlzKSbiCIZb/KblWS8/uznEPDp2yC\neHAmzVxRoLPQ8GoxsASWGcItWDSdzMkWrfMLe/r1iRHzU5qZjWENwZaM6cMRr31V\nRx74GMDNgdG1JaA09F+3rT7n6tpwIBGzD+5tLWc5leAix0dO8vYLmgA+w2/JjuKo\nWuHC5IKqA5FnUktlJ4YPyGdLlJEeQbnIUGFaRbQDFSuaQ7/IT0jkUS91mNTT7Qfh\nGNv5Qil2Zw2TX5VjrxUjp64MCMnLduuz1i8bDrJgeHJcY7HxqG6NR6yLJdpmqd5v\nlmwoz2Q8z9cCksKNqM4lWJgBdX8Gcn5f5VVfT16Jq3EZl4+3/HCvO3nAoHqKkIum\nf61FIKM2grTXgVORXRf9gjthpQeGEV/1EMW9e5jDbG2YXfITE0sDSlJoCzil/jEv\nMkZNEpVJSiA5nVdTYFalZVNxn2nl/MeoVgSo4roseNmjztyyzw5hSgxzHqGnKMEb\nrSG