audioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/592f3b3df88d38d3d3b9fab630b00ccb6a151ca8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:40:21Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:40:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(complexity): enforce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations (#88)\n\nEnable the five complexity linters in .golangci.yml (gocyclo 15, gocognit 20,\ncyclop 15 / package-average 10, funlen 80 lines/50 statements, nestif 5;\n_test.go exempt from funlen/gocyclo, web/ exempt from all five) and add a\ndedicated `complexity` CI job (golangci-lint --enable-only + gocyclo report\nin the step summary, gated into docker-publish). Refactor every\npre-existing violation with zero behavior change: table-driven problem\ncatalogs, split wiring/relay/policy functions, named test helpers instead\nof t.Run closures. golangci-lint, go build/vet, go test ./... all green.","tree":{"sha":"811f513a2608e7ab22079a1db5a7263866c02dac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/811f513a2608e7ab22079a1db5a7263866c02dac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/592f3b3df88d38d3d3b9fab630b00ccb6a151ca8","verification":{"payload":"tree 811f513a2608e7ab22079a1db5a7263866c02dac\nparent 726f8d829300d0a7c1303d52305956eafa5f6a60\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790559621 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.co