mmitter":{"date":"2026-09-26T13:29:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(docker-publish): publish images to GHCR instead of Docker Hub (#74)\n\nSwitch docker-publish and release jobs from Docker Hub to GHCR:\n- Replace the Docker Hub login step (DOCKERHUB_USERNAME/DOCKERHUB_TOKEN)\n  with a GHCR login using the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN (no new secret needed).\n- Add `packages: write` to docker-publish''s job permissions (required to\n  push to GHCR).\n- Prefix every image reference (build tags, cosign sign/attest, SBOM\n  attestation, imagetools re-tag on release, release notes) with\n  `ghcr.io/`.\n- Update the couple of docs/README lines that named Docker Hub as the\n  registry.\n\nSame trigger, same versioning scheme (SHORT_SHA + :latest on main,\nsemver tag on release) -- registry only.","tree":{"sha":"25ed07d80843556617b4fa5b8d38f0b5a9a2ebd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/25ed07d80843556617b4fa5b8d38f0b5a9a2ebd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/e863774d43b5ce11bbec0029caa0a8f2d25e3b58","verification":{"payload":"tree 25ed07d80843556617b4fa5b8d38f0b5a9a2ebd5\nparent 947638981544ebd8fd32af7e7a98da05bd0028e6\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790429348 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790429348 -0300\n\nci(docker-publish): publish images to GHCR instead of Docker Hub (#74)\n\nSwitch docker-publish and release jobs from Docker Hub to GHCR:\n- Replace the Docker Hub login step (DOCKERHUB_USERNAME/DOCKERHUB_TOKEN)\n  with a GHCR login using the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN (no new secret needed).\n- Add `packages: write` to docker-publish''s job permissions (required to\n  push to GHCR).\n- Prefix every image reference (build tags, cosign sign/attest, SBOM\n  attestation, imagetools re-tag on release, release notes) with\n  `ghcr.io/`.\n- Update the couple of docs/README lines that named Docker Hub as the\n  registry.\n\nSame t