received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/947638981544ebd8fd32af7e7a98da05bd0028e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T02:15:36Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T02:15:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: refresh project documentation against develop (#72)\n\n* docs: refresh project documentation against develop\n\nBring README, the Docusaurus pages and the .claude rules in line with\nwhat origin/develop actually ships:\n\n- four binaries (cmd/mcp was missing), the idleness domain package,\n  GetUtilization and the two /utilization endpoints (6 OLTP endpoints)\n- the integration topic warehouse.labor-performance.events (ADR 0013)\n  and its real consumer, workforce-management; drop \"not consumed by\n  anyone\" / \"log publisher only\" / \"no MCP adapter\" claims\n- task_type is on the TaskCompleted wire since fulfillment-execution\n  ADR-0023; drop the stale \"known wire-contract gap\"\n- labor_mfe remote exists; drop \"deferred / not yet built\"\n- no outbound REST/MCP call to any sibling; context map now shows the\n  inbound readers (console remote, warehouse-ops-agent) instead\n- MCP governance charter: auth section reflects ADR 0012 removal; the\n  Phase-6 gate is the existing governance_test.go; page added to sidebar\n- ADR indexes list 0001-0015; env var tables cover every binary\n- Kafka smoke test no longer points at the retired docker-compose broker\n\n* docs(agents): refresh CLAUDE.md against develop\n\nBrings the agent entry point in line with the refreshed docs in this PR:\ncurrent binaries, ports/adapters, endpoint/event/ADR counts, env vars and\nCI jobs, verified against origin/develop code. AGENTS.md remains\nbyte-identical (symlink).","tree":{"sha":"4f493b6661b80188315a4621b1bdbe3d3b09e975","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/4f493b6661b80188315a4621b1bdbe3d3b09e975"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/947638981544ebd8fd32af7e7a98da05bd0028e6","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f493b6661b80188315a4621b1bdbe3d3b09e975\nparent 4f15f84c573609760b5a455a27ec1d2e8439ac76\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790388936 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790388936 -0300\n\ndocs: refresh project documentation against develop (#72)\n\n* docs: refresh project documentation against develop\n\nBring README, the Docusaurus pages and the .claude rules in line with\nwhat origin/develop actually ships:\n\n- four binaries (cmd/mcp was missing), the idleness domain package,\n  GetUtilization and the two /utilization endpoints (6 OLTP endpoints)\n- the integration topic warehouse.labor-performance.events (ADR 0013)\n  and its real consumer, workforce-management; drop \"not consumed by\n  anyone\" / \"log publisher only\" / \"no MCP adapter\" claims\n- task_type is on the TaskCompleted wire since fulfillment-execution\n  ADR-0023; drop the stale \"known wire-contract gap\"\n- labor_mfe remote exists; drop \"deferred / not yet built\"\n- no outbound REST/MCP call to any sibling; context map now shows the\n  inbound readers (console remote, warehouse-ops-agent) instead\n- MCP governance charter: auth section reflects ADR 0012 removal; the\n  Phase-6 gate is the existing governance_test.go; page added to sidebar\n- ADR indexes list 0001-0015; env var tables cover every binary\n- Kafka smoke test no longer points at the retired docker-compose broker\n\n* docs(agents): refresh CLAUDE.md against develop\n\nBrings the agent entry point in line with the refreshed docs in this PR:\ncurrent binaries, ports/adapters, endpoint/event/ADR counts, env vars and\nCI jobs, verified against origin/develop code. AGENTS.md remains\nbyte-identical (symlink).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtyrICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz5EQAH1OGdr97+An8aGS3+dq0Blg\n/lO9cHHdpYvIhglDGzBYgcCTCoWeork4scBSrCdbgbyOpnmPTJmvzl8Gvi2EsSyf\nu0oLluQNXjhv20wKlaC8sH44/d9f1lsTyGc7S8z1CblBobZsThvb+d4UKt0uvQzl\npj6x0vMb5uFDB/BweQBmczLEUgBTDjQrkHnShWcyvIV4pz0qI/ABefIdJNhPODT8\ndh4umjrH1YytdnZkwIHFWQg0EoF++53Vjx+V2ksUfFN1JyOw7PCcKRq1M3sfhqbS\nT3EiA4D06ikHVgNas5/kr/VnGXzRUMRmx9FxL1+ewh80WUOFJu8l4ozvUb+yw8kj\na0Ia40HviIXl4GIcnCvhLtSTnkD3sEETSaPO9ka70qALZv45xmOQCFnzy39brNnu\nu8V5jYvTNBkRwLr3aUavBYXUgmTgbKq1TTPsVoJCOhZyQikdclCH8CBzwJ2+o8jY\n8/+pzwkegYZ1EOcf/UuABYfEwQ45Uwtu3QhTi3ZwIxjpTZyNReI3I19UfINm1LK/\n2MMTOD+d1lZAQ+QeyFbEbduRzEdmanpg9Pgrl8bVxhZEbX4y7dlwqY19L2FlcowH\n9lSiS3w1UgV0na9/5ei91fB19oxIL7JeWGA81yp+iwvu6BGRlJDTkzY4TfP8yJ+f\nk439qEJTDbsetGpmqF7B\n=dvYb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T02:15:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.