tion), which then fails\nbefore Trivy ever runs (no image to scan).\n\nBumps the pin to the currently available 20260909-r0 build.","tree":{"sha":"23d5b95b969d32a5891c5e391fef080ba717c696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/23d5b95b969d32a5891c5e391fef080ba717c696"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/041b2735752b51a7b6aaabe0f0f1f99c69a321d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 23d5b95b969d32a5891c5e391fef080ba717c696\nparent 7cd3e52223caeced5084d53be006d87e9d408cd3\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790299049 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790299049 -0300\n\nfix(docker): bump ca-certificates to 20260909-r0 (trivy-scan pull fix) (#66)\n\nAlpine 3.24''s ca-certificates package has moved past the pinned\n20260611-r0 build (now 20260909-r0 in the branch''s apk index), so\napk add --no-cache ca-certificates=20260611-r0 fails outright with\n''unable to select packages''. This breaks the Docker image build step\nin the trivy-scan CI job (docker/build-push-action), which then fails\nbefore Trivy ever runs (no image to scan).\n\nBumps the pin to the currently available 20260909-r0 build.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtcupCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApggQAJog0ZQymmzIhfVSpGUZ4lrK\nL6wmKJhSRVhrtL/NfbZFkvn//GIvBg63m6Q1TF7w2HJbHSqVEu6f35oi1QPrXXpY\n+7Kp7nzkLwoQfdiQFHIGL+5aLeuDo5El0BLxg33nIUDEEYe866Hpz10Mf6roUSWz\nXWF6F/JMIbcGOcoSkrokx3VQkEUqmkUqF4H3BBTstMMs1lWMN4SmZiBomXzo6b9d\ncSnQCOytB3b+jZdXCbG4R6RA1AEZDM5Sw8AcC5QY1eAz4Db/KTEHxmU9Y6I134wY\ngS1nD9e8fkLiyPTC88EVHmfMduAyvj2rZxqRLepxPcKoJy0+dhy7fxb2TX8kLcrM\nKnxuWdozJYMPL3oj4ZjcSSaxOE/H8Nl/9A6AjH8+pJ0dxnnqNidjrFZkwtq1iaia\nhK/M5k9Sxk4AZI6E3WzGQdQV0c2xxesrPqz6IONk+5nlRclxp9upEgtN51FdrQ9n\nv2zHMyJRFYwhNQ3AdzMeCbrO90AFwJhUa9Mx6G4uvruWy9YZE3kveY1tT+iEzGFe\n2jOV73bw5+K82oiwtsUwQn8Twhi7Hj1ArvXDJD6eSxFeLKfjTbtdc1yXDuzi7++U\nCEMCri6HAGQ38R1EEaSd64t0zlxKyRSygQwLgn29XPFjAGz4vxsN51EaHmGRZ4zM\n