x9, @faker-js/faker GHSA-qxc2-j82w-r537, image-size\nGHSA-w3rx-r6r6-pgpr + GHSA-5p2g-fcmc-qvqq. 5 remaining Scorecard\nfindings (CIIBestPracticesID, MaintainedID, CodeReviewID, FuzzingID,\nVulnerabilitiesID) are process signals, not code-fixable.","tree":{"sha":"6d5e80bd7f57df01a77a61167ea80b75c0417999","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/6d5e80bd7f57df01a77a61167ea80b75c0417999"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/7cd3e52223caeced5084d53be006d87e9d408cd3","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d5e80bd7f57df01a77a61167ea80b75c0417999\nparent 73330e4faaec854a40b1002a67869baf4cb25427\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789475381 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789475381 -0300\n\nfix(security): pin GitHub Actions/Docker digests, patch lodash-es (#56)\n\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: replace unpinned `npm install -g\n  spectral-cli` (Scorecard PinnedDependenciesID #70) with `npm ci`\n  against a new pinned apis/tooling/package-lock.json.\n- web/Dockerfile: pin all 3 FROM base images to immutable @sha256:\n  digests (node:22-bookworm-slim x2, nginx-unprivileged:1.31-alpine)\n  and switch npm install --no-save -> npm install --package-lock-only\n  && npm ci in both build stages (Scorecard PinnedDependenciesID\n  #76-#80).\n- docs/package.json: add lodash-es ^4.18.0 to the existing scoped\n  overrides block, resolves to 4.18.1, closes Dependabot\n  GHSA-r5fr-rjxr-66jc (high) + GHSA-f23m-r3pf-42rh (medium).\n\nVerified: actionlint clean, docker build of web/Dockerfile succeeds\nwith pinned digests, docs/ npm ci + npm run build succeeds, make\ncheck (fmt/vet/build/lint/test) clean.\n\nBlocked (documented in PR body, no safe fix exists): adm-zip\nGHSA-vwc7-r8mq-g2x9, @faker-js/faker GHSA-qxc2-j82w-r537, image-size\nGHSA-w3rx-r6r6-pgpr + GHSA-5p2g-fcmc-qvqq. 5 remaining Scorecard\nfindings (CIIBestPracticesID, MaintainedID, CodeReviewID, FuzzingID,\nVulnerabilitiesID) are