"C_kwDOUIGXYtoAKDdjZDNlNTIyMjNjYWVjZWQ1MDg0ZDUzYmUwMDZkODdlOWQ0MDhjZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/labor-performance/commit/73330e4faaec854a40b1002a67869baf4cb25427","sha":"73330e4faaec854a40b1002a67869baf4cb25427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/73330e4faaec854a40b1002a67869baf4cb25427"}],"sha":"7cd3e52223caeced5084d53be006d87e9d408cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/7cd3e52223caeced5084d53be006d87e9d408cd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/73330e4faaec854a40b1002a67869baf4cb25427/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:35:40Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:35:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ci): add weekly continuous-drift CI sensor (#55)\n\nAdds the `drift` job to `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, adapted from\ninventory-storage''s already-merged reference (PR #77, verified green via a\nreal `workflow_dispatch` run). Advisory-only, gated\n`if: github.event_name == ''workflow_dispatch'' || github.event_name ==\n''schedule''`, so it never runs on a normal push/PR and never blocks a merge.\n\nSensors, all writing to $GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY and never failing the job:\n- go tool deadcode (dead code, -test flag so test-only helpers don''t\n  false-positive)\n- go mod tidy -diff (stale/unused go.mod entries)\n- knip (unused frontend exports/files/deps) against web/\n- scripts/coverage-quality.py (new, copied from inventory-storage) —\n  cross-references go tool cover -func against gremlins'' LIVED-mutant\n  report to flag high-coverage functions that still have a surviving\n  mutant (tests execute the line but assert nothing)\n\nAdapted (not copied verbatim) for labor-performance''s two-checkout shape:\nthis repo''s web/ MFE depends on warehouse-ui-kit via a local file:\ndependency (see the existing `web` CI job), so the drift job checks out\nboth labor-performance and warehouse-ui-kit@develop and builds the ui-kit\nbefore `npm ci` in web/ — otherwise `npx knip` would fail resolving\n@warehouse/ui-kit. inventory-storage''s reference job has no such\ndependency and needed no extra checkout.","tree":{"sha":"8aab65e592511fc81296f3cb4c9a2736f51f5761","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/8aab65e592511fc81296f3cb4c9a2736f51f5761"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/73330e4faaec854a40b1002a67869baf4cb25427","verification":{"payload":"tree 8aab65e592511fc81296f3cb4c9a2736f51f5761\nparent 3269f01b8353237450fe6f7e6674b7ad0fe03d45\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789436140 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789436140 -0300\n\nfeat(ci): add weekly continuous-drift CI sensor (#55)\n\nAdds the `drift` job to `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, adapted from\ninventory-storage''s already-merged reference (PR #77, verified green via a\nreal `workflow_dispatch` run). Advisory-only, gated\n`if: github.event_name == ''workflow_dispatch'' || github.event_name ==\n''schedule''`, so it never runs on a normal push/PR and never blocks a merge.\n\nSensors, all writing to $GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY and never failing the job:\n- go tool deadcode (dead code, -test flag so test-only helpers don''t\n  false-positive)\n- go mod tidy -diff (stale/unused go.mod entries)\n- knip (unused frontend exports/files/deps) against web/\n- scripts/coverage-quality.py (new, copied from inventory-storage) —\n  cross-references go tool cover -func against gremlins'' LIVED-mutant\n  report to flag high-coverage functions that still have a surviving\n  mutant (tests execute the line but assert nothing)\n\nAdapted (not copied verbatim) for labor-performance''s two-checkout shape:\nthis repo''s web/ MFE depends on warehouse-ui-kit via a local file:\ndependency (see the existing `web` CI job), so the drift job checks out\nboth labor-performance and warehouse-ui-kit@develop and builds the ui-kit\nbefore `npm ci` in web/ — otherwise `npx knip` would fail resolving\n@warehouse/ui-kit. inventory-storage''s reference job has no such\ndependency and needed no extra checkout.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqKDsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAU/4QAFdMG3A2zqket76yZUeJI7TR\n2GGDWdqaX6uOwCpjuG3NMhQSOVa/ElFj71N5qROMJv9BiCvKuJ/3Lz+qii1pgYUc\nLgmAeBs9etBK1pq78U7HnihaqABQcyT8vp+Sbhd2h6GInePdyW1nBov+WHFtx3Qu\nSKVtaZa8Nxupz/APJIMm11UVYPP+PDAaRzou96LBNMAPREOW1tqU8phR03i0t07w\n93OUE42u9b+IWBphuNAHVi8L40MwYHry63lhXAa8Ss26ldvvSN5rOL2QPTsAq07F\nn4QACSwu/JI/FGUK9+lQ3FMKQ/RCtifHgiGlPUaL61VKSdKK389lo1nquamM0Fg7\nKMbsV8qdCkmKFSeG994ocgA50VfDTJ5BCwaC08DTkiSHl1g3O2M/ud/M968h/egH\niQuO7Zv9J9c5JWeXCZTxcpFduaa38z4P+oJoyKMrRqcW34YiQ4RKll7zwfTF9d+c\ngZ6dpP3gDRLqApqIS1cGMExXVLIgwiAv2DdH54Ig+KEO8/rnFhvYG0Ir7b9oLoSm\nDxtQl/2Zd6JmyH2D/SNsVwlsawq2MOkIBeqEd2xUn/NqcIMFoFPmuvKf7D8WUSpP\n1SuT7yC4yWkvAyAICyVklfwe8uI0dJ01ItvnuHLFHNnWZigj0NbPIdEgk/8c6A