6146574738685cdb266"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/commits/35340e1a36f01e40818944d8e6db3086f5834092/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T00:56:28Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T00:56:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(build): add bdd/arch-test/mutation/vuln/api-lint Makefile targets (#50)\n\n.github/workflows/ci.yml has run bdd, arch-test, mutation-fast, mutation,\nvuln and api-lint as real blocking/scheduled jobs, but the Makefile had no\nmatching targets for any of them -- only `integration-kafka-testcontainers`\nexisted alongside the base check/check-all bundle. The Makefile header even\nclaimed \"v1 deliberately has NO mutation/bdd targets\", which was stale: the\njobs were already live in CI, just uninvokable locally, so `make check-all`\ncovered a fraction of what actually gates a merge.\n\nAdds bdd, arch-test, mutation-fast, mutation, vuln, api-lint targets\nmirroring their CI job bodies exactly, and brings check-all to\n`check + coverage + arch-test + bdd` to match the fleet''s own shape\n(inventory-storage, wes-work-planning, fulfillment-execution,\nworkforce-management, facility-layout all already do this).\n\nVerified locally: all six new targets pass (bdd, arch-test both green;\nvuln finds no vulnerabilities; api-lint clean on all three specs;\nmutation-fast measures 100% efficacy / 100% coverage on\ninternal/domain/performance).\n\nPart of the harness-engineering coverage expansion plan\n(.hermes/plans/2026-09-13_234500-harness-coverage-expansion.md), Phase 1\nTask 1.3.","tree":{"sha":"9ab4d5f0c1eb0c9aeb9daaf926e577da13740b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/9ab4d5f0c1eb0c9aeb9daaf926e577da13740b0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/35340e1a36f01e40818944d8e6db3086f5834092","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ab4d5f0c1eb0c9aeb9daaf926e577da13740b0e\nparent 04fab43b8d228019bbd27325d75d02ed26728736\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789347388 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789347388 -0300\n\nfeat(build): add bdd/arch-test/mutation/vuln/api-lint Makefile targets (#50)\n\n.github/workflows/ci.yml has run bdd, arch-test, mutation-fast, mutation,\nvuln and api-lint as real blocking/scheduled jobs, but the Makefile had no\nmatching targets for any of them -- only `integration-kafka-testcontainers`\nexisted alongside the base check/check-all bundle. The Makefile header even\nclaimed \"v1 deliberately has NO mutation/bdd targets\", which was stale: the\njobs were already live in CI, just uninvokable locally, so `make check-all`\ncovered a fraction of what actually gates a merge.\n\nAdds bdd, arch-test, mutation-fast, mutation, vuln, api-lint targets\nmirroring their CI job bodies exactly, and brings check-all to\n`check + coverage + arch-test + bdd` to match the fleet''s own shape\n(inventory-storage, wes-work-planning, fulfillment-execution,\nworkforce-management, facility-layout all already do this).\n\nVerified locally: all six new targets pass (bdd, arch-test both green;\nvuln finds no vulnerabilities; api-lint clean on all three specs;\nmutation-fast measures 100% efficacy / 100% coverage on\ninternal/domain/performance).\n\nPart of the harness-engineering coverage expansion plan\n(.hermes/plans/2026-09-13_234500-harness-coverage-expansion.md), Phase 1\nTask 1.3.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqp0Y8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3VoQAAAlJwAqZyQhBuoLhct7O1Io\n+cOsgon/VYVHhIaFGQu1KTk24XdEvCxPBdetLxaWv1URRF5hBHy//ZCuwFaP2lkP\n3iTdPTQS46kdoJrdtZRWS5ZmKGVR2nesfLshzYOScvndDOi0twZkfieAbCDSNRJv\nMyt+wY98WGjA4Fz1B8WzHSmF3KJuyzDLWZ/hMgQ8ZdtVmroHTEwIIhBCYvAfCPUT\nc0WqjJqnbB5twZZJeO6eyO+eE6KkqiMNFhP4H/fslu4OcXpso6OQnXqITgwrT082\nljFj1wGPI12+VjRGoQiRBh8uzVxPgJ50MeDlv7/vond592v7zjAkvEVLfPY+jCGj\nQA+LJLtz2mwiA+vdnOGPvohghS6xvop5MWtXox00JiU+8jo8n4DbotEk5YR1357q\nNM8uusWuj8ycBsRhz3tzqgKQSXKYEcprc3N21nUOtPvBBnjZ/+vDARn5oHgkZ9HP\nW5omFRUkkDck8b8KccycQZB4ly/S+ZbTO3JJNv4vK1jg1+wa3csk+CRWeU2V0onh\nEWStk0hmDQDyZJIT0/vOccDpwy0QtVMfBmJaGi8SK08swJAzpqwrD4qEMhQhwB6U\nxxDhulF0cPhsuDvEF3Y9eutK8qQxoZFgH4B/WAHIdyBezTwx8c4lAj6CXM4XoSnZ\nxh7g86YqltUHhneEk3Ep\n=iKaP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T00:56:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-