 is already on typescript ~7.0.2 in docs/, but docs/tsconfig.json\nextends @docusaurus/tsconfig, which still sets baseUrl in its own\nconfig (TS7 removed baseUrl entirely - TS5102). extends can''t drop an\ninherited option, so npm run typecheck in docs/ has been broken\n(silently, since this repo''s CI has no docs job).\n\nFix: inline the same settings @docusaurus/tsconfig provides, minus\nbaseUrl, keeping the existing ignoreDeprecations setting. paths alone\n(resolved relative to this tsconfig file) is sufficient for @site/*.\nVerified: npm run typecheck and npm run build both pass clean.","tree":{"sha":"3bcc884ba63d9f159ee939f3906f3555c72a1882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/trees/3bcc884ba63d9f159ee939f3906f3555c72a1882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/labor-performance/git/commits/23369e310510eca19c507858faa6d17ff58a7557","verification":{"payload":"tree 3bcc884ba63d9f159ee939f3906f3555c72a1882\nparent 1e8c9bf15859919879205d5cb3d645e4deac4eaf\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789303295 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789303295 -0300\n\nfix(docs): stop extending @docusaurus/tsconfig, TS7 rejects its baseUrl (#47)\n\nThis repo is already on typescript ~7.0.2 in docs/, but docs/tsconfig.json\nextends @docusaurus/tsconfig, which still sets baseUrl in its own\nconfig (TS7 removed baseUrl entirely - TS5102). extends can''t drop an\ninherited option, so npm run typecheck in docs/ has been broken\n(silently, since this repo''s CI has no docs job).\n\nFix: inline the same settings @docusaurus/tsconfig provides, minus\nbaseUrl, keeping the existing ignoreDeprecations setting. paths alone\n(resolved relative to this tsconfig file) is sufficient for @site/*.\nVerified: npm run typecheck and npm run build both pass clean.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqppn/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHcYQAGv/N/PL4lWbSAtEyeHz0X+n\nv6GxGxnWhlc/H4+blf9FGSglKqbx/CA/SpDOWx