":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:20:42Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:20:42Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Streamline frontend views and reporting UI\n\nThis refactor simplifies the React frontend by removing several advanced/admin-heavy UI blocks and reducing component complexity across Auth, Dashboard, Upload, Records, Reports, and Admin. It drops optional role-specific props and navigation handling, trims validation/report presentation to a lighter format, and simplifies branding/logo rendering.\n\nIt also updates `Frontend/index.html` with direct Mapbox map markup/scripts and embedded map container/styles, replacing the previous minimal app shell structure.","tree":{"sha":"a2045ce6d66f61a0b5856f6a48142e21d438eabf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/a2045ce6d66f61a0b5856f6a48142e21d438eabf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/f3a13ceee540d004933385a2bf7f90a817f300ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u