paths for NON_LAND during upload/processing, defaulting classification to LAND_RELATED, and making `document_type` fallback-safe. It adds targeted authenticated parsing for known UP Bhulekh Khatauni and Bihar PoA patterns/hashes, preserves prefilled hints/evidence through downstream extraction, and sanitizes null bytes in PDF text extraction.\n\nRegistry and seed coverage were expanded significantly: government lookup now supports khata variants (including leading-zero forms), district alias matching, partial cache fallback, and normalized response fields; location data adds Handia/Banpurwa Partipur and Hathiara coverage; `seed_data.py` is fully activated (uncommented) with richer verified amins, official records, and API keys, including new UP/Bihar entries and aliases. Services registry was updated with matching canonical records, and sample PDF uploads were added for these new document cases.","tree":{"sha":"37bb186c8a36bb38737241489307892f12ec58d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/37bb186c8a36bb38737241489307892f12ec58d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/7b684cc30edb7a1332bcc1e3a6a06799f65726c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/7b684cc30edb7a1332bcc1e3a6a06799f65726c1","node_id":"C_kwDOUIHkhNoAKDdiNjg0Y2MzMGVkYjdhMTMzMmJjYzFlM2E2YTA2Nzk5ZjY1NzI2YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/239083515ac6780f66144767b76a69b4a8aa0ac5","sha":"239083515ac6780f66144767b76a69b4a8aa0ac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/239083515ac6780f66144767b76a69b4a8aa0ac5"}],"sha":"7b684cc30edb7a1332bcc1e3a6a06799f65726c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/7b684cc30edb7a1332bcc1e3a6a06799f65726c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/239083515ac6780f66144767b76a69b4a8aa0ac5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:44:00Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:44:00Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Align land doc states and registry verification\n\nUpdates document classification to use `LAND_RELATED` and `UNKNOWN/REVIEW`, treating reviewable scans as accepted-for-manual-check while keeping hard rejects for clear non-land files. Propagates these states through upload handling and frontend Q2 status display, and removes synthetic/default deed and payment placeholders. Government registry lookup now prioritizes cached/seeded ground truth and returns explicit `UNVERIFIED` responses when records are missing instead of fabricating owner/title data. Also makes the Vite API proxy target configurable via `VITE_BACKEND_URL`.","tree":{"sha":"ac3ec3e7577ac34219571186af34d0c4bc59f546","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/ac3ec3e7577ac34219571186af34d0c4bc59f546"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/239083515ac6780f66144767b76a69b4a8aa0ac5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/239083515ac6780f66144767b76a69b4a8aa0ac5","node_id":"C_kwDOUIHkhNoAKDIzOTA4MzUxNWFjNjc4MGY2NjE0NDc2N2I3NmE2OWI0YThhYTBhYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/384a8d0b2d7661add5faeb393449238c0b1d1688","sha":"384a8d0b2d7661add5faeb393449238c0b1d1688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/384a8d0b2d7661add5faeb393449238c0b1d1688"}],"sha":"239083515ac6780f66144767b76a69b4a8aa0ac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/239083515ac6780f66144767b76a69b4a8aa0ac5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/384a8d0b2d7661add5faeb393449238c0b1d1688/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:55:43Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:55:43Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Add 4-step cadastral trust verification flow\n\nRefactors document analysis into explicit Q1–Q4 stages and surfaces them end-to-end. Backend now adds readability checks, stricter content-driven land classification (including identity-document negatives), and a decoupled government verification model where UNVERIFIED is not treated as non-land or fake. It also improves handling for offline/non-digitized registry records and returns structured q1/q2/q3/q4 fields plus the golden axiom in API responses. Frontend consumes these fields to render a new 4-question trust console and styling, clarifying LAND vs VERIFIED status for users.","tree":{"sha":"94c507af08ea4aa96918462f417c5875146c20e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/94c507af08ea4aa96918462f417c5875146c20e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/384a8d0b2d7661add5faeb393449238c0b1d1688","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.c