","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/a01f537b94c2a30418028cfc41e2cf22bbf5bb04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T03:24:45Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T03:24:45Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Add local startup scripts and API failover\n\nBackend now supports serving the built frontend SPA (with asset mounting and route fallback), expands CORS origin matching, and enriches root/API health-style responses. Frontend API handling was upgraded with multi-endpoint discovery, retry/failover logic, active-base tracking, and a reconnect health check surfaced in the auth error UI. Vite dev server config now exposes host mode and proxies /api requests, and new Windows batch scripts plus a backend requirements.txt were added to simplify local setup and startup.","tree":{"sha":"010aacf95317d4d3837450cd88d7ea5cf07508dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/010aacf95317d4d3837450cd88d7ea5cf07508dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/a01f537b94c2a30418028cfc41e2cf22bbf5bb04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other