,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/c78cba51c0ccf6e058a6d21e4a5a9754565ee77f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:13:05Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:13:05Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Add verification flow and stricter doc checks\n\nIntroduces a new seeded government data layer (`seed_data.py`) for verified amins, official land records, and API keys, and wires it into app startup. Admin registration now requires and validates a government Amin ID, stores verification metadata, and blocks duplicate Amin usage.\n\nHardens document handling by enforcing strict file extension checks, rejecting source code/non-land content, and requiring stronger cadastral signals (including detectable Khata/Khasra) before extraction. Adds a 4-step verification flow endpoint and enriches analyze-preview responses with verification audit details and real database lookups. Frontend updates send API keys automatically, support Amin-ID-based admin signup, expose new verification APIs, and surface verification-flow UI feedback.","tree":{"sha":"914aa96b8f3b3283f1d50130b24cb5675862e6d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/914aa96b8f3b3283f1d50130b24cb5675862e6d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/c78cba51c0ccf6e058a6d21e4a5a9754565ee77f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/c78cba51c0ccf6e058a6d21e4a5a9754565ee77f","node_id":"C_kwDOUIHkhNoAKGM3OGNiYTUxYzBjY2Y2ZTA1OGE2ZDIxZTRhNWE5NzU0NTY1ZWU3N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/2e8f4fd14b49306df7ba5c85f666bd2397d6b833","sha":"2e8f4fd14b49306df7ba5c85f666bd2397d6b833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/2e8f4fd14b49306df7ba5c85f666bd2397