g now treats manual metadata as optional hints, stores extracted intelligence, and carries it through OCR/validation outputs.\n\nUpdates the frontend upload experience to run automatic analysis on file selection, prefill fields from extracted data, show an AI intelligence summary card, and make manual review/fine-tuning optional instead of blocking. Also removes the Integrations tab/routes from navigation.","tree":{"sha":"d13e60f9efb4be5e41f59d0623da96614b49d292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/d13e60f9efb4be5e41f59d0623da96614b49d292"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/76114434a872fdc6e47938908816004fd4f41c95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/76114434a872fdc6e47938908816004fd4f41c95","node_id":"C_kwDOUIHkhNoAKDc2MTE0NDM0YTg3MmZkYzZlNDc5Mzg5MDg4MTYwMDRmZDRmNDFjOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/50c205a1c1bde5062937699b1ef476ebd29a4e32","sha":"50c205a1c1bde5062937699b1ef476ebd29a4e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/50c205a1c1bde5062937699b1ef476ebd29a4e32"}],"sha":"76114434a872fdc6e47938908816004fd4f41c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/76114434a872fdc6e47938908816004fd4f41c95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/50c205a1c1bde5062937699b1ef476ebd29a4e32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T11:02:10Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T11:02:10Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Expand Bihar GIS and district location coverage\n\nAdds full Bihar district coverage to backend location datasets, including many new subdivisions and locality entries, and expands centroid mappings to all Bihar districts (with alias names like district/city variants). GIS parcel lookup now better resolves district names by handling parenthetical variants and partial matches before fallback coordinates. The frontend district selector now shows how many districts are available for the selected state.","tree":{"sha":"59249ee4242f51bbc2ca9611217201a930081b18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/59249ee4242f51bbc2ca9611217201a930081b18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/50c205a1c1bde5062937699b1ef476ebd29a4e32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/50c205a1c1bde5062937699b1ef476ebd29a4e32","node_id":"C_kwDOUIHkhNoAKDUwYzIwNWExYzFiZGU1MDYyOTM3Njk5YjFlZjQ3NmViZDI5YTRlMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commit/dcf873e041d0205ded0a49703b1b31329a7ad7e6","sha":"dcf873e041d0205ded0a49703b1b31329a7ad7e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/dcf873e041d0205ded0a49703b1b31329a7ad7e6"}],"sha":"50c205a1c1bde5062937699b1ef476ebd29a4e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/50c205a1c1bde5062937699b1ef476ebd29a4e32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/dcf873e041d0205ded0a49703b1b31329a7ad7e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T18:28:56Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T18:28:56Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Add admin controls and overview endpoints\n\nIntroduces new admin backend APIs to update user role/status and fetch a system overview (user/record metrics, gateway health, recent audit logs). The frontend now consumes these APIs with a redesigned Admin Console for KPI cards, user search/filtering, role reassignment, account suspend/activate actions, and audit trail display. It also improves live government registry lookup handling in Upload (relaxed required inputs, loading/error handling, sync support), routes admins to the admin view by default, updates role-based navigation, and includes a dummy PDF upload file for verification testing.","tree":{"sha":"6272e22bb6abb4bd231a0b262a7eb3292eb4ca9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/6272e22bb6abb4bd231a0b262a7eb3292eb4ca9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/dcf873e041d0205ded0a49703b1b31329a7ad7e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/s