--From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/d3e4300b388a2e53407828550d1087877aa28df8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T17:02:11Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T17:02:11Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Add gov registry lookup and human verify flow\n\nIntroduces a new government registry integration service and API routes for live state portal lookup, portal listing, and manual record verification decisions (approve/reject/survey requested) with audit and status propagation updates. Updates record search to include record_id and ULPIN, wires document processing to use claimed owner/area in ground-truth lookup, and adds frontend API/client support plus a Human Verification modal workflow in Records. Also handles 401 responses by clearing session storage and emitting a session-expired event.","tree":{"sha":"d5a082af4b25c16567cead039e928e93cb7f88a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/d5a082af4b25c16567cead039e928e93cb7f88a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/d3e4300b388a2e53407828550d1087877aa28df8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rguptaprofile","id":194687497,"login":"rguptaprofile","node_id":"U_kgDOC5qyCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.