.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/commits/4d47a55a5a894d31df8c7283096d25ff9534853f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T11:06:41Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T11:06:41Z","email":"rahul_ua2503cdh466@iitp.ac.in","name":"Rahul  Gupta"},"message":"Expand registry APIs and enforce upload fields\n\nAdds new backend endpoints for government location data, parcel lookup, and integration status, and strengthens document upload validation with strict mandatory field checks and clearer file/empty-upload errors. The validation pipeline is enhanced with richer cadastral ground-truth modeling, improved fraud/dispute/PoA checks, field-level confidence output, and AI learning feedback metrics capture. Frontend updates wire these APIs into the app with cascading location selectors, mandatory-field UX, ground-truth preview, an Integrations view, and expanded dashboard/verification/repository/report interfaces with stronger fallback datasets and richer operational UI.","tree":{"sha":"051268ca765af3b47e51606212ed32085ff1ab72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/trees/051268ca765af3b47e51606212ed32085ff1ab72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rguptaprofile/NIRVIVAAD---From-Disputed-to-Nirvivaad/git/commits/4d47a55a5a894d31df8c7283096d25ff9534853f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194687497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rguptaprofile