56/Catalog.App/commit/ab5770dfab506207353dfe39dcfc4f67c41c0f68","sha":"ab5770dfab506207353dfe39dcfc4f67c41c0f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karthik5656/Catalog.App/commits/ab5770dfab506207353dfe39dcfc4f67c41c0f68"}],"sha":"1982e0f3dae5a8508d354f9db91a089ba96d4bd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karthik5656/Catalog.App/commits/1982e0f3dae5a8508d354f9db91a089ba96d4bd6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61219228?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karthik5656","id":61219228,"login":"karthik5656","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjE5MjI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik5656","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karthik5656/Catalog.App/commits/ab5770dfab506207353dfe39dcfc4f67c41c0f68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:03:44Z","email":"61219228+karthik5656@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karthik5656"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:03:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MFE Configuration (#5)\n\n* MFE Configuration\n\n* feat: add @types/node dependency to package.json and update pnpm-lock.yaml\n\n* corrected ports\n\n* cicd -update (#6)\n\n* cicd -update\n\n* ci: remove branch filter from CI pipeline to trigger on PRs to all branches\n\nThe branches restriction limited the pipeline to only PRs targeting\nmain/master, causing only the AI code review workflow to run for PRs\nto other branches. Tests and Docker builds now run regardless of\ntarget branch.\n\n* ci: comment out test jobs, add Docker image PR comments with auto-cleanup\n\n- Comment out test-backend and test-frontend jobs (preserved for re-enablement)\n- Remove test job dependencies from publish-containers job\n- Add step to collect built Docker image tags and post as PR comment table\n- Auto-delete previous CI image comments on new commits using HTML marker\n- Add pull-requests: write permission for PR commenting\n\n* fix: bump Node from 20 to 22 for Vite 8 compatibility\n\nVite 8.2.2 uses node:sqlite internally (module-runner), which is only\navailable in Node 22.5+. Node 20 fails with ERR_UNKNOWN_BUILTIN_MODULE.\n\n- Update all 3 frontend Dockerfiles to node:22-alpine\n- Update commented-out CI test-frontend job to node-version 22\n\n* fix(ci): fix PR comment script interpolation and add issues write permissions\n\n- Replace inline backtick template interpolation with environment variable parsing in github-script step to prevent JS SyntaxError\n- Add `issues: write` workflow permission for PR comment creation and cleanup via GitHub REST API\n\n* ci(workflows): add PR number to Docker tags and cleanup GHCR images on PR close\n\n- Update ci-pipeline.yml to format Docker image tags as `pr<PR_NUMBER>-<SHORT_SHA>`\n- Refactor PR commenting step to cleanly pass built image tags via environment variables\n- Update delete-merged-branch.yml to automatically delete PR-tagged Docker images from GHCR when a PR is closed or merged\n\n* fix delete merged branch","tree":{"sha":"9a1f2df2a391ef24fc7312ddb31692939e8e9444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karthik5656/Catalog.App/git/trees/9a1f2df2a391ef24fc7312ddb31692939e8e9444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karthik5656/Catalog.App/git/commits/ab5770dfab506207353dfe39dcfc4f67c41c0f68","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a1f2df2a391ef24fc7312ddb31692939e8e9444\nparent 22d7583e1ca990748344dbdcf59fae498e8c68e4\nauthor karthik5656 <61219228+karthik5656@users.noreply.github.com> 1788206624 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788206624 +0530\n\nMFE Configuration (#5)\n\n* MFE Configuration\n\n* feat: add @types/node dependency to package.json and update pnpm-lock.yaml\n\n* corrected ports\n\n* cicd -update (#6)\n\n* cicd -update\n\n* ci: remove branch filter from CI pipeline to trigger on PRs to all branches\n\nThe branches restriction limited the pipeline to only PRs targeting\nmain/master, causing only the AI code review workflow to run for PRs\nto other branches. Tests and Docker builds now run regardless of\ntarget branch.\n\n* ci: comment out test jobs, add Docker image PR comments with auto-cleanup\n\n- Comment out test-backend and test-frontend jobs (preserved for re-enablement)\n- Remove test job dependencies from publish-containers job\n- Add step to collect built Docker image tags and post as PR comment table\n- Auto-delete previous CI image comments on new commits using HTML marker\n- Add pull-requests: write permission for PR commenting\n\n* fix: bump Node from 20 to 22 for Vite 8 compatibility\n\nVite 8.2.2 uses node:sqlite internally (module-runner), which is only\navailable in Node 22.5+. Node 20 fails with ERR_UNKNOWN_BUILTIN_MODULE.\n\n- Update all 3 frontend Dockerfiles to node:22-alpine\n- Update commented-out CI test-frontend job to node-version 22\n\n* fix(ci): fix PR comment script interpolation and add issues write permissions\n\n- Replace inline backtick template interpolation with environment variable parsing in github-script step to prevent JS SyntaxError\n- Add `issues: write` workflow permission for PR comment creation and cleanup via GitHub REST API\n\n* ci(workflows): add PR number to Docker tags and cleanup GHCR images on PR close\n\n- Update ci-pipeline.yml to format Docker image tags as `pr<PR_NUMBER>-<SHORT_SHA>`\n- Refactor PR commenting step to cleanly pass built image tags via environment variables\n- Update delete-merged-branch.yml to automatically delete PR-tagged Docker images from GHCR when a PR is closed or merged\n\n* fix delete merged branch","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqld4gCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkFcQAIHbAZYzRM2wKSsGJgmwmJ6k\nBlTYMGZG99UMqyZ0a0jNznB1aVmyfGTrRbiZpQX7FlAx5h8F+iksB9jULKJslVAA\n1r6WuJxb4qZsI9TZRbDloUimiaWVVC00fjoWiH43Z/21uECieyv3KMgXBL0qX3YT\nTxpOlY0FIQEbYZRkPi/lHWMM5l7nbSLpVjRnFHiqLCZwPte/Aa1o6aNsELU8YsCH\nKACb5V2fTer+lOZAVDgz00KpN0iAbOOBN26jzyf1yQBpx6knFaCP4MgOHR9U7Xqy\nIgUNay1tUU7s0jo5SNBGZ4zQecrH8WRn7hDEAvl6qvjxkDBi1rQNqWUoMJqXW36h\nn1g3vTGVMJwdO2ex/PCNkEVdlDjAPL1AwhKyqPFtw9W+toB7oVCOIgirRRBIjmKq\n/BuTgbzYRka8h0JtcNArmsRPUe1oXFchUDZuhbV4G8jkS5TvnUA8VT2V4+xwl48d\n/ACu1dLp0c6+vHEGjjk7UvQO/TzsUA9Th4ppbjPYLMNFgHAD07UpQGjwnJBkHYpg\nnr3kZ0uHE83imS1BR9uNVIaHVnXnv2vttoijKAaWlf66ZxHdSY01u+nBraWDrZ+L\nTmi8i1o8dyf1ecXe088838wriTpR/luo3LAzomnDzNUSpeWAPBytYjbnTNrlALv2\nh6hiUlOiu9KTqTx/0k6c\n=i3+s\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T20:03:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/sub