ic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranshuchittora/awesome-ai-devtools-1/commits/5d6e01dc43f8815bfad13f771554c67cc0c9e241/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T22:07:28Z","email":"jamesmurdza@users.noreply.github.com","name":"James Murdza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T22:07:28Z","email":"jamesmurdza@users.noreply.github.com","name":"James Murdza"},"message":"Simplify verbose and marketing-heavy descriptions\n\nRemove marketing fluff and redundant phrasing from 10 tool descriptions:\n- trae: Remove \"transforms how you work, collaborating with you to run faster\"\n- GoCodeo: Remove \"effortlessly\" and \"seamless\"\n- Android Studio Bot: Remove repetitive \"Studio Bot is... Studio Bot can help\"\n- FlyonUI MCP: Remove \"craft stunning\" marketing language\n- shadcn/studio MCP: Remove \"craft stunning\" marketing language\n- Polymet: Remove \"easily\" and \"without any design experience\"\n- CodeParrot: Remove \"fits perfectly\" and \"All without any prompting\"\n- Wren AI: Remove exclamation mark and informal tone\n- Pieces: Replace vague \"enhancing productivity\" with specific features\n- DiagramGPT: Remove repetitive \"DiagramGPT is... The tool can...\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c35addbaca8e43a1f8f3a4619c4a0ace4b49e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranshuchittora/awesome-ai-devtools-1/git/trees/7c35addbaca8e43a1f8f3a4619c4a0ace4b49e15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranshuchittora/awesome-ai-devtools-1/git/commits/5d6e01dc43f8815bfad13f771554c67cc0c9e241","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33395784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmurdza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmurdza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmurdza/following{/other_us